                new (
                    "00TQx0000050bhaMAA",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Meetings with DK MoFA",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-01-09").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Meetings with DK MoFA",
                        Description = "To: mikaelag@unops.org\nCC: michaelri@unops.org; asbjornb@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Meetings with DK MoFA\nBody:\nHi Mikaela, \nPerfect. Thank you for the folder. I will liaise with Alexandra Nielsen. \nBest,Naimo\n\nOn Mon, Jan 8, 2024 at 4:30 PM Mikaela SOLFRID GERKMAN <mikaelag@unops.org> wrote:\nHello Naimo, \nI hope that you are off to a great start of 2024!\n\nMany thanks for sharing this, super helpful to know. I've created the folder here for the meeting on the 16 January, and would be grateful for your inputs for Jorge's meeting. \nAs for Sonja's meeting, Alexandra Nielsen has recently started supporting her, and I would therefore recommend liaising with Alex on their preferences. \nAll the best, Mikaela\nMikaela Gerkman | Partnerships Analyst | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ Copenhagen, Denmark | Office: 5.3.26 | www.unops.org \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.\n\nOn Mon, Jan 8, 2024 at 2:23 PM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Mikaela and Michael, \nJorge has a meeting with Marie-Louise Wegter, Director of Multilateral Cooperation on January 16, and Sonja is scheduled to meet with Ole Thonke, Undersecretary for Development Policy. Could you kindly help me create folders for the meetings? Or should I create the folder for Sonja myself?  Best, Naimo\n\nOn Mon, Jan 8, 2024 at 2:04 PM Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Sarah, \nRikke from the DK MoFA called me back to say that given the bilateral meeting between Marie-Louise and Jorge on 16 January, there would be no need for a broader meeting involving Ulla, Flemming, Raad etc. on January 19. The DK MoFA would reach out bilaterally to Ulla and Flemming to discuss UN City issues specifically. \nThis means that for UNOPS we now have the following in the calendar: January 16: Bilateral intro meeting/lunch between Jorge and director for multilateral affairs, Marie-Louise  January 19: Bilateral intro meeting between Sonja and undersecretary for development, Ole ThonkeI hope this clarifies. :-) \nBest,AsbjørnAsbjørn Brink | Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
