                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-01-09").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Fwd: VAT over-claimed and under-claimed amounts for 2016 and 2017 (UNOPS)",
                        Description = "To: rikoln@um.dk\nCC: vilhelmk@unops.org; naimoh@unops.org; HannaP@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: VAT over-claimed and under-claimed amounts for 2016 and 2017 (UNOPS)\nBody:\nKære Rikke\nHar I mon haft mulighed for at se på nedenstående henvendelse? \nJeg beklager på forhånd meget, hvis jeg har overset en mail fra jeres protokol. \nPå forhånd mange tak. \nMvhAsbjørn\n\nOn Thu, Nov 9, 2023 at 9:05 PM Rikke Enggaard Olsen <rikoln@um.dk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKære Asbjørn,\n\n \nTak for din mail, som er sendt videre. Forventer at I vil høre direkte fra vore kollegaer i Protokollen.\n \nBedste hilsner,\nRikke\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: 09 November 2023 19:17\n\nTo: Rikke Enggaard Olsen <rikoln@um.dk>\n\nCc: Vilhelm KLARESKOV <vilhelmk@unops.org>; Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Fwd: VAT over-claimed and under-claimed amounts for 2016 and 2017 (UNOPS)\n\n\n \n[CAUTION - EXTERNAL EMAIL] This email was sent from outside the MFA organisation. DO NOT reply, click on\n links, or open attachments unless you have verified the sender and know the content is safe.\n\n\nHej Rikke \n\n \n\n\nKan du venligst hjælpe mig med at dirigere denne henvendelse til rette personer i UM? \n\n\n \n\n\nPå forhånd mange tak. \n\n\n \n\n\nMvh\n\n\nAsbjørn \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\n\nFrom: Claus Christensen <Claus.Christensen@sktst.dk>\n\nDate: Mon, Oct 23, 2023 at 10:21 AM\n\nSubject: SV: VAT over-claimed and under-claimed amounts for 2016 and 2017 (UNOPS)\n\nTo: Vilhelm KLARESKOV <vilhelmk@unops.org>\n\n \n\n\n\nDear Vilhelm\n \nWe have been in contact with the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Denmark, who handles requests regarding VAT for organizations such as UNOPS.\n\n \nTherefore, you request regarding the correction of VAT for 2016 and 2017 will be handled by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Denmark, and any questions you\n have regarding the request can be directed to them.\n \n\nVenlig hilsen/kind regards\n \nClaus Christensen\nFuldmægtig\nSP 06 - Fonde og foreninger\n \n+45 72 38 98 75\nClaus.Christensen@sktst.dk\n \n\n \nSkattestyrelsen\nLauritzens Plads 1, 9000 Aalborg\nwww.sktst.dk\n \nSådan\n behandler vi persondata\nSkattestyrelsen er en del af Skatteforvaltningen\n\n \n\n\nFra: Vilhelm KLARESKOV <vilhelmk@unops.org>\n\n\nSendt: 9. oktober 2023 15:29\n\nTil: Claus Christensen <Claus.Christensen@sktst.dk>\n\nCc: Claudia ACHENBACH-HAMMAD <ClaudiaA@unops.org>\n\nEmne: Re: VAT over-claimed and under-claimed amounts for 2016 and 2017 (UNOPS)\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDenne e-mail kommer fra internettet. Den er således ikke nødvendigvis fra en intern kilde, selvom afsenderadressen kan indikere det.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Claus,\n\n\n \n\n\nI inquired with colleagues, and it turns out that in 2016/2017 physical invoices and bank proofs were sent to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs by mail. I am not aware\n of a unique identifier included in these submissions.\n\n\n \n\n\nLater on, the Ministry created the ProMON platform which allows UNOPS to upload invoices and proofs of payment (please see enclosed screenshot of UNOPS institution\n information in ProMon).\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nI hope this helps to pursue this matter further. \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nRegards,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\nVilhelm Klareskov\n| Head of Financial Performance Management and Reporting | Finance Group\n| UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | www.unops.org\n\n \n\nFollow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. Subscribe\n to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Wed, Oct 4, 2023 at 2:05 PM Claus Christensen <Claus.Christensen@sktst.dk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Vilhelm,\n \nI must admit that I am not familiar with the rules regarding whether it is a requirement for UN organizations to have a CVR number. I did assume the organization\n had one, since you write that you have claimed both less and more VAT than the organization is entitled to. Therefore, the organization must have declared VAT, which is usually done using a CVR number.\n \nIf you do not have a CVR-number, do you have a SE-number or similar, that has been used when declaring VAT? If not, how did/does the organization declare VAT?\n \n \n\nVenlig hilsen/Regards\n \nClaus Christensen\nFuldmægtig\nSP 06 - Fonde og foreninger\n \n+45 72 38 98 75\nClaus.Christensen@sktst.dk\n \n\n \nSkattestyrelsen\nLauritzens\n Plads 1, 9000 Aalborg\nwww.sktst.dk\n \nSådan\n behandler vi persondata\nSkattestyrelsen\n er en del af Skatteforvaltningen\n\n \n\n\nFra:\n Vilhelm KLARESKOV <vilhelmk@unops.org> \n\nSendt: 3. oktober 2023 16:08\n\nTil: Claus Christensen <Claus.Christensen@sktst.dk>\n\nCc: Claudia ACHENBACH-HAMMAD <ClaudiaA@unops.org>\n\nEmne: Re: VAT over-claimed and under-claimed amounts for 2016 and 2017 (UNOPS)\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDenne\n e-mail kommer fra internettet. Den er således ikke nødvendigvis fra en intern kilde, selvom afsenderadressen kan indikere det.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear\n Claus,\n\n\n \n\n\nThank\n you for the confirmation of receipt.\n\n\n \n\n\nI\n understand that while some UN organizations have opted to have a CVR number, I have been informed that UNOPS is not amongst these (noting that this is not a requirement for UN organizations).\n\n\n \n\n\nPlease\n do not hesitate to let us know if there is any other information needed on your end. \n\n\n<s",
                        Location = null,
