                        Subject = "Allocate Northern Europe Liaison Accounts to Asbjorn",
                        Description = "Hi Jose, \n\nIt would be great if we could switch the user for the northern Europe Liaison Accounts to Asbjorn. And then add Naimo as part of the Account team. \n\nThanks!\nMichael",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
