                        Subject = "Email: For Emilie's approval: Briefing package for Jorge's meeting with the Permanent Representative, Ambassador of the Permanent Mission of Finland to the UN, Elina KALKKU",
                        Description = "To: mikaelag@unops.org\nCC: asbjornb@unops.org; michaelri@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: For Emilie's approval: Briefing package for Jorge's meeting with the Permanent Representative, Ambassador of the Permanent Mission of Finland to the UN, Elina KALKKU\nBody:\nHi Mikaela,\n\nPlease find here for Emilie's approval Jorge's briefing package for the meeting with the Permanent Representative, Ambassador of the Permanent Mission of Finland to the United Nations, Elina KALKKU scheduled for 25 January 2024. \nThe package has been approved by Asbjørn \n\nBest regards, \nNaimo\n-- \n\nNaimo Hassan Hirsi | Partnerships Analyst | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 26 83 48 78  | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
