                        Description = "To: croberts@gavi.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: catch up\nBody:\nHi Corina! Great to bump into you in the Oberson cafe the other day - what a nice surprise! I had never heard of this place - it seems a local hotspot for UK mission folk ;)I will be at GHC this Thursday 1st Feb - are you around? It would be lovely to catch upHope you are doing well !\nLooking forward to hearing from you!\nAll best wishes, Louise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
