                        Subject = "Email: Re: PNG unavoidable termination costs - earlier termination notice",
                        Description = "To: andrewk@unops.org\nCC: marionc@unops.org; jean-francoisl@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: PNG unavoidable termination costs - earlier termination notice\nBody:\nMorning all! I hope you all had a good weekend. Do we need to regroup internally on this issue before we go to GHC to speak with the Global Fund on Thursday?Thanks and best wishes Louise \n\nOn Fri, 26 Jan 2024 at 19:48, Andrew KIRKWOOD <andrewk@unops.org> wrote:\nThis process started a while back with the termination letter. What we want to do when we meet them is raise the stakes by discussing the framework agreement.Andrew Kirkwood (he/him) | Geneva Office Director | +41 795203669 | www.unops.org\n\nOn Fri, 26 Jan 2024 at 18:35 Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org> wrote:\nHi MarionThanks for the cc. I thought this is what we were going to Gf next week to discuss ?!\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Marion CASSEN STRIMBU <marionc@unops.org>\nDate: Fri, 26 Jan 2024 at 17:44\nSubject: Re: PNG unavoidable termination costs - earlier termination notice\nTo: Manon Van Rijswijk <Manon.VanRijswijk@theglobalfund.org>\nCc: Olena Tokar <Olena.Tokar@theglobalfund.org>, Raïssa Koné <Raissa.Kone@theglobalfund.org>, Louise Jocelyn LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\nDear Manon, \nWe have obtained the required approvals for the termination of our personnel in PNG. \nOur unavoidable and incompressible direct outstanding costs linked to the earlier termination period in PNG are as follow by cost category:- Personnel: 33,175 usd- Office space and secure parking rental: 2,700 usdTotal direct cost to UNOPS: 35,875 usd\nWe acknowledge that the handover report budget granted to UNOPS will cover 5,896 usd.\nBalance of direct costs to be covered by TGF: 29,979 usd\nWe count on your support and will be expecting a revised termination letter.\nWith kind regards,\n\nMarionMs. Marion Cassen Strîmbu | Portfolio & Partnerships Manager | Advisory Services PortfolioUNOPS Geneva Office11-13, chemin des\nAnémones, 1219 Châtelaine - Geneva, Switzerland\n\n\n\n\n\nTel: +41 22 917 8557 | Skype:\nmarion_cassen | www.unops.org \n\nOn Thu, Jan 18, 2024 at 1:10 PM Manon Van Rijswijk <Manon.VanRijswijk@theglobalfund.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Marion,\n \nThank you for your swift response. Next week works well for us.\n \nBest regards,\n \nManon\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nManon Van Rijswijk\nSpecialist, Category Management, Supply Operations\nIndirect Sourcing\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nM: +41795057199\n\n\n\n\nT: +41587911877\n\n\n\n\nmanon.vanrijswijk@theglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\ntheglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Marion CASSEN STRIMBU <marionc@unops.org> \n\nSent: Wednesday, January 17, 2024 5:48 PM\n\nTo: Manon Van Rijswijk <Manon.VanRijswijk@theglobalfund.org>\n\nCc: Elin Bos <Elin.Bos@theglobalfund.org>; Helen Kidd <Helen.Kidd@theglobalfund.org>; Janice Betz <Janice.Betz@theglobalfund.org>; Nicolas Cantau <Nicolas.Cantau@theglobalfund.org>; Olena Tokar <Olena.Tokar@theglobalfund.org>; Raïssa Koné <Raissa.Kone@theglobalfund.org>\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS LFA IQC contract\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments\n unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Manon,  \n\n \n\n\nI have shared our preliminary unavoidable costs with Olena. I am pending the final clearance from our HQ for termination of personnel, which will confirm the exact effective date when our HR liability stops. \n\n\nKindly allow me until end of the week to revert. \n\n\nShould you need estimates by then for the purpose of discussion, you may use the ones shared with Olena earlier.\n\n\n \n\n\nKind regards\n\n\n \n\n\nMarion\n\n\n\n\nMs. Marion Cassen Strîmbu | Portfolio\n & Partnerships Manager | Advisory Services Portfolio\nUNOPS Geneva Office\n11-13, chemin des Anémones, 1219 Châtelaine - Geneva, Switzerland\nTel: +41 22 917 8557 | Skype: marion_cassen | www.unops.org \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Wed, Jan 17, 2024 at 5:42 PM Manon Van Rijswijk <Manon.VanRijswijk@theglobalfund.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Marion,\n \nI hope you are doing well.\nBest wishes for new year.\n \nAs discussed with Olena, please share the costs of services which cannot be discontinued immediately in 2024. We will discuss\n internally. Should such termination costs be allowable, the termination letter will be revised accordingly.\n \nShould you have any questions please let me know,\nThank you,\n \nBest regards,\n \nManon\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nManon Van Rijswijk\nSpecialist, Category Management, Supply Operations\nIndirect Sourcing\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nM: +41795057199\n\n\n\n\nT: +41587911877\n\n\n\n\nmanon.vanrijswijk@theglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\ntheglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Marion CASSEN STRIMBU <marionc@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, December 22, 2023 12:03 PM\n\nTo: Manon Van Rijswijk <Manon.VanRijswijk@theglobalfund.org>\n\nCc: Elin Bos <Elin.Bos@theglobalfund.org>; Helen Kidd <Helen.Kidd@theglobalfund.org>; Janice Betz <Janice.Betz@theglobalfund.org>;\n Nicolas Cantau <Nicolas.Cantau@theglobalfund.org>; Olena Tokar <Olena.Tokar@theglobalfund.org>; Raïssa Koné <Raissa.Kone@theglobalfund.org>\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS LFA IQC contract\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments\n unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Manon,\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you for the notice. \n\n\n \n\n\nWe note however that the termination minimum period of 3 months foreseen in our framework contract agreement is not respected.\n\n\n \n\n\nOur legal group will need to advise.\n\n\n \n\n\nKind regards,\n\n\n \n\n\nMarion\n\n\n\n\n\nMs. Marion Cassen Strîmbu | Portfolio\n & Partnerships Manager | Advisory Services Portfolio\nUNOPS Geneva Office\n11-13, chemin des Anémones, 1219 Châtelaine - Geneva, Switzerland\nTel: +41 22 917 8557 | Skype: marion_cassen | www.unops.org \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nLe ven. 22 déc. 2023 à 09:48, Manon Van Rijswijk <Manon.VanRijswijk@theglobalfund.org> a écrit :\n\n\n\n\nDear Marion,\n \nThank you for your patience. The RFP process for Papua New Guinea took longer than anticipated.\n \nEnclosed is the termination notice for the aforementioned portfolio. Termination shall become effective as of 15 February\n 2024. During the termination period starting on 1 January 2024 and ending on 15 February 2024, provision of handover activities will be required.\n \nThe Country Team will contact you with regards to the handover plan.\n \nI would like to thank you for your service to the Global Fund in Papua New Guinea over the previous years.\n \nBest regards,\n \nManon\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nManon Van Rijswijk\nSpecialist, Category Management, Supply Operations\nIndirect Sourcing\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nM: +41795057199\n\n\n\n\nT: +41587911877\n\n\n\n\nmanon.vanrijswijk@theglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\ntheglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n<div style=\"border-width:1p",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx000005tKwEMAU",
