                        Subject = "Email: Cameroon and catch up",
                        Description = "To: lrey@gavi.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Cameroon and catch up\nBody:\nDear Lynda\nFurther to the message I sent you on Linked In (apologies for referring to you as FPM, I meant SCM of course!)\nAs an ex-Gavi and WHO IVB myself, I'd love to catch up and hear about the portfolio in Cameroon. We also have our Country Director Dr Tatiana Wah in town the week of 26 Feb. week, who I understand you've been in touch with. Would you be available to meet on 27 or 29 Feb in the afternoon?\nI am currently working with Amy LaTrielle and Jack in Legal to finalise a Framework Agreement (in addition to our existing Memo of Understanding) to facilitate engagement going forward.\nHope to hear from you soonAll best wishesLouise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
