                new (
                    "00TQx000006cHR0MAM",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Detailed showcase for Brown Bag with UNOPS",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-02-12").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Detailed showcase for Brown Bag with UNOPS",
                        Description = "To: Philippa.DobreeCarey@theglobalfund.org\nCC: Daniel.DeLaTorre@theglobalfund.org; elenali@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Detailed showcase for Brown Bag with UNOPS\nBody:\nDear PhilippaThanks for your message, please confirm you received the video clips I sent on Friday - are any of these useful to you?Thanks for letting us know and speak soon!\nBest wishes Louise \n\nOn Fri, 9 Feb 2024 at 16:37, Philippa Dobrée-Carey <Philippa.DobreeCarey@theglobalfund.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHi Louise\n \nI received the bios from Elena.  Did you want to send me anything else before I craft the final message to send out to teams?\nWe had discussed including an appropriate link or two to videos showing UNOPS’ work in the field. Did you find any?\n \nThanks\nPhilippa\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPhilippa Dobrée-Carey\nGMD Recoveries Team representative and Change Coordination Officer\nImplementation & Challenging Operating Environment\nGrant Portfolio Solutions and Support\nGrant Management Division\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nM: +41795090691\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nphilippa.dobreecarey@theglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\ntheglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org> \n\nSent: Wednesday, February 7, 2024 5:50 PM\n\nTo: Philippa Dobrée-Carey <Philippa.DobreeCarey@TheGlobalFund.org>; Daniel De La Torre <Daniel.DeLaTorre@theglobalfund.org>\n\nSubject: Detailed showcase for Brown Bag with UNOPS\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments\n unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Philippa and Daniel\n\n\nPlease see below a more detailed example here that can be cut/ massaged to fit the needs!\n\n\nWe are waiting for one more bio, then will send you the package together :) \n\n\nBest wishes \n\nLouise\n\n\n \n\n\nBurkina Faso: Supporting community digitalization\n\nthrough IT equipment orders via WAMBO \n\nDuring 2021-2023, UNOPS has been able to support the Programme d’Appui au Developpement\n\nSanitaire (PADS) in Burkina Faso in 7 repeat orders for IT equipment totalling\n\n6.8 million USD. Through its dedicated Wambo project team based in Geneva and the\n\nUN webbuy Plus platform, UNOPS delivered no less than 12,910 tablets, 2980\n\nphones and 282 printers. In December 2022, UNOPS managed to deliver 2,610 phones\n\nenabling quality capture of finger prints just on time for the launch of a\n\nmilestone in the nationwide mass LLIN campaign. The objective was to achieve\n\ncommunity level digitalization, so that community workers can control and\n\nmonitor the delivery of bednets in the absence of a unique identifier. UNOPS’ central\n\nprocurement offer has made it possible for the PR to attend vast volumes, enjoy\n\na range of quality items on catalogue or tailored offers at pre negotiated and\n\ncompetitive prices, with freight services inclusive of customs clearance and\n\ndelivery to a central warehouse.\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \n\n\nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
