                    {
                        Name = "Email: Sv: [EXTERN]: Letter regarding closure of UNOPS Innovation Centre in Malmø",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2023-10-25").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Sv: [EXTERN]: Letter regarding closure of UNOPS Innovation Centre in Malmø",
                        Description = "To: asbjornb@unops.org\nCC: murats@unops.org; naimoh@unops.org; waingchita@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Sv: [EXTERN]: Letter regarding closure of UNOPS Innovation Centre in Malmø\nBody:\nDear \nAsbjørn,\n \nThanks a lot; it looks great. I have forwarded it to Micael and will get back to you if he has any further comments. Please let us know as the closing approaches regarding the exact\n refund amount.\n \n\nBest Regards\nOla Andersson\n\nNäringslivsutvecklare/Business Developer\n\n__________________________________________________________________________________\n\nMalmö Stad\n\nStadskontoret\n\nOmvärld & näringsliv / Enhet Innovation & Utveckling \n\n\nBesöksadress: Lugna Gatan 82\n\n205 80 Malmö\n\nMobil +46 073-701 83 60\n\nola.andersson2@malmo.se\n\nwww.malmobusiness.com\n\n \n\n\nFrån: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org> \n\nSkickat: den 25 oktober 2023 16:07\n\nTill: Ola Andersson <ola.andersson2@malmo.se>\n\nKopia: Murat SAMANCI <murats@unops.org>; Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>; Waing Chit AUNG <waingchita@unops.org>\n\nÄmne: [EXTERN]: Letter regarding closure of UNOPS Innovation Centre in Malmø\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVIDTA FÖRSIKTIGHET:\nDetta e-postmeddelande kommer från en avsändare utanför Malmö stad. Klicka inte på länkar eller öppna bilagor om du inte känner igen avsändaren och vet att innehållet är säkert.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Ola,  \n\n \n\n\nFollowing up on our previous dialogue, please find attached to this email a letter for the attention of Mr. Michael Nord, Business Director at Malmø Municipality from Under-Secretary General, UNOPS Executive Director Mr. Jorge Moreira da\n Silva. \n\n\n \n\n\nMy team and I at UNOPS remain at your full disposal for any inquiries and we will in any case revert to you regarding the practicalities of the closure of the innovation centre, in particular the reimbursement of surplus funds to Malmø\n Municipality. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest regards, \n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n-- \n\n\nAsbjørn Brink | Head\n of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS\n HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish.",
