                        Description = "To: JEITOKPAH@gavi.org; clongden@gavi.org\nCC: elenali@unops.org; elenage@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Gavi UNOPS meeting - Angola\nBody:\nDear Caitlin and Jemimah\nYou may have seen earlier emails and we were wondering if you are available for a short meeting tomorrow at GHC around 11.15 with my Africa Regional colleagues who are covering around 35 countries between them including Angola?\nLooking forward to hearing from you and apologies for late notice!\n\nThanks and Best wishes Louise\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
