                        Subject = "Email: UNOPS Gavi meeting",
                        Description = "To: tvincent@gavi.org\nCC: sfetouh@gavi.org; abolger@gavi.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: UNOPS Gavi meeting\nBody:\nGreat, thanks very much Thierry. A demain!\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\nOn Wed, 28 Feb 2024 at 10:12, Thierry Vincent <tvincent@gavi.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise,\n \nYes, it’s fine for 9-9h30 am tomorrow.\n \nDear Sara, \nCould you check if thee room L2-13b would be free at this time or find another one and adjust the invitation ?\n \nBest,\n \nThierry\n \n \nDr Thierry Vincent\n\n \nSenior Country Manager\nFragile and Conflict Countries\n Segment\nCountry Program Department | Programme Pays\nMobile: +41 79 962 0991\n\nFollow us:\nFacebook\n / Twitter\n / LinkedIn\n / Instagram\n / #VaccinesWork\n \n\n\n \n \n \n \n\n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org> \n\nSent: Wednesday, February 28, 2024 7:29 AM\n\nTo: Aideen Bolger Imparato (Consultant) <abolger@gavi.org>; Thierry Vincent <tvincent@gavi.org>\n\nSubject: UNOPS meeting\n\n\n \n\nCAUTION : This email originated from outside of Gavi. Please do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.\n\n\n\nDear Aideen and Thierry\n\n\nWould you please let us know if the Thursday 9am proposal can work for you as today afternoon timing could be tight \n\n\nThanks and best wishes Louise \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \n\n\nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
