                new (
                    "00TQx000007MJ1cMAG",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: UNOPS Global Fund meetings",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-02-28").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: UNOPS Global Fund meetings",
                        Description = "To: mark.edington@theglobalfund.org\nCC: dalilag@unops.org; Katie.Kampf@theglobalfund.org; Philippa.DobreeCarey@theglobalfund.org; Daniel.DeLaTorre@theglobalfund.org; elenage@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: UNOPS Global Fund meetings\nBody:\nDear MarkThanks very much for your time and reflections on Monday, which set the stage for our \"brown bag\" session - these were much appreciated by myself and our AFR colleagues. \n\nHappy to report we had a very good session on Tuesday, kindly opened by Katie Kampf and greatly assisted by Daniel and Philippa, with lots of interesting questions, subsequent deep dives and additional bilaterals (and more planned!).\nBuilding on this session, we are looking forward to a more proactive planning approach in GC7.  We are delighted to be working with you, the country teams, PRs and CCMs and will continue to support GF objectives, building capacity for effective health programme management, leveraging UHC, and safeguarding these vital investments in system strengthening to defeat the 3 diseases. \nI have copied Dalila Gonçalves, our Regional Director for Africa - so you are connected, for the next mmission to Nairobi (tel / whatsapp +254 0 743 334 476). \n\nThanks again and best wishes\nLouise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
