                        Subject = "Email: Re: [EXT] Meeting WHO - UNOPS - health infra.",
                        Description = "To: fontanal@who.int\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] Meeting WHO - UNOPS - health infra.\nBody:\nAwesome, yes great see you at LAC 414 :)\n\nOn Wed, 28 Feb 2024 at 12:32, FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHi Louise, sorry to disturb. I saw a message from you coming on my phone but now I cant find it.\nAnyway, I’ll be at the office today at 4pm so I’ll meet you here no?\nBest\nLuca \n \n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org> \n\nSent: Tuesday, February 27, 2024 6:09 PM\n\nTo: LAVADO, Rouselle <lavador@who.int>\n\nCc: DHAENE, Gwenael <dhaeneg@who.int>; Elena GEORGALLA <elenage@unops.org>; Elena Librino <elenali@unops.org>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>; VINCI, Salvatore <vincis@who.int>\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] Meeting WHO - UNOPS - health infra.\n\n \n\nBrave new world \n😂 \n\n\nWonderful thanks Rose! \n\n\nBonne soirée \n\n\nL\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOn Tue, 27 Feb 2024 at 17:58, LAVADO, Rouselle <lavador@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\nI just realized I have not met people outside WHO so I actually don’t know how to invite people for face to face meeting. Do you know how this is done, Gwen/Luca?   If not, no worries, will sort it out with our assistant tomorrow morning.\n And yes, I will meet you at the reception at 3 pm.   \n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\nEnvoyé de mon iPhone\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLe 27 févr. 2024 à 17:05, Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org> a écrit :\n\n\n\n\n﻿ \n\n\n\nFantastic thanks Rose, we look forward to seeing you all.  Would you kindly inform your reception that the UNOPS colleagues (below) will be participating and can we meet you\n in reception?  They will let me in, but I guess my colleagues will need access badges. \n\n\nThanks so much!\n\n\nBest wishes Louise\n\n\n \n\n\nTatiana WAH, Director, DRC multi country office\n\n\nFiona MERALI, Project Manager, DRC\n\n\nErin ANSELL, infra & renewable energy specialist\n\n\nJakob TUBORGH, Director ai, Senegal multi country office\n\n\nElena LIBRINO, Partnership Intern, Geneva Liaison office\n\n\nElena GEORGALLA, AFR regional partnership specialist, Nairobi\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \n\n\nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, 27 Feb 2024 at 16:59, LAVADO, Rouselle <lavador@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nThat sounds great to me.  See you, Louise.\n\n \n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Tuesday, February 27, 2024 4:16 PM\n\nTo: DHAENE, Gwenael <dhaeneg@who.int>; VINCI, Salvatore <vincis@who.int>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>;\n LAVADO, Rouselle <lavador@who.int>; Elena GEORGALLA <elenage@unops.org>\n\nCc: Elena Librino <elenali@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] Re: Meeting WHO - UNOPS\n\n \n\n\nDear all\n\n\nNo worries, - thanks so much for booking the room at WHO. Can I suggest we meet with Rose at 3pm as she is available,\n to discuss her countries / EIB and then meet the rest of you from 4pm to 5pm online (?Luca in person) which can be more a \"meet and greet\" and information exchange on central & north west africa (francophone / lusophone)\n\n\nHope this can work and look forward to hearing from you soon :)\n\n\nbest wishes Louise and Elena\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \n\n\nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, 27 Feb 2024 at 09:40, DHAENE, Gwenael <dhaeneg@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nSorry Sorry Sorry\nThe room is booked from 1:45pm to 5pm!!! My mistake (was looking at another booking the week after)\nKindest regards\nGwen\n \n\n\n\nFrom:\nLAVADO, Rouselle <lavador@who.int>\n\nDate: Tuesday, 27 February 2024 at 09:25\n\nTo: DHAENE, Gwenael <dhaeneg@who.int>, Louise Jocelyn LEECH <louisel@unops.org>, FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>\n\nCc: Elena Librino <elenali@unops.org>, VINCI, Salvatore <vincis@who.int>\n\nSubject: RE: [EXT] Re: Meeting WHO - UNOPS\n\n\nMy sincere apologies.  I cannot make it tomorrow at 16:00, but I am free from 13:00 to 16:00.\nIf 16:00 is the best time for everyone, please go ahead and just record the meeting.  Thanks!\n \n\n\nFrom: DHAENE, Gwenael <dhaeneg@who.int>\n\n\nSent: Tuesday, February 27, 2024 9:07 AM\n\nTo: Louise Jocelyn LEECH <louisel@unops.org>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>\n\nCc: Elena Librino <elenali@unops.org>; LAVADO, Rouselle <lavador@who.int>; VINCI, Salvatore <vincis@who.int>\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] Re: Meeting WHO - UNOPS\n\n\n \nDear All\n \nSorry about that\nIndeed LAC414 is booked from 1pm to 4pm\nLooking forward to seeing you all tomorrow\nKind regards\nGwen\n \n\n\n\nFrom:\nLouise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\nDate: Tuesday, 27 February 2024 at 08:18\n\nTo: FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>\n\nCc: DHAENE, Gwenael <dhaeneg@who.int>, Elena Librino <elenali@unops.org>, LAVADO, Rouselle <lavador@who.int>,\n VINCI, Salvatore <vincis@who.int>\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] Re: Meeting WHO - UNOPS\n\n\n\nHi great! Gwen mentioned he’s booked 4th Floor (LAC 414). But not sure what time he booked for   \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \n\n\nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, 27 Feb 2024 at 08:15, FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nYes, I’ll be at the office and happy to book a room if needed\n \n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Tuesday, February 27, 2024 8:14 AM\n\nTo: FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>\n\nCc: DHAENE, Gwenael <dhaeneg@who.int>; Elena Librino <elenali@unops.org>; LAVADO, Rouselle <lavador@who.int>;\n VINCI, Salvatore <vincis@who.int>\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] Re: Meeting WHO - UNOPS\n\n \n\nThanks Luca\n\n\nWill you be in the office ?\n\n\nThanks Louise \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, 27 Feb 2024 at 07:45, FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise,\nAll well thanks. Hope on your side too.\nTomorrow around 16 is perfect for me.\n\nThanks and talk soon\nLuca\n\n \n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Monday, February 26, 2024 8:52 PM\n\nTo: FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>\n\nCc: DHAENE, Gwenael <dhaeneg@who.int>; Elena Librino <elenali@unops.org>; LAVADO, Rouselle <lavador@who.int>;\n VINCI, Salvatore <vincis@who.int>\n\nSubject: [EXT] Re: Meeting WHO - UNOPS\n\n \n\nDear Luca! Ciao! Hope all is well?\n\n\nWill you be available this Wednesday afternoon- around 4pm ish to meet the team? \n\n\nSalvatore has confirmed he will also try to join online. \n\n\n@gwen please advise what time you booked the meeting room for ?!\n\n\nMany thanks and speak soon!\n\n\nLouise \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \n\n\nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Sun, 25 Feb 2024 at 19:18, Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\nThanks so much Gwen. This is great and I will follow up with Luca, Salvatore and Rose to see if we come to WHO. Our AFr colleagues are keen to meet and get a bit more concrete on\n providing support to expand scale and scope Of existing plans. \n\n\nAll best and see you on Wednesday\n\n\nLouise \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Sun, 25 Feb 2024 at 19:12, DHAENE, Gwenael <dhaeneg@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Friends,\n \nApologies for the late response to Louise’s message. Louise I’m happy to confirm that I’ll be available for a virtual meet on 28th afternoon as I’m\n not in the office on this day but will connect. \nI don’t know if anyone will be in the office or if the meeting will be on Teams but just in case I’ve booked a room on the 4th Floor (LAC 414).\n\n \nHope this helps\n \nKindest regards\n \nGwen\n \n \n\n \n \n \nDr Gwenaël Dhaene (PhD, LLM)\nHealth Systems Adviser\nHealth Systems Financing & Economics Department – UHL Cluster\nHealth Infrastructure Focal Point – UHL\nCapital Investment in Health specialist, WHO-EIB Agreement\n \nWorld Health Organization\nAvenue Appia, 20\nCH1211- Geneva\n\nSwitzerland\n \nMobile: +33 69 803\n 3007\nWeb: www.who.int\nFollow WHO on Facebook | Twitter | YouTube | Instagram\n\n<image001.jpg>\n\n\n<image002.png>",
