                    "00TQx000007OfXhMAK",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: RE: E-meeting request for discussion on potential projects with UNOPS",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-01-09").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: RE: E-meeting request for discussion on potential projects with UNOPS",
                        Description = "To: emmaak@unops.org\nCC: fumiea@unops.org; yukom@unops.org; yuichis@unops.org; handa@aa-ic.com; sugimura@aa-ic.com; iida@aa-ic.com\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: E-meeting request for discussion on potential projects with UNOPS\nBody:\nDear Ms. Emma AKINYI, Happy new year! I am re-sending this email to follow up on the message I sent you while you were on vacation.  As in the message below, we would greatly appreciate the opportunity to have a discussion with you this week or next week. If this is feasible, could you please provide a few potential dates and time slots that work for you? Thank you very much for your consideration.Best regards,____________________________________________Yumeho Nakanishi Associate ConsultantAAIC Japan Co, Ltd. +81-3-6721-56404-7-2-7F, Shimbashi, Minato-ku, Tokyo105-0004 Japan____________________________________________ From: Nakanishi Yumeho <nakanishi@aa-ic.com> \nSent: Friday, December 22, 2023 8:01 PM\nTo: 'emmaak@unops.org' <emmaak@unops.org>\nCc: 'fumiea@unops.org' <fumiea@unops.org>; 'Yuko Otsuki MAEKAWA' <yukom@unops.org>; 'Yuichi SUGAWARA' <yuichis@unops.org>; 'handa' <handa@aa-ic.com>; 'sugimura@aa-ic.com' <sugimura@aa-ic.com>; 'Takafumi Iida' <iida@aa-ic.com>\nSubject: E-meeting request for discussion on potential projects with UNOPS Dear Ms. Emma AKINYI, I hope this email finds you well.I am Yumeho Nakanishi, working at AAIC Japan, a consulting firm in Tokyo. I am contacting you since Ms. Maekawa, Head of UNOPS Tokyo Liaison Office, kindly provided me with your email address. We are conducting a project to improve the presence of Japanese companies in the field of global health. As part of it, we are now introducing some solutions by the companies that contribute to global health and are interested in participating in the projects with international organizations including UNOPS. It would be great if you could spare some time (ca.1h) for us to discuss the needs in your country and possibility of future projects with UNOPS during the following period;- the week of 8th JanuaryCould you give us some of your available dates and time slots for an e-meeting please? In the meantime, please find the attachment of the details of our background and objectives, as well as the details of the solutions. Thank you very much for your kind consideration, and I look forward to your positive response. >Dear Arimizu-san,Maekawa-san told us that you are on leave during the above-mentioned period.It would be great if we could arrange a time to have a separate discussion opportunity once you’re back. Kind regards,____________________________________________Yumeho Nakanishi Associate ConsultantAAIC Japan Co, Ltd. +81-3-6721-56404-7-2-7F, Shimbashi, Minato-ku, Tokyo105-0004 Japan____________________________________________",
