                        Subject = "Email: Re: meeting with Thierry",
                        Description = "To: tvincent@gavi.org\nCC: fabassa@gavi.org; jakobt@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: meeting with Thierry\nBody:\nDear ThierryGreat to meet you last week and good you are in touch with the team now, sorry mission was cancelled.In the meantime, please find below some additional capacity statements for your info. and look forward to reconnecting soon.All best wishesLouiseHealth Supply Chain management Capacity Statement Digital Health Capacity Statement Solar for health capacity statement UNOPS \nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\nOn Fri, 1 Mar 2024 at 17:07, Thierry Vincent <tvincent@gavi.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Jakob,\nIndeed, we cancelled as well. But it was a pleasure as well to meet you. Let a keep in touch when situation will have stabilized.\nBest regards,\nThierry\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSent from Outlook for iOS\n\nFrom: Jakob TUBORGH <jakobt@unops.org>\n\nSent: Friday, March 1, 2024 1:09:12 PM\n\nTo: Thierry Vincent <tvincent@gavi.org>\n\nCc: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>; Ferdinand Abassa <fabassa@gavi.org>\n\nSubject: Re: meeting with Thierry\n \n\n\n\nCAUTION : This email originated from outside of Gavi. Please do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.\n\nDear Thierry,\n\n\n\nThanks for the follow up. It was great to meet you.\n\n\n\nUnfortunately our mission to Chad has been cancelled due to the political and security situation in the country. I believe it may be the same for you?\n\n\n\nRegardless, it will be a pleasure to keep the contact and I will be happy to provide feedback after our next mission in country, which is planned for late April or early May.\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n\nJakob   \n\n\n\n\nOn Thu, Feb 29, 2024 at 12:26 PM Thierry Vincent <tvincent@gavi.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise and Jakob,\n \nThanks for our meeting that was very informative.\n \nJakob, please see my contacts below.\n \nLouise, Dr Yam Abdoulaye is WR ai, waiting for the new WR that apparemtly would come from Cameroun.\nyamab@who.int\nBest regards,\n \n \nDr Thierry Vincent\n\n \nSenior Country Manager\nFragile and Conflict Countries Segment\nCountry Program Department | Programme Pays\nMobile: +41 79 962 0991\n\nFollow us:\nFacebook\n / Twitter\n / LinkedIn\n / Instagram\n / #VaccinesWork\n \n\n\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-- \n\n\n\n\nJakob TUBORGH\n | Directeur p.i. -  UNOPS - Afrique de l'Ouest francophone, lusophone et du Maghreb | Complexe SICAP, Point E, Immeuble C, 5ème étage  - Dakar, Sénégal | Tel: +221 33 869 3848 | +221.33 869 3838 | Mobile: +221 77 569 8335\n|\nwww.unops.org/fr \n\nSuivez l’UNOPS sur\nTwitter,\nLinkedIn,\nFacebook,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nAbonnez-vous\n à notre bulletin d’information externe en français,\n en anglais\n ou en espagnol.",
