                new (
                    "00TQx0000094x64MAA",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: [RE]Re: [RE]Re: [RE]KOICA invited to attend the UNOPS Client BoardMeeting 2024",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-03-11").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: [RE]Re: [RE]Re: [RE]KOICA invited to attend the UNOPS Client BoardMeeting 2024",
                        Description = "To: arnauds@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: [RE]Re: [RE]Re: [RE]KOICA invited to attend the UNOPS Client BoardMeeting 2024\nBody:\nDear Mr. Arnaud,\nThank you so much again for the invitation and reminder.\nUnfortunately we couldn't find a right profile to join the meeting this time, especially considering the time difference.\nI really appreciate the invitation again, and look forward to participating another occasion.\nWishing the CB 2024 be productive and successful.\nKind reagards,LEE\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-----------Original Message-----------\n\nSender : Arnaud SGAMBATO < arnauds@unops.org >\n\nTo : 이길석 < gslee@koica.go.kr >\n\nDate : 2024-03-11 17:55:19\n\nSubject : Re: [RE]Re: [RE]KOICA invited to attend the UNOPS Client Board Meeting 2024\n\n\nDear Mr Lee,\n\nI hope this email finds you well. I am following up regarding our invitation to the 2024 Client Board to see if you have any updates regarding KOICA's participation. \n\nKind regards,\n\nArnaudArnaud Sgambato | Head of unit - Partnerships Development | Partnerships and Liaison Group (PLG) | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7717 | www.unops.orgKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.\n\nOn Wed, 28 Feb 2024 at 16:47, Arnaud SGAMBATO <arnauds@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Mr Lee,\n\nThanks a lot for your response. I look forward to our meeting tomorrow.\n\nKind regards,\n\nArnaud\nOn Wed, 28 Feb 2024 at 15:55, 이길석 <gslee@koica.go.kr> wrote:\n\nDear Mr. Arnaud,\nThank you so much for the additional information.\nI'll report to my seniors once again with the information you just provided.\nI hope I would be able to come to our meeting tomorrow with any feedback.\nKind regards,LEE\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-----------Original Message-----------\n\nSender : Arnaud SGAMBATO < arnauds@unops.org >\n\nTo : 이길석 < gslee@koica.go.kr >\n\nDate : 2024-02-28 01:06:49\n\nSubject : Re: [RE]KOICA invited to attend the UNOPS Client Board Meeting 2024\n\n\nDear Mr Lee,\n\nI hope this email finds you well. I wanted to follow up on our last discussion and was wondering whether you had managed to discuss the UNOPS client board with your senior management. In addition, I wanted to provide some additional background about its role and establishment.\n  \nOn 19 March 2019, the Secretary-General decided to establish a UNOPS client board and abolish the Policy Advisory Committee he established in 2008. On 7 June 2019, the Executive Board “notes that Client Board functions are advisory and do not supplant or duplicate any governance functions of the Executive Board” (decision 2019/12).\n\nThe client board is advisory to the Executive Director and completely detached from the UNOPS governance framework. It is not a governance body with decision-making authority. \nThe client board provides structured feedback from operational partners who can advise the Executive Director based on the performance of project services and operational activities.\nThe client board was held in 2020, 2021, 2022 and twice in 2023. \n\nI hope this helps, and I look forward to our discussion on Thursday.\n\nKind regards,\n\nArnaud\n\nOn Tue, 13 Feb 2024 at 18:47, Arnaud SGAMBATO <arnauds@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Mr Lee,\n\nThanks a lot for your email and no worries at all. I hope you had a nice break.\n\nI just sent you an invite for Friday, 16 February, at 09.00 CPH time, as I think it would be good indeed to address the Client Board first, so you can start consulting with your colleagues.\n\nI would also be happy to book another meeting on Tuesday, 20 February, at the time you suggested if it still works for you.\n\nKind regards,\n\nArnaud\n Tue, 13 Feb 2024 at 16:10, 이길석 <gslee@koica.go.kr> wrote:\nDear Mr, Arnaud,\nSorry for this late reply. \nHere in Korean, we've just celebrated a lunar new year's day.It's been like a \"mini-vacation period\", and I just got back to office.\nThank you so much for the invitation, and I do have some questions before I report this agenda to KOICA's executive level personnel.I was wondering if we could have a meeting on Tuessday 20 Feb 2024 ⋅ 08:30 – 09:30 CPH time, to discuss CB meeting and MOU together.\nOr on this Friday, 16 FEB 2024, 09:00-09:30 CPH time, to quickly handle just the CB issue first. \nKind regards,LEE\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-----------Original Message-----------\n\nSender : Arnaud SGAMBATO < arnauds@unops.org >\n\nTo : Gilseok LEE < gslee@koica.go.kr >\n\nDate : 2024-02-07 02:25:21\n\nSubject : KOICA invited to attend the UNOPS Client Board Meeting 2024\n\n\nDear Mr Lee,\n\nThanks again for our meeting and discussion regarding the MoU between UNOPS and KOICA. I will get back to you in a separate email on some of the points we discussed. \n\nI am contacting you regarding the fifth annual UNOPS Client Board meeting, which will be held via video teleconference on March 13, 2024.\n\nThe UNOPS Client Board brings together representatives from UNOPS key global partners for the purpose of enhancing and deepening our relationship.As we would like to invite a KOICA representative to attend, I was hoping you would be able to help me identify to whom the invitation should be sent.\nWe would very much welcome having a KOICA join the meeting and engage with us in a constructive dialogue to identify opportunities and challenges and hear your perspective on UNOPS service delivery performance.\n\nPlease find further details regarding the UNOPS Client Board attached.\nI am available for a quick meeting at your earliest convenience to answer any questions you might have.\n\nKind regards,\n\nArnaud\n\nAttachments\nUNOPS Client Board Terms of ReferenceUNOPS Client Board Introductory SummaryArnaud Sgambato | Head of unit - Partnerships Development | Partnerships and Liaison Group (PLG) | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7717 | www.unops.orgKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx0000094x64MAA",
