                        Subject = "Email: UNOPS - TGF project in Haiti",
                        Description = "To: Daniel.DeLaTorre@theglobalfund.org\nCC: Philippa.DobreeCarey@theglobalfund.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: UNOPS - TGF project in Haiti\nBody:\nDear Daniel\nThanks so much for your message and consideration. Unfortunately Dabagai our Haiti Country Director is chairing a UN partner meeting so cannot change this. You probably remember she joined at 7am for our first meeting at Jaimes request during our brown bag session so I do hope we can find an alternative time - from 14h30 CET onwards is workable, given the Haiti team is 6 hours behind us.\nYou are of course aware of the extremely challenging operating environment in Haiti. Despite having to relocate, and in addition to the Agreement for this work having expired, the country team has still run and finalised an RFP process for the two warehouses (bids will be opened today). They are also consolidating the final narrative and financial report for the Govt. on 2023 deliverables, which we look forward to discussing with you, including outlining some possible options for a way forward. \nThanks for your understanding and look forward to hearing from you!\nBest wishes, Louise \n\nOn Tue, 9 Apr 2024 at 15:40, Daniel De La Torre <Daniel.DeLaTorre@theglobalfund.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHi Louise,\n\nI’m sorry but every Friday 14.00 – 15.30 the CT and PRs have the crisis committee. Since they’re all working on the program adaptations, it’s not possible to shorten the call this\n time. \nDo you think the UNOPS team could be flexible this first meeting? From there both teams can agree on the next meetings.\n\nHope it’s possible.\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDaniel DE LA TORRE AYORA\nAdvisor, Partnerships, Challenging Operating Environments\nImplementation and Challenging Operating Environments\nGrant Portfolio Solutions and Support\nGrant Management Division\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nM: +41764309531\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDaniel.Delatorre@theglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\ntheglobalfund.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Google Calendar <calendar-notification@google.com>\nOn Behalf Of Louise Jocelyn LEECH\n\nSent: Tuesday, April 9, 2024 3:06 PM\n\nTo: CT Haiti <CT_HTI@theglobalfund.org>; Daniel De La Torre <Daniel.DeLaTorre@theglobalfund.org>; Francesco Moschetta <Francesco.Moschetta@theglobalfund.org>; Philippa Dobrée-Carey <Philippa.DobreeCarey@TheGlobalFund.org>; Louise Jocelyn LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\nSubject: UNOPS - TGF project in Haiti\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments\n unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe. \n\n\n\n\n\n\nUNOPS - TGF project in Haiti\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nHello, please can we schedule this ONE HOUR EARLIER to ensure our Haiti team is available.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUNOPS - TGF project in Haiti\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFriday 12 Apr 2024\n⋅ 15:30\n– 16:30 (Central European Time - Zurich)\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks Louise,\n\nI’m sending the link for the meeting.\n\nWould you please share with the colleagues at UNOPS office in Haiti, and the team managing the project?\n\nThanks a lot.\n\nBest,\n\nD \n________________________________________________________________________________\n\nMicrosoft Teams Need help?\n\nJoin the meeting now\n\nMeeting ID: 239 565 460 890\n\nPasscode: KvRZfZ\n\n________________________________\n\nDial-in by phone\n\n+41 43 430 76 18,,610745566# Switzerland, Zurich/Zürich/Zurigo (Zurich)\n\nFind a local number\n\nPhone conference ID: 610 745 566#\n\nJoin on a video conferencing device\n\nTenant key: teams@vc.theglobalhealthcampus.org\n\nVideo ID: 119 446 257 7\n\nMore info\n\nFor organizers: Meeting options | Reset dial-in PIN\n\nNOTICE: This meeting may be recorded, including video and audio recording and automatic transcription. By joining the meeting you consent to the meeting being recorded and/or transcribed.\n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n\n\nhttps://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MTFlY2NhMzAtMTA2Ny00MWE1LTlhZWMtNGYzODU1NDA4ODkz%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%2277920909-8782-4efb-aaf1-44ac114d7c03%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22b62a749b-85d4-4d3e-a6a5-6f0469e6d412%22%7d\n\nView\n map\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGuests\n\n\n\n\n\nDaniel\n De La Torre\n- organizer\n\n\nLouise Jocelyn\n LEECH\n- creator\n\n\nCT Haiti\n\n\n\nPhilippa\n Dobrée-Carey\n\n\n\nfrancesco.moschetta@theglobalfund.org\n- optional",
                        Location = null,
