                        Description = "To: elenali@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: FW: Registration for the first quarterly informal briefing on the Global Compact on Refugees - Tuesday, 26 March 2024, from 15:00 to 17:00 CEST\nBody:\nPlease send us invites to block our calendars for the quarterly briefings you me alicijathanks louise \n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Charline Blin <blin@unhcr.org>\nDate: Mon, 25 Mar 2024 at 10:09\nSubject: FW: Registration for the first quarterly informal briefing on the Global Compact on Refugees - Tuesday, 26 March 2024, from 15:00 to 17:00 CEST\nTo: GARG, Aarti <garga@who.int>, Altaf MUSANI <musania@who.int>, Amelia STEWART <amelia.stewart@wfp.org>, Anna Giudice <anna.giudice@un.org>, Anna Parini <anna.parini@unwomen.org>, Anne Nyambane <anne.nyambane@fao.org>, Astrid Van Genderen Stort <vangenderenstort@un.org>, Cinco, Anne Beatrice <cinco@iloguest.org>, Beatrice Tisato <beatrice.tisato@un.org>, Bisam Gyawali <bisam.gyawali@unv.org>, Tukhtabayev, Bobir <b.tukhtabayev@unesco.org>, Carolina Hernandez <carolina.hernandez@un.org>, Catherine Osborn <catherine.osborn@undp.org>, Sund, Christine <christine.sund@itu.int>, Christopher Gerlach <gerlach2@un.org>, Claudia Marotta <marottac@who.int>, MURPHY Craig <CMURPHY@iom.int>, Daniela Knoppik <dknoppik@unicef.org>, David Khoudour <david.khoudour@undp.org>, Deborah Verzuu <deborah.verzuu@unv.org>, Emmanuelle Bernard <bernard6@un.org>, Frank Van Rompaey <f.vanrompaey@unido.org>, Graham Alabaster <graham.alabaster@un.org>, Grainne Ohara <grainne.ohara@un.org>, Heaven Crawley <crawley@unu.edu>, Helen Mould <mould@unfpa.org>, Helena Nygren Krug <nygrenkrugh@unaids.org>, Ruaudel, Heloise <ruaudel@ilo.org>, Henny Ngu <henny.ngu@undp.org>, Jaberian, Hoda <h.jaberian@unesco.org>, Homaira SIKANDARY <homaira.sikandary@wfp.org>, Ingo Piegeler <piegeler@unfpa.org>, Ivana Unluova <ivana.unluova@un.org>, CAMARILLO Jeanette <jcamarillo@iom.int>, Jibran Alsa