                        Subject = "Email: Re: UN common pledge - UNOPS catch-up",
                        Description = "To: blin@unhcr.org\nCC: elenali@unops.org; nordlund@unhcr.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: UN common pledge - UNOPS catch-up\nBody:\nhi CharlineOK no worries, let's stick with 16h00! see you then ! L \n\nOn Fri, 12 Apr 2024 at 15:54, Charline Blin <blin@unhcr.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise, \n \nWe already have another meeting at 3.30 unfortunately, is there any other time you would prefer?\n \nBest,\nCharline\n \n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org> \n\nSent: Friday, April 12, 2024 1:32 PM\n\nTo: Charline Blin <blin@unhcr.org>\n\nCc: Elena Librino <elenali@unops.org>; Emma Maria Christina Nordlund <nordlund@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: Re: UN common pledge - UNOPS catch-up\n\n \n\nWonderful thanks ! Can we please make it 3:30 rather than 16:00? - see you there !!\n\n\nBon weekend \n\n\nL \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \n\n\nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Fri, 12 Apr 2024 at 10:42, Charline Blin <blin@unhcr.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nHi Louise,\n\n \nOf course, no problem! I have edited the invite, I hope the time works, let me know if it doesn’t, we seem quite free on that day.\n😊\nHappy to welcome you to UNHCR, I have booked a room for the meeting also.\n \nBest,\nCharline\n \n\n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, April 12, 2024 8:28 AM\n\nTo: Elena Librino <elenali@unops.org>; Charline Blin <blin@unhcr.org>; Emma Maria Christina Nordlund <nordlund@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: UN common pledge - UNOPS catch-up\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nAttention: This email is from an external sender. Please be careful with any links or attachments.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHi Charline!\n\n\nGreat to hear from you - and looking forward to discussing UN CP and next steps !\n\n\nThat said next week is crammed packed - can we postpone our bilateral to Tuesday 23rd and perhaps in person ?\n\n\nThanks for letting me know   \n\n\nBest wishes Louise \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \n\n\nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
