                    {
                        Name = "Email: Great to meet you",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-04-12").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Great to meet you",
                        Description = "To: sgreene@gavi.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Great to meet you\nBody:\nHi Susan\nIt was GREAT to meet you on Tuesday at Gavi this week, thanks so much for your time, I was happy to catch you thanks to the wonderful Almaz!I will look forward to speaking again soon, and in the meantime have sought a meeting with Sania (in due course knowing she has a heavy travel schedule), perhaps around World Health Assembly time.\nWe have just received a \"heavily edited\" agreement back from Laurent - I will follow this up with Irina, continuing the spirit as you and I discussed, of \"enabling\" the broader partnerships to accelerate the operational impact of Gavi at country level :)\nAlso I will be in Washington DC in a few weeks - I understand there will be a Partnerships meeting with Gates during May - would you be able to share any details on this with a view to us participating?\nWishing you a restful weekend!Thanks and best wishes, Louise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
