                        Description = "To: dabagaid@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: !! UNOPS - TGF Haiti meeting\nBody:\nDear Dabagai - we have managed to move to Wednesday this week! Thanks for sharing with colleagues.Looking forward to joining you and the team in this discussion with Global Fund.Best wishes Louise \n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Daniel De La Torre <Daniel.DeLaTorre@theglobalfund.org>\nDate: Mon, 15 Apr 2024 at 09:28\nSubject: UNOPS - TGF project in Haiti. TBC by UNOPS\nTo: CT Haiti <CT_HTI@theglobalfund.org>, Louise Jocelyn LEECH <louisel@unops.org>, Philippa Dobrée-Carey <Philippa.DobreeCarey@theglobalfund.org>\nCc: Francesco Moschetta <Francesco.Moschetta@theglobalfund.org>, Maud Rivoire <Maud.Rivoire@theglobalfund.org>, Marcos Bustillo <Marcos.BustilloSalcines@theglobalfund.org>, Philippe Marien Tache <PhilippeMarien.Tache@theglobalfund.org>, Camille Collin <Camille.Collin@theglobalfund.org>, Jaime Briz De Felipe <Jaime.briz@theglobalfund.org>, Isabel Benlloch Velar <Isabel.Benlloch@theglobalfund.org>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks Louise,\n\nI’m sending the link for the meeting.\n\nWould you please share with the colleagues at UNOPS office in Haiti, and the team managing the project?\n\nThanks a lot.\n\nBest,\n\nD\n \n\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\nMicrosoft Teams\nNeed help?\n\n\n\nJoin\n the meeting now \n\n\nMeeting ID:\n239 565 460 890\n\n\n\nPasscode:\nKvRZfZ\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDial-in by phone\n\n\n\n+41 43 430 76 18,,610745566#\nSwitzerland, Zurich/Zürich/Zurigo (Zurich)\n\n\n\nFind a local number\n\n\n\n\nPhone conference ID:\n610 745 566#\n\n\n\nJoin on a video conferencing device\n\n\n\nTenant key:\nteams@vc.theglobalhealthcampus.org\n\n\n\nVideo ID:\n119 446 257 7\n\n\n\nMore info\n\n\n\nFor organizers:\nMeeting\n options |\n\nReset dial-in PIN \n\n\nNOTICE: This meeting may be recorded, including video and audio recording and automatic transcription. By joining the meeting\n you consent to the meeting being recorded and/or transcribed.\n\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx000009JYh3MAG",
                        EmailAddresses = new List<string> { "francesco.moschetta@theglobalfund.org", "dabagaid@unops.org", "daniel.delatorre@theglobalfund.org", "jaime.briz@theglobalfund.org", "philippa.dobreecarey@theglobalfund.org", "camille.collin@theglobalfund.org", "ct_hti@theglobalfund.org", "teams@vc.theglobalhealthcampus.org", "louisel@unops.org", "isabel.benlloch@theglobalfund.org", "philippemarien.tache@theglobalfund.org", "marcos.bustillosalcines@theglobalfund.org", "maud.rivoire@theglobalfund.org" },
