                    {
                        Name = "Email: Fwd: DK MFA / Office of the Special Coordinator Gaza_DK contribution",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-04-22").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Fwd: DK MFA / Office of the Special Coordinator Gaza_DK contribution",
                        Description = "To: marijab@unops.org\nCC: naimoh@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: DK MFA / Office of the Special Coordinator Gaza_DK contribution\nBody:\nHi Marija\nLet me know if you need anything from me. \nThe biggest agreements we currently have with Denmark are one for procurement and one for infrastructure in Ukraine. \n@Naimo HASSAN HIRSI (cc): Could you please send a link to the two agreements to Marija for her inspiration? \nThanks!\nBest,Asbjørn\n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Katrine Siig Kristensen <kasikr@um.dk>\nDate: Sun, 21 Apr 2024 at 16:19\nSubject: SV: DK MFA / Office of the Special Coordinator Gaza_DK contribution\nTo: Marija BATEMAN <marijab@unops.org>\nCc: Mac Albert Gordon Shaw <macsha@um.dk>, Carla Cecilia Baumann Greiber <cargre@um.dk>, Laura Sørensen Topp <lautop@um.dk>, Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Marija\n \nThank you for the call. Most useful.\n\n \nWe have made the necessary clarification internally, and for us to proceed with the contribution, we would appreciate\n if you can share a draft agreement (similar to other agreements which UNOPS has with Denmark – I hope Asbjørn, can assist). In terms of reporting, we suggest that you adapt it to what you need to submit to other donors (ex NL), so we align as much as possible,\n and minimize the burden on you (a general annual report is ok with us).\n \nIf any questions, please do not hesitate to reach out.\nBest regards\nKatrine\n \nKATRINE SIIG KRISTENSEN /\nkasikr@um.dk\nCHIEF COUNSELLOR, HUMANITARIAN AFFAIRS\n\nDEPARTMENT FOR HUMANITARIAN AFFAIRS, CIVIL SOCIETY AND ENGAGEMENT (HCE)\n\nMOBILE +45 2381 5045\n\n \nMINISTRY OF FOREIGN AFFAIRS\nASIATISK PLADS 2 / DK-1448 KØBENHAVN K\nPHONE +45 3392 0000\n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n\nFra: Marija BATEMAN <marijab@unops.org>\n\n\nSendt: 15. april 2024 08:59\n\nTil: Katrine Siig Kristensen <kasikr@um.dk>\n\nCc: Mac Albert Gordon Shaw <macsha@um.dk>; Carla Cecilia Baumann Greiber <cargre@um.dk>; Laura Sørensen Topp <lautop@um.dk>\n\nEmne: Re: DK MFA / Office of the Special Coordinator Gaza_DK contribution\n\n\n \n[CAUTION - EXTERNAL EMAIL] This email was sent from outside the MFA organisation. DO NOT reply,\n click on links, or open attachments unless you have verified the sender and know the content is safe.\n\n\n\nDear Katrine,\n\n\n \n\n\nYes, I am happy to have the call. The proposed time works for me.\n\n\nSpeak to you later.\n\n\n \n\n\nAll the best,\n\n\nMarija\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nMarija Bateman\n|\nSenior Regional Advisor, Partnerships and Planning |\nMiddle East Regional Office | Amman, Jordan |Tel: +962 797 555 761 | www.unops.org\n \nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube\n \n\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Mon, Apr 15, 2024 at 9:56 AM Katrine Siig Kristensen <kasikr@um.dk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Marija\n \nShould you still be available, we would be keen to proceed with the call. Mainly with some technical\n questions on the new mechanism. \n \nBest\nKatrine\n \n\nKATRINE SIIG KRISTENSEN /\nkasikr@um.dk\n\nCHIEF COUNSELLOR, HUMANITARIAN AFFAIRS\n\n\nDEPARTMENT FOR HUMANITARIAN AFFAIRS, CIVIL SOCIETY AND ENGAGEMENT (HCE)\n\n\nMOBILE +45 2381 5045\n\n\n \n\nMINISTRY OF FOREIGN AFFAIRS\n\nASIATISK PLADS 2 / DK-1448 KØBENHAVN K\n\nPHONE +45 3392 0000\n\n \n\n \n \n________________________________________________________________________________\n\nMicrosoft Teams\n\nHar du brug for hjælp? \n\n\n\nTilmeld\n dig mødet nu \n\n\nMøde-id:\n320 012 355 657\n\n\n\nAdgangskode:\nL5upfx\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTilmeld dig på en enhed til videomøder\n\n\n\nLejernøgle:\nteams@meet.um.dk\n\n\n\nVideo-id:\n125 181 807 2\n\n\n\nFlere\n oplysninger \n\n\nFor arrangører:\nMødeindstillinger\n|\n\nNulstil opkaldspinkode \n\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________",
