                        Subject = "Email: Meeting in Washington",
                        Description = "To: ramirezfet@paho.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Meeting in Washington\nBody:\nDear Francisco!I hope this finds you well! I will be in Washington DC the week of 6 May and would love to catch up with you - we are on the same working group of G02L (I also worked at WHO for 20 years, most recently in WHE / emergencies, and hope also to see Ciro Ugarte whilst there!) Thanks for letting me know if you are free on the 8 May ?All the bestLouise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
