                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-04-29").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Fwd: Meeting request from Mr. Carl Hartzell (Sweden)",
                        Description = "To: naimoh@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: Meeting request from Mr. Carl Hartzell (Sweden)\nBody:\nFYI. \n/A\n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Sarah DUBORD-GAGNON <sarahdg@unops.org>\nDate: Mon, 29 Apr 2024 at 08:57\nSubject: Re: Meeting request from Mr. Carl Hartzell (Sweden)\nTo: Mohammed Smesem <mohammed.smesem@gov.se>\nCc: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>, Hafida LAHIOUEL <hafidal@unops.org>, Pia Bilting Bearfield <pia.bilting.bearfield@gov.se>, Anna GAARDE <annag@unops.org>, Waing Chit AUNG <waingchita@unops.org>\n\nDear Mr. Smesem,\nI hope this finds you well. USG Moreira da Silva would be available for a virtual meeting with Mr. Hartzell on May 8th at 10 am NY time, or May 10th at 10am or 11am NY time. \nPlease let me know what would work best for you. \nWith kind regards,--\nSarah Dubord-Gagnon| Senior Executive Assistant to Under-Secretary-General and Executive Director | UNOPS Executive Office | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 31 48 69 15 | www.unops.org \n\nOn Mon, Apr 29, 2024 at 8:18 AM Jorge MOREIRA DA SILVA <jorge.moreiradasilva@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Mr Smesem,\nMany thanks for your email. Unfortunately, I won’t be able to meet Mr Hartzell this week in NY. I am based in Copenhagen (where UNOPS is headquartered) but this week I will be in Chile for the CEB - Chief Executives Meeting. \nI would be glad to meet next week virtually.\nI am copying Sarah Dubord-Gagnon who can offer some slots.\nBest regards\nJorge Moreira da Silva\nOn Fri, 26 Apr 2024 at 17.17, Mohammed Smesem <mohammed.smesem@gov.se> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Mr. Moreira da Silva,\n\n \nI hope this email finds you well.\n\n \nMr. Carl Hartzell, Head of Department for Multilateral Governance and Humanitarian Policy at the Swedish MFA, will be travelling to New York next week and would\n like to kindly request a meeting with you. Mr. Hartzell wishes to discuss matters related to the situation in Gaza, in particular UNOPS cooperation with the Senior Humanitarian and Reconstruction Coordinator for Gaza, Ms. Sigrid Kaag.\n\n \nFor reference, I believe you recently met our Political Coordinator, Victoria Forslund Bellass, in connection to a briefing held with Ms. Kaag.\n\n \nMr. Hartzell would be available for a 45-minute meeting in the following time slots:\n\n\nTuesday, April 30, 9am-11am\nWednesday, May 1, 13:15pm-14:00pm.\n\n \nI thank you in advance and look forward to hearing from your team.\n\n \nKind regards,\n\n \nMohammed Smesem\n\n \nMohammed Smesem\n\nSecond Secretary \n\nPermanent Mission of Sweden to the United Nations\n\nOne Dag Hammarskjöld Plaza\n\n885 Second Avenue, 46th floor\n\nNew York, NY 10017\n\nMobile +1 917 207 2817 \nmohammed.smesem@gov.se\nwww.swedenabroad.com/un    \n@SwedenUN",
                        Location = null,
