                    {
                        Name = "Email: RE: Appel - 2022/00865 - Ukraine - Reminder for submitting the interim report",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-05-03").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: RE: Appel - 2022/00865 - Ukraine - Reminder for submitting the interim report",
                        Description = "To: ivanv@unops.org\nCC: janphilipk@unops.org; mariacarmenco@unops.org; paulc@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: Appel - 2022/00865 - Ukraine - Reminder for submitting the interim report\nBody:\nDear Ivan,\n \nThank you for your message.\n \nThe notification via APPEL might be a bug in the system still. As per the latest amendment and time extension, we expect the next Interim Report in August only.\n\n \nBest wishes,\nKirsten\n\n \n\nFrom: Ivan VYNNYCHENKO <ivanv@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, May 3, 2024 10:11 AM\n\nTo: NOBEN Kirsten (ECHO) <Kirsten.NOBEN@ec.europa.eu>\n\nCc: Jan Philip KLEVER <janphilipk@unops.org>; Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org>; Paul CRUICKSHANK <paulc@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Fwd: Appel - 2022/00865 - Ukraine - Reminder for submitting the interim report\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nDear Kristen,\n\n\n \n\n\nMy name is Ivan Vynnychenko, I am a Deputy Project Manager for the ECHO-funded School repairs in Ukraine project\n (Project-ID : 2022/00865/MR/02/03),\n implemented by UNOPS, Agreement Number ECHO/UKR/BUD/2022/91028. I\n am writing respond to the automatic reminder for submission of the interim report and provide\n an update on when the interim reports were actually submitted and when the next one under the current legal agreement is expected. Let me\n first reference the last sentence of the reminder below: \n\n\n \n\n\nAttention, your Modification Request is being still analysed in ECHO. In case you requested a modification of the timeframe of this action, the due date of the Interim Report might\n be computed incorrectly (too early/late).\n\n\n\n \n\n\nAs per the Article\n 4.3 of the General Conditions of the Legal Agreement, Sixteen, ten and four months before the end of the implementation period of the Agreement, the International Organisation shall submit a Progress Report on the Action’s implementation,\n covering the implementation up to one month before the reporting date or by 31 August 2023, 29 February 2024 and 31 August 2024. \n\n\n\n\n\nUNOPS duly submitted both 16- and 10-month interim reports in APPEL before the required deadline, please see below: \n\n\n\n\n\nI hope this provides clarification of the possible miscomputing of interim report due dates for this project\n in APPEL. Please do not hesitate to let me know if you have any additional questions. \n\n\n \n\n\nWe are looking forward to the results of the Modification\n Request analysis by ECHO. \n\n\n \n\n\nThanks, \n\n\nIvan \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIvan Vynnychenko | Deputy\n Project Manager (ECHO School Repairs) | UNOPS Ukraine Multi-Country Office | +38 050 562 4932 | www.unops.org \n\n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nTwitter,\nLinkedIn,\nFacebook,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench\n or Spanish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---------- Message transféré ---------\n\n\n\n\nDe : <ECHO-ETOOLS-NOREPLY@ec.europa.eu>\n\nDate : ven. 3 mai 2024 à 06:00\n\nObjet : Appel - 2022/00865 - Ukraine - Reminder for submitting the interim report\n\n\nÀ : <mariacarmenco@unops.org>\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Partner\n\n\n\n(Cc: Desk Officer, Desk Assistant, Field Expert)\n\n\n\nThis is an automatic e-mail sent by the APPEL system, please do not reply to this e-mail!\n\n\n\nThis notification concerns the project :\n\n\nProject-ID : 2022/00865/MR/02/03\nOperation title : School Repairs in Ukraine\nPartner : UNITED NATIONS OFFICE FOR PROJECT SERVICES\nCountry(ies) : Ukraine\nAgreement Number : ECHO/UKR/BUD/2022/91028\nStart date of action : 14/11/2022\nEnd date of action : 02/01/2025\n-----\nWe wish to remind you that in the framework of the above-mentioned Agreement, your organisation is required to provide DG ECHO with an interim report. This report should be provided to DG ECHO by 02/05/2024. This obligation derives from Article 4(1) of the\n Agreement, in accordance with the provisions of Article 5 of the General Conditions.\n\n\n\nWe note that, till today's date (03/05/2024), DG ECHO has still not received the interim report from your organisation*. As such, we request that you send us this report without any further delay, at the latest within 15 calendar days of receipt of this letter.\n\n\n\nWe draw your attention to the fact that, in the absence of an interim report by this deadline, DG ECHO may launch the procedure for the termination of the Agreement, in compliance with Article 17(2)(b) of the General Conditions.\n\n\n\n* - If a justification for the delay has been provided to ECHO - you may disregard this automated message. In such a situation please get in touch with the Desk Officer and provide an update on when the interim report may be expected.\n\n\n\nAttention, your Modification Request is being still analysed in ECHO. In case you requested a modification of the timeframe of this action, the due date of the Interim Report might be computed incorrectly (too early/late).\n-----\nDesk Officer: NOBEN Kirsten\n\n\n\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIn case of problems, contact the \nECHO IS SUPPORT.\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------",
