                        Description = "To: helenao@unops.org\nCC: asbjornb@unops.org; sharmins@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Background info of UNOPS on foam panels for events\nBody:\nThank you, Hel. I want to print at the print shop on the ground floor. I will stop by them Tuesday morning to see what options they have. \nBest, Naimo\nOn Fri, May 17, 2024 at 10:13 AM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,\nDo you know where you will print it? The printer might have some samples? Maybe a semi-coated paper, 200g?\nBest Hel\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Thu, May 16, 2024 at 3:30 PM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Hel, \nIt is very much approved. Could you kindly send me the print version? Also which type of paper would you recommend?\nBest, NaimoOn Wed, May 15, 2024 at 3:48 PM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nHi Helena, \nWow! This is really good! Thank you so much! I will get back to you shortly. \nBest, Naimo\n\nOn Wed, May 15, 2024 at 3:39 PM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,\nPlease take a look at the low resolution Bornholm A5 flyer front and back PDF. I hope it suits the purpose. Let me know your feedback! If all looks ok, then I will export the print ready file. Thank you!\nBest Hel\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Wed, May 15, 2024 at 1:07 PM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nHi Hel, \nThe Danish text is now updated. \nBest, Naimo\nOn Wed, May 15, 2024 at 8:35 AM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,\nI accepted the edits in the document, so please continue with the DK text. But please double check the EN as well.Thank you!\nBest Hel\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Wed, May 15, 2024 at 8:22 AM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nThank you Asbjørn and Hel, \nI will adjust the Danish translation accordingly as soon as I hear back from you. \nBest, Naimo\nOn Tue, May 14, 2024 at 7:56 PM Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Helena \nThanks for your suggestions - which I have adjusted slightly with TC suggestions in the doc. Please let Naimo know if this approved from Branding - after which we will translate into Danish and move ahead with the process.\nBest,Asbjørn\nOn Tue, 14 May 2024 at 19:24, Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,\nThe Content team has some comments for the content, could you take a look? Let me know if you can agree with the edits and let me know when done in both the EN & DK version. I will then implement in the design files and send you the PDF for approval.\nThanks!\nBest Hel\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Mon, May 6, 2024 at 2:17 PM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Hel, \nHere is the Danish text (page 2). \nBest, Naimo\nOn Mon, May 6, 2024 at 2:12 PM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,\nWhen will we receive the Danish version, please specify. Thanks!\nBest Hel\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Mon, May 6, 2024 at 2:10 PM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Helena, \nApologies for the late reply. Would it be possible to have the product ready by May 15 given you receive the Danish version in the coming days? Would it be possible to see an example for the English version?\nBest, Naimo\nOn Mon, May 6, 2024 at 2:02 PM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,\nCould you please come back with a timeline, when will we receive the final text?\nBest Hel\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Mon, Apr 29, 2024 at 10:07 AM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,\nThanks for the new EN copy! Could you also provide the Danish translation, so that in the next round I could incorporate this in the design? Kindly also provide a timeline, when you need this by. Please consider the printer also needs time to print. \nBest Hel\n\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Mon, Apr 29, 2024 at 9:20 AM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Hel, \nMy apologies for the late reply. The content team's suggestion works very well. I have minor suggestions.Is it possible to have the QR code on the right side at the bottom of the page? Also there is space between the 'On behalf.. and Procurement. In that space, may I suggest we write: UNOPS is a demand driven organization - with no core funding. UNOPS has its global HQ in Copenhagen and most of our work takes place in fragile and conflict affected states. We have 5.000+ colleagues in 80+ countries. On behalf of partners, UNOPS provides:.. I revisited the text here. \nFinally, is it possible to have the white background in a different colour? Off white or really light grey so that it is not necessary to change the colour of the font.  If possible, it would also be very good if half of the page was with a picture and the other half with text. The blue text about UNOPS is really good and stands out. \nThank you so much. \nBest wishes, Naimo\nOn Tue, Apr 23, 2024 at 10:58 AM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,The Content team suggests revising the first part: \"UNOPS is the “do’er” agency of the UN. No political mandate, only focused on implementation.\" suggest adopting something like the below:\"UNOPS runs operations for the UN and partners in some of the world's most challenging contexts. We're focused on implementation -- providing practical action where needs are greatest.\"\nPlease find the EN draft design here. The DN version can then be printed on the other side. Let me know if you think this could work! Note that this is just a draft and we will send you the high resolution print file at the end of the process. Thank you!Best Hel\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Wed, Apr 17, 2024 at 9:54 AM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nHi Hel, \nWe would need to translate into Danish as well, so one side in Danish and the other in English. Asbjørn would like to see how the English page turns out before we make the translation. I hope that is alright with you. We would like the QR code to link to this page. \nBest, Naimo\n\nOn Wed, Apr 17, 2024 at 8:30 AM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,\nNoted with thanks. Could you please share the link in this thread where the QR code should lead to? Will it only be in EN, or are you having it translated? When would you need this? Thanks!\nBest Hel\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Tue, Apr 16, 2024 at 11:13 AM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nHi Helena. \nThank you for sharing the old materials. Unfortunately it is not possible to have a photo exhibition or large foam board about UNOPS as we wanted to. However, it is possible for us to share A5 flyers with a QR code that links the partnerships page of the corporate website. Please see here an approved text for the flyers and we want to use this picture. \nBest, Naimo\n\nOn Fri, Apr 12, 2024 at 3:50 PM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,\nOld comms materialAs you can see these prints used at Bornholm are very old. But just to give you an idea of what has been shared before. Maybe the Content team knows more?\nBoardThanks for sending me the text. When will you have this text approved? I would need all content ready, approved and proofread before any design work starts. With content I mean both texts (copy, captions, credits) and images (photos and logos). \nPhoto exhibitionOk, so you don't want the UNOPS logo on the images, if I understand correctly? Even though, you will have to share the photo credits of the images if you are showing them in an external context. I would really recommend having photo captions as well. \nAnimationsFor animations you will have to liaise with Elise Laker from our team.\nTimelineShare the estimated timeline, so that we can plan ahead.\nThank you!\nBest Hel\n\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Fri, Apr 12, 2024 at 3:25 PM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Helena, \nI am very happy to hear that you have made Folkemøde related material throughout the years. Can you share with me some examples? We would of course love to have flyers to share. \n1. Yes, it is the printed version. I just want one foam board that gives a description of UNOPS, who we are and what we do. 2. As both of our events are with other agencies, we really do not need an exhibition with the UNOPS logo.We have already a few images we can use as well as our roll ups that we will also bring. And yes please, please help me with the design and logo. It can either be an animated image or a really good infrastructure or climate picture. \nI will look for a picture as well but please see here an example of the text that I want on the board. This is not the final, proofread text. It is to give you an idea of what we have in mind.  \nBest, Naimo\n\nOn Fri, Apr 12, 2024 at 1:58 PM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,\nWe have made some Folkemødet related material throughout the years, they have all been different, telling different stories, mostly brochures, and flyers. From what I know, we have not made any large printed materials, like foam boards. Can you share the text/message that you want to have on the board, so that I can better guide you.\n\n1. Foam panel A0 (841x1189 mm). This is a printed product, correct (you mentioned animation, that is why I am confused here)?2. Please share the exhibition photos, so that I can have a comprehensive image of what the context is. Do you also need me to design these , with captions and UNOPS logo, so that they are branded correctly?\nThank you!\nBest Hel\n\nBest Hel\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Fri, Apr 12, 2024 at 1:39 PM Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Helena, \nWe already have the photos for the exhibition but we want to create a new foam panel with the right logo that gives a comprehensive overview of UNOPS with our logo. An animated picture that shows what UNOPS does from a-z would be to prefer but we also don't want the audience to lose focus of the text on the board.  Do we have examples from previous events?  The size is the same as with the Ukraine event: A0 foamboard prints. \nThe picture below is somewhat what I have in mind but not quite. \n\nBest, Naimo\n\nOn Fri, Apr 12, 2024 at 12:56 PM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDer Naimo,\nFollowing up to my former email, please send all approved and proofread content in a clean Google document. The foam board, and the photo exhibition, do you need help with both? As we did with the Ukraine exhibition, each board contiend a caption and UNOPS logo, I guess that this would be good for Bornholm as well. Please share the sizes for all the products and a timeline, so that we have some dates that we can plan the work ahead. \nThank you!\nBest Hel\nHelena Ohlsson | Visual designer | Corporate branding & Visual design team | Communications group | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 5155 6402 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Thu, Apr 11, 2024 at 3:35 PM Helena OHLSSON <helenao@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Naimo,\nThanks you for reaching out!\nDo you know the size of the foam panel, and could you please share the photos? Thank you!\n\nBest Hel\n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>\nDate: Tue, Apr 9, 2024 at 11:58 AM\nSubject: Background info of UNOPS on foam panels for events\nTo: Branding UNOPS <branding@unops.org>\n\nDear Branding team, \nI am reaching out to you as we are planning to attend the Danish democracy festival on Bornholm in June with the other agencies at UN City. \nWe are currently planning three events: a debate with Jorge and the Danish Foreign Minister, Lars Løkke Rasmussen; an event on mine action together with WFP; and finally, an event addressing climate change with UNEP.\nDuring the last two events, we want to have a small foto exhibition  similar to what we did for the Ukraine event last year. Fortunately, we already have the necessary photos.  However, we want to spotlight UNOPS, its mission  and capacity in the exhibition.  For this purpose, we want to create a foam panel with the right logo that gives a comprehensive overview of UNOPS.  Is this something that you can help me create? I will of course provide you with the relevant information on the poster. Also do we have previous examples for inspiration? \nWith many thanks and warm regards, Naimo",
