                        Description = "To: elisel@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Videos of UNOPS work within Mine action\nBody:\nDear Elise, \n\nI hope that all is well. As mentioned, we are attending the Danish Democracy Festival and we would really like to have videos on our work with mine action on display during the first part of the event, where an implementing partner will showcase bomb suits and different dummy mines. \nPlease see here the current concept note. \nWould it be possible to have these videos and this video in high quality? \nBest regards, Naimo\n-- \n\nNaimo Hassan Hirsi | Partnerships Analyst | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 26 83 48 78  | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
