                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-05-22").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Mykolaiv pakke - opdateret info 10.05.2024",
                        Description = "To: annkah@um.dk\nCC: vaszal@um.dk; IRYD@novonordisk.com; uuni@novonordisk.com\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Mykolaiv pakke - opdateret info 10.05.2024\nBody:\nHej Anne\nTænker det ville være godt at mødes snarest mhp. at drøfte hvordan vi kan tage dette projekt videre.\nHar du/I fx mulighed for at mødes på mandag? \nPå forhånd mange tak. \nMvhAsbjørn \nOn Fri, 17 May 2024 at 11:50, Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Anne and Vasyl\nI've reached out to Anne bilaterally to arrange a meeting. It would be super if we could meet asap to discuss how to concretely put together a package of modernising/upgrading the Mykolaiv children hospital + medical equipment + training of staff. \nPlease do let me know when you are available to meet. Would be good eg. early next week. \nBest,Asbjørn\nOn Wed, 15 May 2024 at 15:05, UUNI (Ulrik Uldall Nielsen) <uuni@novonordisk.com> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Anne and Vasyl\n \nNicolai and I had a meeting this morning with Asbjørn Brink from UNOPS regarding NN and MOFA support to Ukraine.\n\n \nI realize that there is already an ongoing conversation as well between MoFA and UNOPS on the same topic and therefore think that it will\n be better if we include Asbjørn as well in this group, especially when it comes to the conceptualization of our support in Ukraine.\n\n \nI hope that you all agree with the suggested approach.\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKind regards\n\nUlrik Uldall Nielsen\n\n\nDiabetes Health Equity, Lead\n\nGlobal Public Affairs and Sustainability\n\n+4530754738 (direct) ǀ \nUUNI@novonordisk.com \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Vasyl Zalishchuk <vaszal@um.dk>\n\n\nSent: 10. maj 2024 12:20\n\nTo: UUNI (Ulrik Uldall Nielsen) <uuni@novonordisk.com>; Anne Kahl <annkah@um.dk>\n\nCc: IRYD (Iryna Donets) <IRYD@novonordisk.com>\n\nSubject: Mykolaiv pakke - opdateret info 10.05.2024\n\n\n \n\nCaution: This email originated from outside of the Novo Nordisk email system. Use caution\n when clicking on links or opening attachments. \n\n \n\n \n \n_______________________________________________________\n \nVASYL ZALISHCHUK  /\nVASZAL@UM.DK\nHANDELSRÅDGIVER\nDIREKTE +380442001275 / MOBIL +380673069393\n \nEMBASSY OF DENMARK / UA-01901 KYIV 01\nTLF. 380 44 200 1260 /\nUKRAINE.UM.DK\n \nSÅDAN\n BEHANDLER VI PERSONOPLYSNINGER\n \n\nPlease\n consider the environment before printing this message",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000ArcSvMAJ",
                        EmailAddresses = new List<string> { "vaszal@um.dk", "iryd@novonordisk.com", "uuni@novonordisk.com", "annkah@um.dk", "asbjornb@unops.org" },
