                ),
                new (
                    "00TQx00000AvOO3MAN",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Catch-up in NYC?",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-05-23").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Catch-up in NYC?",
                        Description = "To: Satu.Lassila@gov.fi\nCC: Jenny.Haukka@gov.fi; Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Catch-up in NYC?\nBody:\nSuper! \n@Andrea: Let's just catch up in the breaks during the EB sessions. \n\nLooking forward to seeing you. \nBest,Asbjørn\nOn Thu, 23 May 2024 at 14:08, Lassila Satu (UM) <Satu.Lassila@gov.fi> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjorn,\n\n \nNice to hear from you!  Andrea is travelling to NYC for the EB and surely happy to see over coffee.\n\n \nStay well!\n\n \nCheers, Satu\n\n \n \nFrom: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: torstai 23. toukokuuta 2024 13.59\n\nTo: Lassila Satu (UM) <Satu.Lassila@gov.fi>; Haukka Jenny (UM) <Jenny.Haukka@gov.fi>; Tanzi-Albi Andrea (UM) <Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi>\n\nSubject: Catch-up in NYC?\n \n\nDear Satu, Jenny and Andrea,\n\n \n\n\nI hope all is well on your end - and that you are enjoying the spring (soon summer!) in Helsinki. \n\n\n \n\n\nI am reaching out as I was wondering if either of you would be in NYC during the upcoming EB session? If so, I would very much like to catch up over a coffee or lunch - if you have time. We have a couple of topics that I would appreciate\n if we could discuss relating to the balance of the S3i project. \n\n\n \n\n\nIf you're not in NYC, perhaps we could catch up online in the coming week at your convenience? \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you in advance! \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAsbjørn Brink | Head\n of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS\n HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish.",
