                new (
                    "00TQx00000AvtmpMAB",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Room for Childhood and the A. P. Møller Fond",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-05-23").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Room for Childhood and the A. P. Møller Fond",
                        Description = "To: mett@eifo.dk\nCC: msec@eifo.dk\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Room for Childhood and the A. P. Møller Fond\nBody:\nKære Mette\nMange tak for tilsendte koordinater på OZ. Vores kolleger i Kyiv rækker ud til dem mhp. at igangsætte due diligence processen. \nIft. videre vej frem for model 1 eller 2, har vi behov for en samlet melding fra dansk side (dvs. UM, AP Møller Fonden, EM og EIFO) om hvorvidt vi skal gå videre med model 1 eller 2 - med de fordele og ulemper som de hver især indebærer. Vi igangsætter derfor ikke drøftelse med OZ om konkret arbejdsfordeling før der foreligger en konsolideret melding fra donorers side om hvorvidt model 1 eller 2 ønskes. Det håber jeg er OK med jer. \nSom kort nævnt pr. telefon ville vi - om muligt - også meget gerne igangsætte due dilligence processen for AP Møller Fonden, mhp. at undgå at dette forsinker projektet yderligere. Det er desværre også nødvendigt - og skal gøres for alle de parter vi som FN agentur samarbejder med. \nJeg hører derfor også meget gerne fra jer, når der er grønt lys fra jer, EM, UM og AP Møller Fonden til at igangsætte due dilligence for AP Møller Fonden. \nPå forhånd mange tak. \nMvhAsbjørn\nOn Wed, 22 May 2024 at 10:12, Mette Thybo <mett@eifo.dk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKære Asbjørn,\n \nSom aftalt deler jeg nedenstående mail fra Olena Zelenska Foundation.\n \nI må meget gerne række ud til Iryna Hudz på\ni.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org. Hun har bedt om, at følgende ledere kommer CC:\nv_romanova@ukr.net; \ngorbachova@zelenskafoundation.org; \npikalova@zelenskafoundation.org.\n \nJeg kommunikerer primært med Iryna via Signal. Her har jeg informeret hende om, at det er standard praksis, at I gennemfører Due Diligence, når I\n opstarter nyt samarbejde – og at I derfor gerne vil påbegynde dette samtidig med, at I går i dialog om, hvordan I sammen kan tilgå model 2 (UNOPS som konsulent).\n \nI involverer os som aftalt bare i det omfang, I finder passende.\n \nMed venlig hilsen,\nMette\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nVenlig hilsen\nMette Thybo\nChefkonsulent\n\n\n\n\nM:\nT:\n\n\n+45 24 90 22 38 | E: mett@eifo.dk\n+45 70 60 49 60 | www.eifo.dk\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFra: Iryna Hudz <i.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org> \n\nSendt: 21. maj 2024 17:51\n\nTil: Julie Munck Ewert <jewe@eifo.dk>; Mette Thybo <mett@eifo.dk>\n\nCc: Mathias Secher <msec@eifo.dk>; Andrii Yanevskyi <andrii.yanevskyi@mfa.gov.ua>; Victoria Romanova <v_romanova@ukr.net>; gorbachova@zelenskafoundation.org; pikalova@zelenskafoundation.org\n\nEmne: Re: Room for Childhood and the A. P. Møller Fund\n\n\n \n\nDear Julia, dear Mette, colleagues,\n \nThank you for keeping us informed about the dialog with the A. P. Møller Foundation. We are ready to meet with UNOPS and discuss our project with the colleagues.\n But we would like to be transparent that\n Option 2 suits us better, when UNOPS is involved as a consultant. And we would like to discuss the terms of the consultancy\n and what it includes. After all, we already have a developed project, visualizations of the house, specifications, estimate calculations,\n a list of furniture, terms of reference for the selection of land plots, etc. This project is being successfully implemented: within the first wave, we built 14 houses for large foster families in 8 regions of Ukraine. \n \nIn addition, the Olena Zelenska Foundation, as the initiator of the project to build homes for large foster families, is now acting as a consultant to the Coordination Center for\n the Development of Family Upbringing and Child Care, which operates under the Government of Ukraine and implements the deinstitutionalization reform, as well as to local authorities, which are scaling up our project to the regions.\n \nWe strive for full transparency, so the Foundation is ready to provide A. P. Møller Foundation, EIFO and, if necessary, UNOPS, with reports on the project and its implementation.\n \nRegarding Option 1, when UNOPS takes over the project implementation, we would not like to move forward with this scenario. This could significantly delay the implementation in time,\n as well as duplicate the functions of participants and project components. And this would be inefficient.\n \nWe are ready to discuss further steps with you and UNOPS. We are eager to implement this important initiative for Ukraine together.\n \nIryna\n\n \n\n\nвт, 14 трав. 2024 р. о 16:10 Julie Munck Ewert <jewe@eifo.dk> пише:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Iryna,\n \nI am getting back to you regarding the Room for Childhood project.\n\n \nIn our continued dialogue with the A. P. Møller Foundation on securing a donation for the project, the foundation has expressed a wish for external monitoring.\n To my understanding, this is standard procedure for projects that the Danish state is involved in. We have been in contact with UNOPS, as they are the agency most used by the Danish state.\n\n                                                                              \n\nUNOPS has drafted a preliminary overall description of two potential setups for the construction in close collaboration between UNOPS and the Olena Zelenska Foundation. Option\n 1 would entail that UNOPS does the full implementation of the project by which, they would also take upon the full responsibility and liability for the project outcome. The implementation will still happen in close collaboration with you, the Olena Zelenska\n Foundation. The concrete division of labour and responsibilities will be described in detail in a legal agreement, that you will be directly involved in. Option 2 would entail that UNOPS would provide technical advice and supervision of the project implementation.\n As UNOPS will not be in control of the implementing parts of the project, UNOPS cannot undertake the responsibility and liability for the outcome of the project under option 2.\n \nWe have indications, that the A. P. Møller Foundation prefers model 1. Please consider this a means to securing the donation for the project. As we see it, this\n might also be an opportunity for the Olena Zelenska Foundation to enter into collaboration with a respected United Nations organ, that can be leveraged in future projects as well.\n\n \nUNOPS has asked us to emphasize that they truly wish a collaboration, that both parties are happy with. UNOPS have people in Kyiv that are open to initiate dialogue\n (in ukrainian), initially collaborating on outlining who does what in the project as well as kickstarting the due diligence process.\n\n \nLet me know what you think, and do not hesitate to reach out, if you have any questions.\n\n \nBest regards,\nJulie\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nVenlig hilsen\nJulie Munck Ewert\nSeniorkonsulent\n\n\n\n\nM:\nT:\n\n\n| E:\njewe@eifo.dk\n|\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIryna Hudz\n\n\n\n\nCommunication and Partnership Lead\n\n\n\n\nOlena Zelenska Foundation\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMobile: +380930894792\n\n\n\n\nE‑mail: i.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\nWeb: www.zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis message may contain confidential information intended only for the persons indicated in the address. Any use of information in this letter and attachments (including disclosure, copying,\n reproduction and distribution) by persons other than the recipients of the letter is prohibited. If you received this email in error, please notify the sender by phone or email and delete the email.\n\n\n\nЦе повідомлення може містити конфіденційну інформацію про компанію, що призначена лише для осіб, зазначених у рядку адреси. Будь-яке використання інформації з цього листа та додатків (включно з розголошенням, копіюванням, відтворенням і поширенням) особами,\n які не є отримувачами листа, заборонено. Якщо Ви отримали цього листа помилково, будь ласка, повідомте про це відправника телефоном або електронною поштою та видаліть листа.\n\n\n\n\n\nFra: Iryna Hudz <i.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org>\n\n\nSendt: 23. april 2024 15:55\n\nTil: Mette Thybo <mett@eifo.dk>\n\nCc: Julie Munck Ewert <jewe@eifo.dk>; Mathias Secher <msec@eifo.dk>; Andrii Yanevskyi <andrii.yanevskyi@mfa.gov.ua>;\n Victoria Romanova <v_romanova@ukr.net>;\ngorbachova@zelenskafoundation.org\n\nEmne: Re: Room for Childhood and the A. P. Møller Fund\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDu får ikke ofte mails fra\ni.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org.\nFå mere at vide om, hvorfor dette er vigtigt\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Mette,\n\nCorrected the error on page 7. Everything is good now.\n\nIryna\n\n \n\n\nвт, 23 квіт. 2024 р. о 16:20 Mette Thybo <mett@eifo.dk> пише:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Ms. Hudz,\n \nPlease review the attached final version.\n\n \nWe have updated page 16 and corrected some minor errors. One outstanding question remains: should this\n be \"14 house\"?\n\n \nIf you have no further comments, we will convert the attached presentation into a PDF and expect to\n share it with A. P. Møller Fonden tonight.\n \nThank you for your swift coordination in completing this document!\n \nBest regards,\nMette\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nVenlig hilsen\nMette Thybo\nProjektleder\n\n\n\n\nM:\nT:\n\n\n+45 24 90 22\n 38 | E: mett@eifo.dk\n+45 70 60 49 60 | www.eifo.dk\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIryna Hudz\n\n\n\n\nCommunication and Partnership Lead\n\n\n\n\nOlena Zelenska Foundation\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMobile: +380930894792\n\n\n\n\nE‑mail: i.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\nWeb: www.zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis message may contain confidential information intended only for the persons indicated in the address. Any use of information in\n this letter and attachments (including disclosure, copying, reproduction and distribution) by persons other than the recipients of the letter is prohibited. If you received this email in error, please notify the sender by phone or email and delete the email.\n\n\n\nЦе повідомлення може містити конфіденційну інформацію про компанію, що призначена лише для осіб, зазначених у рядку адреси. Будь-яке використання інформації з цього листа та додатків (включно з розголошенням, копіюванням, відтворенням і поширенням) особами,\n які не є отримувачами листа, заборонено. Якщо Ви отримали цього листа помилково, будь ласка, повідомте про це відправника телефоном або електронною поштою та видаліть листа.\n\n\n\n\n\nFra: Iryna Hudz <i.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org>\n\n\nSendt: 23. april 2024 13:50\n\nTil: Mette Thybo <mett@eifo.dk>\n\nCc: Julie Munck Ewert <jewe@eifo.dk>; Mathias Secher <msec@eifo.dk>; Andrii Yanevskyi <andrii.yanevskyi@mfa.gov.ua>;\n Victoria Romanova <v_romanova@ukr.net>;\ngorbachova@zelenskafoundation.org\n\nEmne: Re: Room for Childhood and the A. P. Møller Fund \n\n\n \n\nDear Mette, dear colleagues,\n\nI have updated the presentation. Please use this document for the final update (i've corrected fonts and added the necessary information).\n\nIf you need anything else, please let me know. I will stay in touch.\n\nThank you for developing this comprehensive document.\n\nIryna\n\n \n\n\nвт, 23 квіт. 2024 р. о 12:30 Mette Thybo <mett@eifo.dk> пише:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Ms. Hudz,\n \nPlease find attached our suggested draft for the Application to A.P. Moller Fonden based on the provided\n documents from the Olena Zelenska Foundation.\n \nKindly edit and add to the draft as you please. Also, please correct the layout to fit your format,\n as I didn’t download your fonts.\n \nWe may have a few additional comments. However, as we would like to share the attached document with\n A.P. Moller Fonden today, we are sharing this with you now to expedite the process.\n \nBest,\n\nMette\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nVenlig hilsen\nMette Thybo\nProjektleder\n\n\n\n\nM:\nT:\n\n\n+45 24 90 22\n 38 | E: mett@eifo.dk\n+45 70 60 49 60 | www.eifo.dk\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIryna Hudz\n\n\n\n\nCommunication and Partnership Lead\n\n\n\n\nOlena Zelenska Foundation\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMobile: +380930894792\n\n\n\n\nE‑mail: i.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\nWeb: www.zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis message may contain confidential information intended only for the persons indicated in the address. Any use of information in\n this letter and attachments (including disclosure, copying, reproduction and distribution) by persons other than the recipients of the letter is prohibited. If you received this email in error, please notify the sender by phone or email and delete the email.\n\n\n\nЦе повідомлення може містити конфіденційну інформацію про компанію, що призначена лише для осіб, зазначених у рядку адреси. Будь-яке використання інформації з цього листа та додатків (включно з розголошенням, копіюванням, відтворенням і поширенням) особами,\n які не є отримувачами листа, заборонено. Якщо Ви отримали цього листа помилково, будь ласка, повідомте про це відправника телефоном або електронною поштою та видаліть листа.\n\n\n\n\n\nFra: Iryna Hudz <i.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org>\n\n\nSendt: 22. april 2024 16:22\n\nTil: Mette Thybo <mett@eifo.dk>\n\nCc: Julie Munck Ewert <jewe@eifo.dk>; Mathias Secher <msec@eifo.dk>; Andrii Yanevskyi <andrii.yanevskyi@mfa.gov.ua>;\n Victoria Romanova <v_romanova@ukr.net>;\ngorbachova@zelenskafoundation.org\n\nEmne: Re: Room for Childhood and the A. P. Møller Fund\n\n\n \n\nDear Mette, dear all,\n\nThe material in editable format here: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ovppf4LOrWUa8vCvwuqNUW0Ig6_6SuMv?usp=sharing\n\nWe use a certain font in our presentation material (so I downloaded that two just in case).\n\nPlease provide us with a presentation for review when ready (if possible).\n\nIryna\n\n \n\n\nпн, 22 квіт. 2024 р. о 16:21 Mette Thybo <mett@eifo.dk> пише:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Ms. Hudz,\n \nThank you for sharing the application and attachments.\n \nCould you kindly share the attached documents in an editable format? Moreover, would it be possible\n for you to share your organization's PowerPoint template and, if feasible, editable versions of presentations about your organization? The first draft we plan to present to the A. P. Møller Fund today is structured more as a PowerPoint-pitch, which I intend\n to share via email with their leadership. We would like to present this information using your preferred layout.\n \nWe are prepared to assist with the formatting of this presentation, given the tight deadline. I will\n ensure that you have the opportunity to review and endorse the content and layout before we submit it to the A. P. Møller Fund today.\n \nLater this week, we will then proceed with entering the requested information into A. P. Møller Fund’s\n online application platform, using the attached information you have provided. \n\n \nBest regards,\nMette\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nVenlig hilsen\nMette Thybo\nProjektleder\n\n\n\n\nM:\nT:\n\n\n+45 24 90 22\n 38 | E: mett@eifo.dk\n+45 70 60 49 60 | www.eifo.dk\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIryna Hudz\n\n\n\n\nCommunication and Partnership Lead\n\n\n\n\nOlena Zelenska Foundation\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMobile: +380930894792\n\n\n\n\nE‑mail: i.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\nWeb: www.zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis message may contain confidential information intended only for the persons indicated in the address. Any use of information in\n this letter and attachments (including disclosure, copying, reproduction and distribution) by persons other than the recipients of the letter is prohibited. If you received this email in error, please notify the sender by phone or email and delete the email.\n\n\n\nЦе повідомлення може містити конфіденційну інформацію про компанію, що призначена лише для осіб, зазначених у рядку адреси. Будь-яке використання інформації з цього листа та додатків (включно з розголошенням, копіюванням, відтворенням і поширенням) особами,\n які не є отримувачами листа, заборонено. Якщо Ви отримали цього листа помилково, будь ласка, повідомте про це відправника телефоном або електронною поштою та видаліть листа.\n\n\n\n\n\nFra: Julie Munck Ewert <jewe@eifo.dk>\n\n\nSendt: 22. april 2024 15:09\n\nTil: Mette Thybo <mett@eifo.dk>\n\nEmne: Fwd: Room for Childhood and the A. P. Møller Fund\n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\nVenlig hilsen\nJulie Munck Ewert\nSeniorkonsulent\n\n\n\n\nM:\nT:\n\n\n| E:\njewe@eifo.dk\n|\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nFra: Iryna Hudz <i.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org>\n\nSendt: Monday, April 22, 2024 2:54:30 PM\n\nTil: Julie Munck Ewert <jewe@eifo.dk>; Mathias Secher <msec@eifo.dk>;\nandrii.yanevskyi@mfa.gov.ua <andrii.yanevskyi@mfa.gov.ua>\n\nCc: Nina Gorbachova <gorbachova@zelenskafoundation.org>; Victoria Romanova\n <v_romanova@ukr.net>\n\nEmne: Room for Childhood and the A. P. Møller Fund\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDu får ikke ofte mails fra\ni.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org.\nFå mere at vide om, hvorfor dette er vigtigt\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear colleagues,\n\nThe Foundation's director Nina Horbachova forwarded your letter to me. My name is Iryna Hudz. I work at the Olena Zelenska Foundation as Communication and Partnerships Lead. Our team has  the application.\n\nIn the attachment to the letter, please find:\n\n\nApplication;\nAnnexes: specified budget; detailed timeline; motivated application.\nIf you have any other questions, please let me know.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIryna Hudz\n\n\n\n\nCommunication and Partnerships Lead\n\n\n\n\nOlena Zelenska Foundation\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMobile: +380930894792\n\n\n\n\nE‑mail: i.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\nWeb: www.zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis message may contain confidential information intended only for the persons indicated in the address. Any use of information in\n this letter and attachments (including disclosure, copying, reproduction and distribution) by persons other than the recipients of the letter is prohibited. If you received this email in error, please notify the sender by phone or email and delete the email.\n\n\n\nЦе повідомлення може містити конфіденційну інформацію про компанію, що призначена лише для осіб, зазначених у рядку адреси. Будь-яке використання інформації з цього листа та додатків (включно з розголошенням, копіюванням, відтворенням і поширенням) особами,\n які не є отримувачами листа, заборонено. Якщо Ви отримали цього листа помилково, будь ласка, повідомте про це відправника телефоном або електронною поштою та видаліть листа.\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n--\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIryna Hudz\n\n\n\n\nCommunication and Partnership Lead\n\n\n\n\nOlena Zelenska Foundation\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMobile: +380930894792\n\n\n\n\nE‑mail: i.hudz@zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\nWeb: www.zelenskafoundation.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis message may contain confidential information intended only for the persons indicated in the address. Any use of information in\n this letter and attachments (including disclosure, copying, reproduction and distribution) by persons other than the recipients of the letter is prohibited. If you received this email in error, please notify the sender by phone or email and delete the email.\n\n\n\nЦе повідомлення може містити конфіденційну і