                        Subject = "Email: UNOPS 2023 annual report: Practical solutions where needs are greatest",
                        Description = "To: satu.lassila@formin.fi; Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi; Jenny.Haukka@gov.fi\nCC: naimoh@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: UNOPS 2023 annual report: Practical solutions where needs are greatest\nBody:\nDear Andrea, Satu and Jenny,\nFollowing the formal EB document on UNOPS' 2023 annual report, we have also developed a more plain English brochure that focuses on operations and highlights from the annual results. \nThe brochure “Practical solutions where needs are greatest” showcases a selection of UNOPS' work in support of our partners. It follows four main topics as identified in the UNOPS restated Strategic Plan 2022-2025 - the three primary themes of climate action, health and renewable energy, and four: our core context –  the ability to operate responding to conflicts and crises in the most difficult of circumstances.\nSom examples are: - 7 hospitals and 49 health centres - 55 schools - 187 km of roads - More than 2.2 million days of paid work undertaken by women - More than 23 million days of paid work created for local people - Procured $1.6 billion in goods and services – 41% from local suppliers - Across more than 80 countries, UNOPS implemented almost 1,100 projects - More than 50% of our work delivered in fragile and conflict-affected areas- Delivered around $2.7 billion worth of services on behalf of partners \n\nIt is available from our website in three languages here.\n\nBest,AsbjørnAsbjørn Brink | Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
