                new (
                    "00TQx00000AxmkRMAR",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Gavi / UNOPS Guinea Bissau support",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-05-24").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Gavi / UNOPS Guinea Bissau support",
                        Description = "To: drosset@gavi.org; mkeller@gavi.org; souedraogo@gavi.org\nCC: elenali@unops.org; elenage@unops.org; fatoufn@unops.org; seynaboud@unops.org; tidjaniw@unops.org; ferdinandn@unops.org; jakobt@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Gavi / UNOPS Guinea Bissau support\nBody:\nDear Seydou and Danielle,\nThanks for the call this morning - it was great to e-meet you and get us all connected at the country, regional and global level! Sorry we missed Marius on this occasion!\nFollowing our discussion, we duly note the upcoming 3-7 June Gavi mission in Guinea Bissau, and @Marius if possible will find time in the schedule for our country teams to meet. The objective being to discuss some of the operational challenges that UNOPS could support MOH / Gavi / other in-country partners with going forward - with a focus on complementary activities, and where we can add value or help expand / accelerate existing activities. \nAs requested by Seydou please see below a few of our \"capacity statements\" to give you an idea of how we are helping countries and their partners expand implementation capacity to improve health infrastructure, health procurement and health programme management. \nI will keep you updated on the UNOPS / Gavi Framework Agreement that is being finalised in case of need (I'm working with Irina Petkova and Laurent in your Legal team on this).\nLooking forward to hearing back on the in-country discussions - and I am often at GHC in case you are free for a coffee any time :) !\nThanks and best wishes\nLouise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube - Health facilities- Health supply chain management- WASH for health facilities- Laboratory capacity- Solar for health- Digital health- Capacity development- Emergency response",
