                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-05-24").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: [EXT] UNOPS intervention in General Debate at WHA 77",
                        Description = "To: kivejinjas@who.int\nCC: elenali@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] UNOPS intervention in General Debate at WHA 77\nBody:\nMany thanks Salim,Best wishesLouise \n\nOn Fri, 24 May 2024 at 12:06, KIVEJINJA, Salim <kivejinjas@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise,\n \nWe acknowledge receipt of your request and will ensure the registration of the United Nations Office for Project Services (UNOPS) for the WHA General Debate\n (agenda item 3).\n \nRegards,\n \nSalim\n \n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: lundi, 20 mai 2024 16:45\n\nTo: HQ Governing Bodies <hqgoverningbodies@who.int>\n\nCc: Elena Librino <elenali@unops.org>; OSEI, Jude <oseij@who.int>\n\nSubject: [EXT] UNOPS intervention in General Debate at WHA 77\n\n \n\n\nDear Colleagues\n\n\nThank you for your invitation to join WHA 77. \n\n\nPlease note I wish to make an intervention on behalf of the United Nations Office for Project Services (UNOPS) during the General Debate / Discussion.\n\n\nI look forward to receiving any further guidance.\n\n\nWith thanks and best wishes\n\n\nLouise \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \n\n\nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000Axn3mMAB",
