                        Subject = "Email: Fwd: FW: Sixth Humanitarian Senior Officials Meeting on Yemen – updated agenda",
                        Description = "To: usmana@unops.org\nCC: LaetitiaK@unops.org; JeromeDT@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: FW: Sixth Humanitarian Senior Officials Meeting on Yemen – updated agenda\nBody:\nFYIMariacarmen Colitti | Head of Office and Representative | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Brussels, Belgium | Tel: + 32 2 7881840| www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: ECHO-C3@ec.europa.eu <ECHO-C3@ec.europa.eu>\nDate: Mon, May 6, 2024 at 3:51 PM\nSubject: FW: Sixth Humanitarian Senior Officials Meeting on Yemen – updated agenda\nTo: ECHO-C3@ec.europa.eu <ECHO-C3@ec.europa.eu>\nCc: sofia.h.karlsson@gov.se <sofia.h.karlsson@gov.se>, LENORMAND Patrice <Patrice.LENORMAND@ec.europa.eu>, NEDKOVA Ani <Ani.NEDKOVA@ec.europa.eu>, GHELARDUCCI Martina <Martina.GHELARDUCCI@ec.europa.eu>, adel.elsayed.sparr@gov.se <adel.elsayed.sparr@gov.se>, DECAILLET Anne <Anne.DECAILLET@ec.europa.eu>, BLANCO GUILLEN Judith <Judith.BLANCO-GUILLEN@ec.europa.eu>, DIKOMITIS Elena <Elena.DIKOMITIS@ec.europa.eu>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Madam, Dear Sir, \n \nAhead of the sixth Humanitarian Senior Officials Meeting on Yemen, we have the pleasure to share the updated agenda for the event.\n \nLooking forward to a fruitful discussion.\n \nECHO C3 SECRETARIAT\n\n \n \n\n\nEuropean Commission\nDirectorate-General for European Civil Protection and Humanitarian Aid Operations\nECHO. C –\nNeighbourhood, Middle East, South-West and Central Asia\n\nUnit C.3 – South-West Asia and Arabian Peninsula \nL-86 02/23\n\nB-1049 Brussels/Belgium\n\n+32 2 295 34 88",
