                        Description = "To: jeromedt@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: European Commission: your subscription for email alerts from the Press corner\nBody:\nPress Corner\n \n \n \n\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n European Commission: your subscription for email alerts from the Press corner\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Documents matching your subscription parameters - Date: 28/05/2024\n\t \n\t Brussels VIII Conference renews international support for Syria and the region raising more than €7.5 billion \n\t On 27 May, during the eighth edition of the Brussels Conference on ‘Supporting the future of Syria and the region' hosted by the European Union, the donor community pledged a total amount of €7.5 billion. \n\t \n\n\n\n\n\t\n\tManage your notifications/alerts: \n\tadd, change, unsubscribe\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\tThe European Commission is committed to personal data protection. Any personal data is processed in line with the Regulation(EU)2018/1725.\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\tAll personal information processed by the Directorate-General for Communication / European Commission Representations is treated accordingly.",
