                    "00TQx00000B8tp4MAB",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Connecting at WHA",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-05-29").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Connecting at WHA",
                        Description = "To: Lea.Hegg@gatesfoundation.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Connecting at WHA\nBody:\nHi Lea, great! yes today afternoon would work well - how about 14.30 ? \nOn Wed, 29 May 2024 at 09:01, Lea Hegg <Lea.Hegg@gatesfoundation.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nHi Louise,\n\n\n\nGreat to be in touch!\n\n\n\nI'd love to meet. At the moment I have availability in the afternoons today, tomorrow and Friday. What is your availability?\n\n\n\nLea\n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\nSent: Tuesday, May 28, 2024 5:34:45 PM\n\nTo: Lea Hegg <Lea.Hegg@gatesfoundation.org>\n\nSubject: Connecting at WHA\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou don't often get email from louisel@unops.org. \nLearn why this is important\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Lea!\nI hope this finds you well - Adrien (de Chaisemartin) mentioned you wanted to learn more about our work in FCVs AND that you are at WHA :) Shall we meet ?\nLooking forward to hearing from you and hope we can find a moment to connect\nAll best wishes \nLouise \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
