                        Name = "Email: Fwd: UNHCR introduction of Health Insurance",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-05-29").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Fwd: UNHCR introduction of Health Insurance",
                        Description = "To: gelsei@unhcr.org\nCC: laurentium@unops.org; CHAPURSK@unhcr.org; patelz@unhcr.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: UNHCR introduction of Health Insurance\nBody:\nDear Gergo,\nAs per our conversation today, I have sent a heads up email to the following key people that they will be receiving an email via UNHCR informing them of the exciting news of the IICA health insurance.Please send the email to the following:\nVictoria CAMPBELL <victoriac@unops.org>: Deputy Director, People and Performance GroupAlejo EIRIZ <alejoe@unops.org>: Human Resources SpecialistAnne-Lise VILPREUX <annelisev@unops.org>: Practice Advisor - HR Michaela PEDERSEN <michaelap@unops.org>: Administrative Team Lead Arnaud SGAMBATO <arnauds@unops.org>: Head of Unit - Partnerships Development \nBest regards,Lorraine-- \nLorraine Anabtawi | HR Partnerships Specialist | Partnerships and Liaison Group |\nUNOPS | Tel: 972548174189 | Skype:\nlorraine.anabtawi | www.unops.org | Supplying value, delivering results,\nchanging lives\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date\nwith UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to\nour external newsletter in English, French or Spanish\n\n \n\n \n\n-- \nLorraine Anabtawi | HR Partnerships Specialist | Partnerships and Liaison Group |\nUNOPS | Tel: 972548174189 | Skype:\nlorraine.anabtawi | www.unops.org | Supplying value, delivering results,\nchanging lives\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date\nwith UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to\nour external newsletter in English, French or Spanish",
