                        Subject = "Email: Interventions for WHA 77 documentation",
                        Description = "To: takaenzanap@who.int\nCC: oseij@who.int\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Interventions for WHA 77 documentation\nBody:\nDear Paida \nPlease find attached our two WHA 77 interventions - I copied them to \"interpret\" in the body of the email on the day, so here I have pdf'd for your ease of posting here in General debate / plenary and Item 17 in Committee A.Many thanks and have a great week!\n\nBest wishes Louise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
