                        Subject = "Email: Climate and Health at WHS",
                        Description = "To: maierom@who.int\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Climate and Health at WHS\nBody:\nHi Marina!\nIt was great to see you and the team the other evening at the Global Fund WHA 77 side event on climate financing, it was nice to have a more substantive chat with Diarmud :)\nRegarding the World Health Summit in October 2024, I wanted to see if you guys were planning anything on Climate & Health (e.g. sustainable / solarisation / health procurement and waste mgmt etc), esp in lead up to COP29 (will there be another Health Day?!). I would be happy to brainstorm / provide speakers to talk about implementation lessons etc\nLooking forward to hearing from you Thanks and best wishes, Louise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
                        Location = null,
