                        Description = "To: msumilas@usaid.gov\nCC: emiliep@unops.org; kirstined@unops.org; annag@unops.org; patrickel@unops.org; waingchita@unops.org; lucp@state.gov; sisonmj@state.gov\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Letter from UN Under-Secretary-General and Executive Director of UNOPS, Mr. Jorge Moreira da Silva\nBody:\nDear Ms. Sumilas,\nI hope this finds you well. On behalf of UN Under-Secretary-General and Executive Director of UNOPS, Mr. Jorge Moreira da Silva, please find a letter for your kind attention.\nThanks for confirming the reception of this letter.\nWith best regards,--Sarah Dubord-Gagnon| Senior Executive Assistant to Under-Secretary-General and Executive Director | UNOPS Executive Office | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 31 48 69 15 | www.unops.org",
