                        Description = "To: sarahdg@unops.org\nCC: emiliep@unops.org; kirstined@unops.org; annag@unops.org; patrickel@unops.org; waingchita@unops.org; lucp@state.gov; joshuakaufman@usaid.gov; ksundsmo@usaid.gov; nalavi@usaid.gov; sisonmj@state.gov; ckiamie@usaid.gov; ebuckingham@usaid.gov\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Letter from UN Under-Secretary-General and Executive Director of UNOPS, Mr. Jorge Moreira da Silva\nBody:\nAdding one other person, mi\nOn Mon, Jun 17, 2024 at 9:43 AM Michele Sumilas <msumilas@usaid.gov> wrote:\nThank you for this update and look forward to next steps.  I have cc'd my team who will work on the next steps, mi\nOn Wed, Jun 12, 2024 at 6:20 AM Sarah DUBORD-GAGNON <sarahdg@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Ms. Sumilas,\nI hope this finds you well. On behalf of UN Under-Secretary-General and Executive Director of UNOPS, Mr. Jorge Moreira da Silva, please find a letter for your kind attention.\nThanks for confirming the reception of this letter.\nWith best regards,--Sarah Dubord-Gagnon| Senior Executive Assistant to Under-Secretary-General and Executive Director | UNOPS Executive Office | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 31 48 69 15 | www.unops.org",
