                new (
                    "00TQx00000BwxslMAB",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Read Ahead Slides for Friday's Meeting",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-05-14").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Read Ahead Slides for Friday's Meeting",
                        Description = "To: WallJT2@state.gov; BrinkmannC@state.gov\nCC: svene@unops.org; iraklij@unops.org; garramonegg@state.gov; GreeneSM2@state.gov; lamannane@state.gov\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Read Ahead Slides for Friday's Meeting\nBody:\nDear Jim and Claudia:\nI hope you are both well. My colleagues in our Finance Group, who will be briefing you on Friday, have put together some slides for the meeting. I wanted to send these so you could review them before the meeting and flag any questions. I apologize for the formatting getting slightly off when converting them from Google. \nHowever, I want to make one caveat: These slides are not meant to be stand-alone; they will need to accompany the briefing from our finance team. \nWe look forward to talking with you on Friday. In the meantime, please let me know if you have any questions or need additional information. \nBest regards, Patrick \n-- \nPatrick Ellsworth | Senior Partnerships Advisor | Address: 1775 K Street NW, Washington, DC 20006 |Tel: +1 703 350 2932 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube\nVirus-free.www.avast.com",
