                        Subject = "Email: UNOPS Draft to INL--Proposed, Revised LOA Language (June 13, 2024)",
                        Description = "To: PrughVP@state.gov; GreeneSM2@state.gov; BrinkmannC@state.gov\nCC: elizabethdu@unops.org; svene@unops.org; iraklij@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: UNOPS Draft to INL--Proposed, Revised LOA Language (June 13, 2024)\nBody:\nDear Stephanie and Claudia:\nThank you so much for taking the time to meet with us today. I am forwarding the draft proposal from UNOPS regarding the revised language to be included in all INL LOAs with UNOPS. \nWe look forward to your response and working with you and the INL team to finalize the language.  Please let us know if you have any questions or need additional information. \nBest regards, Patrick \n-- \nPatrick Ellsworth | Senior Partnerships Advisor | Address: 1775 K Street NW, Washington, DC 20006 |Tel: +1 703 350 2932 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
