                        Subject = "Email: Re: Follow-up meeting regarding Gaza mechanism",
                        Description = "To: karl.svensson@gov.se\nCC: beatrice.chamberlain@gov.se; naimoh@unops.org; lorena.acevedo.narea@gov.se\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Follow-up meeting regarding Gaza mechanism\nBody:\nDear Karl, \nA pleasure to e-meet you. I look forward to continuing the constructive collaboration with you throughout the summer. \nI would be happy to meet you for an online intro-call in the beginning of July. Would for example July 2nd at 13.00 work for you?\nBest,Asbjørn\nOn Tue, 18 Jun 2024 at 16:59, Karl Svensson <karl.svensson@gov.se> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear\nAsbjørn,\n \nAs Lorena already mentioned, I will be covering the UNOPS portfolio throughout the rest of the summer.\n\n \nUnfortunately, I will be out of office next week but would be happy if we could establish contact in the beginning of July.\n\n \nI will get back to you when I return to office.\n\n \n \nKind regards,\n\n \n\nKarl Svensson\n\nDesk Officer\n\nDepartment for Multilateral Governance and Humanitarian Policy\n\nMinistry for Foreign Affairs\n\n103 39 Stockholm, Sweden\n\nMob. (+46) 076-7814493\n\nkarl.svensson@gov.se\n\nwww.government.se\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrån: Beatrice Chamberlain <beatrice.chamberlain@gov.se>\n\n\nSkickat: den 18 juni 2024 16:26\n\nTill: Lorena Acevedo Narea <lorena.acevedo.narea@gov.se>; Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\nKopia: Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>; Karl Svensson <karl.svensson@gov.se>\n\nÄmne: Sv: Follow-up meeting regarding Gaza mechanism\n\n\n \nDear Asbjörn,\n\n \nThank you for your kind follow-up – and apologies for my very late reply!\n \nI am travelling a bit this week and next, but will be in the office and available for a meeting on Wednesday, Thursday or Friday next\n week. How does that look on your end?\n \nBest regards,\n\nBeatrice\n \nBeatrice Chamberlain\n\nDesk Officer\nSection for Humanitarian Affairs\n\nDepartment for Multilateral Governance and Humanitarian Policy\n\nMinistry for Foreign Affairs\n\nMob. +46761123749\n\nbeatrice.chamberlain@gov.se\n\nwww.government.se\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrån: Lorena Acevedo Narea <lorena.acevedo.narea@gov.se>\n\n\nSkickat: den 18 juni 2024 13:54\n\nTill: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>; Beatrice Chamberlain <beatrice.chamberlain@gov.se>\n\nKopia: Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>; Karl Svensson <karl.svensson@gov.se>\n\nÄmne: Sv: Follow-up meeting regarding Gaza mechanism\n\n\n \nDear Asbjörn,\n\n \nI take the opportunity to introduce you to my colleague Karl Svensson, who will be covering the UNOPS portfolio until the end of August.\n\n \nKind regards,\n\n \nLorena\n \nLorena Acevedo Narea\n\nUN Reform\n\n\nDepartment for Multilateral Governance and Humanitarian Policy\n\nMinistry for Foreign Affairs\n\n103 39 Stockholm\n\nTel. 08-405 84 37\n\nMob. 076-130 17 66\n\nlorena.acevedo.narea@gov.se\n\nwww.government.se\n\n\n\n\n \n \n \n \n\nFrån: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSkickat: den 18 juni 2024 13:48\n\nTill: Beatrice Chamberlain <beatrice.chamberlain@gov.se>\n\nKopia: Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>; Lorena Acevedo Narea <lorena.acevedo.narea@gov.se>\n\nÄmne: Re: Follow-up meeting regarding Gaza mechanism\n\n \n\nDear Beatrice\n\n \n\n\nA kind reminder to see if we together could find a workable time slot. \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you in advance. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Mon, 27 May 2024 at 14:29, Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\nDear Beatrice, \n\n \n\n\nFollowing up on our pleasant conversation on May 21 regarding the Gaza mechanism, I wanted to reach out to you to set up a meeting with key members of our team working specifically on the Gaza mechanism to ensure that\n we can provide full and adequate responses to Carl and other colleagues of yours. \n\n\n \n\n\nCould I kindly ask for you to send me a few suggested time slots that might work on your end? Then I will gather the relevant staff on our side for an online meeting. \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you very much in advance. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAsbjørn Brink | Head\n of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish.",
