                        Subject = "Email: RE: UNOPS - request for a meeting",
                        Description = "To: mariacarmenco@unops.org\nCC: ljiljana.jevtovic@mei.gov.rs\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: UNOPS - request for a meeting\nBody:\nDear Mrs. Colitti,Thank you for your email and I can confirm the meeting with Ambassador Apostolovic for Friday 7th June at 11h30 at our premises.If you need anything else from our side please let me know.Best regards,\nAleksandar Cabarkapa________________________________ Mission of the Republic of Serbia to the EU Boulevard du Régent 53, 1000 Brussels Tel: +32 2 649 82 42 Fax: +32 2 649 08 78 e-mail: mission.serbia.eu@mfa.rs     From: Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org> \nTo: <danijel.apostolovic@mfa.rs> \nCc: Ljiljana Jevtović <ljiljana.jevtovic@mei.gov.rs> \nSent: 6/4/2024 11:51 AM \nSubject: UNOPS - request for a meeting Dear Ambassador, Dear Danijel, First of all, congratulations for your recent official appointment as Ambassador of Serbia to the EU. I am writing to you as my colleagues Michela Telatin, Director of the UNOPS Serbia Multi Country Office and Vera Jovanovic, Partnerships specialist, will be in Brussels for meetings with DG NEAR around UNOPS support to the accession process in Western Balkans. By the occasion they asked for a courtesy visit to you on Friday 7 June possibly between 10:30 and 12:30. Thank you in advance for your availability. Very best regards,CarmenMariacarmen Colitti | Head of Office and Representative | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Brussels, Belgium | Tel: + 32 2 7881840| www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. \n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
