                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-06-18").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: RE: UNOPS - FPI.2 - registration of additional visitor",
                        Description = "To: laetitiak@unops.org\nCC: mariacarmenco@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: UNOPS - FPI.2 - registration of additional visitor\nBody:\nWell received, Laetitia. Have shared your info with relevant colleagues.\n\nSee you soon, \n\nJulia \n \n\nFrom: Laetitia KRAUS <laetitiak@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Tuesday, June 18, 2024 2:38 PM\n\nTo: RUPPEL Julia (FPI) <Julia.RUPPEL@ec.europa.eu>\n\nCc: Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org>; STOYANOVA Rayna (FPI) <Rayna.STOYANOVA@ec.europa.eu>\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS - FPI.2 - registration of additional visitor\n\n \n\n\n\nDear Julia ,\n\n\nThank you. Here is the info:\n\n\nKraus \n\n\nLaetitia \n\n\nGerman \n\n\nP3687999 (ID). \n\n\n \n\n\nSee you later. \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you \n\n\nLaetitia \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nLaetitia Kraus | Senior Partnerships Advisor -EU Institutions and Member States | Partnerships Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Tel: + 32 (0) 475583714 |\n\nwww.unops.org\n\n\n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish\n\n    \n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, 18 Jun 2024, 14:31 RUPPEL Julia, <Julia.RUPPEL@ec.europa.eu> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Laetitia,\n\n \nYou are more than welcome to join the meeting this afternoon. Could you please still send me your details (see below), so we can register you asap as an external visitor:\n\nSurname:\n\nName:\n\nNationality: \n\nPassport nr.:\nPlease bring your ID card/passport you indicated with you this afternoon. FYI, EEAS geo colleagues covering LYB, TUN and EGY will also join us for the meeting.\n\nLooking forward to seeing you soon.\n\nBest,\n\nJulia\n\n \n\nFrom: Laetitia KRAUS <laetitiak@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Tuesday, June 18, 2024 2:24 PM\n\nTo: RUPPEL Julia (FPI) <Julia.RUPPEL@ec.europa.eu>\n\nCc: Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS - FPI.2\n\n \n\n\nDear Julia, \n\n\nJust to let you know that I will also be joining the meeting later. Hope thats fine. \n\n\n \n\n\nKind regards \n\n\nLaetitia \n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nLaetitia Kraus | Senior Partnerships Advisor -EU Institutions and Member States | Partnerships Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Tel: + 32 (0) 475583714 |\n\nwww.unops.org\n\n\n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish\n\n    \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Mon, 10 Jun 2024, 16:15 RUPPEL Julia, <Julia.RUPPEL@ec.europa.eu> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Carmen,\n\n \nMy apologies, I must have overlooked your email confirming the meeting.\n\n \nI look forward to meeting you and your colleagues on\nTuesday, 18/06, at 5-6pm at the EEAS. While we have registered you as visitors at the EEAS, please bring your passports with you on the day. I will meet you at 16.50h at the reception of the EEAS in the entrance hall.  \n \nKind regards,\n\nJulia  \n \nFrom: Mariacarmen COLITTI\nmariacarmenco@unops.org\n\n\nSent: Monday, June 10, 2024 2:39 PM\n\nTo: RUPPEL Julia (FPI) \nJulia.RUPPEL@ec.europa.eu\n\nCc: Laetitia KRAUS LaetitiaK@unops.org; Jerome DE THYSEBAERT\nJeromeDT@unops.org\n\nSubject: Re: Request for a Meeting - North Africa Office\n \nDear Julia,\n \nI had actually replied to you straight away, confirming at 4 pm. In any case, 5pm will be ok.\n \nhere are the names and data of the colleagues and myself:\n \nSurname:Nathalie\n\nName:Angibeau\n\nNationality: Canadian\n\nPassport nr.:AR657911\n \nName: Claudia \nSurname: Rosano\nNationality: Italian\nPassport number: YB7382340\n \nName:  Mariacarmen\nSurname: Colitti\nNationality: Italian\nPassport number: YA7715194 \n \nBest regards,\n\nCarmen\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\nMariacarmen Colitti\n| Head of Office and Representative | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office\n| Brussels, Belgium | Tel: + 32 2 7881840|\nwww.unops.org \nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish. \n\n\n \n \nOn Mon, Jun 10, 2024 at 2:26 PM RUPPEL Julia <Julia.RUPPEL@ec.europa.eu> wrote:\nDear Carmen,\n\n \nIn case you are still interested in meeting on 18/06, I am now only available at 5pm or at 9am that day. Grateful for letting me know if either of these slots work for you and who\n would attend the meeting from UNOPS side, so I can register colleagues as visitors.\n \nMany thanks and kind regards,\n\nJulia\n \nFrom: RUPPEL Julia (FPI)\n\n\nSent: Friday, May 31, 2024 5:29 PM\n\nTo: 'Mariacarmen COLITTI' <mariacarmenco@unops.org>\n\nCc: Laetitia KRAUS <LaetitiaK@unops.org>; Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <JeromeDT@unops.org>\n\nSubject: RE: Request for a Meeting - North Africa Office\n \nDear Carmen,\n\n \nOn Tuesday 18/06, I am available to meet at the EEAS from 2pm onwards. Let me know what time in the afternoon will suit you best. Also grateful for sharing with me the following\n information regarding the guest/s, so I can register them as visitors in our system:\n\n \nSurname:\n\nName:\n\nNationality:\n\nID card nr./passport nr.:\n\n \nMany thanks and kind regards,\n\nJulia\n\n \nFrom: Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, May 31, 2024 3:48 PM\n\nTo: RUPPEL Julia (FPI) <Julia.RUPPEL@ec.europa.eu>\n\nCc: Laetitia KRAUS <LaetitiaK@unops.org>; Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <JeromeDT@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Request for a Meeting - North Africa Office\n \nDear Julia,\n \nFollowing-up to Jesper's message. What time would suit you best on June 18?\n \nThanks\nCarmen\n \n \n \n\n\n\nMariacarmen Colitti\n| Head of Office and Representative | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office\n| Brussels, Belgium | Tel: + 32 2 7881840|\nwww.unops.org \nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish. \n\n\n \n \nOn Fri, May 31, 2024 at 3:28 PM PEDERSEN Jesper <Jesper.PEDERSEN@ec.europa.eu> wrote:\nDear Carmen,\n \nKindly liaise with Julia in copy.\n \nBest regards,\n \nJesper\n \n\nFrom: Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, May 31, 2024 12:57 PM\n\nTo: PEDERSEN Jesper (FPI) <Jesper.PEDERSEN@ec.europa.eu>\n\nCc: Laetitia KRAUS <LaetitiaK@unops.org>; Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <JeromeDT@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Request for a Meeting - North Africa Office\n\n \n\nDear Jesper,\n\n \n\nThank you so much for the swift reply. Is there anyone in your team who would be available?\n\n \n\nHave a nice weekend\n\nCarmen\n\n\n\n\nMariacarmen Colitti\n| Head of Office and Representative | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office\n| Brussels, Belgium | Tel: + 32 2 7881840|\nwww.unops.org \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish. \n\n\n\n \n\n \n\nOn Fri, May 31, 2024 at 12:54 PM PEDERSEN Jesper <Jesper.PEDERSEN@ec.europa.eu> wrote:\n\nDear Carmen,\n\n \n\nThank you for the message. I will be travelling that week and thus not available.\n\n \n\nBest regards,\n\n \n\nJesper\n\n \n\nFrom: Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Thursday, May 30, 2024 5:23 PM\n\nTo: PEDERSEN Jesper (FPI) <Jesper.PEDERSEN@ec.europa.eu>\n\nCc: Laetitia KRAUS <LaetitiaK@unops.org>; Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <JeromeDT@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Request for a Meeting - North Africa Office\n\n \n\nDear Jesper,\n\n \n\nI hope all is well with you in such a hectic moment.\n\n \n\nWe will have here our Head of the North Africa Office, Nathalie Angibeau, based in Tunis, who covers, among others, Tunisia, Libya and Egypt.\n\n \n\nWould you have time for an exchange with her on 18 June?\n\n\n\nThank you so much\n\nCarmen\n\n \n\nMariacarmen Colitti\n| Head of Office and Representative | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office\n| Brussels, Belgium | Tel: + 32 2 7881840|\nwww.unops.org \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish.",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
