                        Subject = "Email: Fwd: WHO_attending the Central Asia International Health Investment Forum 26–27 June 2024, Bishkek, Kyrgyzstan",
                        Description = "To: louisel@unops.org\nCC: elnuras@unops.org; freyavg@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: WHO_attending the Central Asia International Health Investment Forum 26–27 June 2024, Bishkek, Kyrgyzstan\nBody:\nDear Louise,\nI just received the link for registration and filled in the application. \nThank you for your support - much appreciated.\nLet me know if you think it would be useful to connect before the event to receive your overall guidance, advice and tips. \nI am also happy to receive those by email, whatever is more convenient for you.  \nWarm regards,Konstantin Egorov | Partnerships Advisor | ECR, AUMCO | Tashkent, Uzbekistan | Tel: +998-94-999-4358 | www.unops.org \nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French, or Spanish.  \n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Health Investment Forum in CA <HealthInvestmentForumCA@who.int>\nDate: Wed, Jun 19, 2024 at 4:51 PM\nSubject: WHO_attending the Central Asia International Health Investment Forum 26–27 June 2024, Bishkek, Kyrgyzstan\nTo: konstantine@unops.org <konstantine@unops.org>\nCc: Liviu Vedrasco <vedrascol@who.int>, MAUER-STENDER, Kristina <mauerstenderk@who.int>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \nDear Mr Egorov\nWe were glad to know you will be Central Asia Climate Fund at the Central Asia International Health Investment Forum, which will be held on 26-27 June in Bishkek, Kyrgyzstan.\nWhile we are in process of finalizing logistical preparations can we ask you to please complete the registration form at this link:\nhttps://forms.office.com/e/xhywqCtw3H\nIt is also accessible with the below QR -code\n \n\n \nPlease note that you can save the form for further editing should you not be able to fill in all the details required. We will share the detailed practical information in the coming weeks.\nPlease feel free to reach out in case any practical or technical questions arise\nBest regards\nAnna \n \nAnna Chaturvedi\n\nProgramme Assistant",
