                        Description = "To: ryanm@who.int; sarane@unops.org\nCC: kabirso@who.int; josephineo@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: WHO request - Myanmar\nBody:\nDear Mike Great to bump into you just now. As promised this is to put you in touch with Sara, the Director of our Myanmar office.  I’m happy to set up a call or feel free to reach out to her directly. \n\nDear SaraPlease e-meet Mike Ryan, my old boss :) and Deputy DG and Exec Director of WHOs Health emergencies programme. Mike mentioned he’d like some background and / or support on procurement / logistics for a cholera outbreak. \nIt was a fleeting conversation - so a call to understand how / if UNOPS can support WHO would be good!  \nCopying Sophia (Mikes executive officer)  and Josephine (Head of our health team in Myanmar) to help with coordination. \nThanks and best wishes Louise \n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
