                        Description = "To: louisel@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: FYI: Online Message for Negotiation RFP TGF-24-33 (LFA services in The Republic of Uganda) Was Received\nBody:\nFYI. There is an LFA RfP for Uganda, it is one of our biggest webbuy clients. We will not apply.\nMarionMs. Marion Cassen Strîmbu | Portfolio & Partnerships Manager | Advisory Services Portfolio UNOPS Geneva Office | Global Portfolios Office (GPO)11-13, chemin des\nAnémones, 1219 Châtelaine - Geneva, Switzerland\n\n\n\n\n\nTel: +41 22 917 8557 | Skype:\nmarion_cassen | www.unops.org \n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: GFSCloud.Admin@theglobalfund.org <enmo.fa.sender@workflow.mail.us2.cloud.oracle.com>\nDate: Wed, Jun 19, 2024 at 1:22 PM\nSubject: FYI: Online Message for Negotiation RFP TGF-24-33 (LFA services in The Republic of Uganda) Was Received\nTo: <ecr.gva.global.fund.admin@unops.org>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n \t\n \t\n \t\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOnline Message\nFrom The Global Fund\nSubject Answers to questions Received\nRFQ TGF-24-33 LFA services in The Republic of Uganda\nClose Date 03/Jul/2024 5:00 PM\n\n\n\n\n\n Reply to Message\n\n\n\n\nDear Suppliers, \n\n\nPlease find attached to this message the answers to a compiled list of questions we received withing the Q&A timeframe. \n\n\nThank you. \nBest Regards,\nGabriel Albaret\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 19/Jun/2024 1:22 PM\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Submitted by Gabriel ALBARET\n \n \n \n \n \n \n\nRFP TGF-24-33 LFA Services for Uganda_Questions and Answers table.pdf\n \n \n \n\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Reply to Message",
