                        Subject = "Email: Medical needs - assistance to Mykolaiv",
                        Description = "To: IRYD@novonordisk.com; uuni@novonordisk.com; annkah@um.dk; asbjornb@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Medical needs - assistance to Mykolaiv\nBody:\nPresentation of the verified needs is enclosed to this invitation\n \nAgenda:\n \n1.   \nPresentation of the package (Vasyl & Iryna)\n\n2.   \nUNOPS’s take on the package – capacity, process etc. (Asbjørn)\n\n3.   \nNext steps and processes (Ulrik & Anne)\n\n4.   \nAOB\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\nMicrosoft Teams\n\nHar du brug for hjælp? \n\n\n\nDeltag\n i mødet nu \n\n\nMøde-id:\n337 717 861 068\n\n\n\nAdgangskode:\nf3fzk8\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTilmeld dig på en enhed til videomøder\n\n\n\nLejernøgle:\nteams@meet.um.dk\n\n\n\nVideo-id:\n123 041 553 3\n\n\n\nFlere oplysninger\n\n\n\nFor arrangører:\nMødeindstillinger\n\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________",
