                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-06-20").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Global Fund / UNOPS Guinea Bissau",
                        Description = "To: Bruno.Viana@theglobalfund.org; Lee.Hicks@theglobalfund.org; ibrahims@unops.org\nCC: seynaboud@unops.org; houcema@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Global Fund / UNOPS Guinea Bissau\nBody:\nDear Bruno and Lee\nThanks for the helpful call today and good to hear you will be in Bissau for a mission next week.  I am introducing / connecting you in this email to Ibrahim SANI, our engineer in Bissau, and focal point for this project. \nIt will be important for Sani (and Houcem, our Head of Programmes in Dakar, also in copy) to understand what amount of space the \"16 palettes\" are currently occupying in the Warehouse - if it is less than 10% the assessment should be fine, if it is more than 10%, there will be additional time needed to move stuff out / around, in order to carry out the full assessment.As promised on the call, Seynabou will share the current concept note again today, with everyone at Dr Ilda's request.  When we have the additional information regarding palettes, we will update the concept note, in order to finalise the exact scope of work and timeline, and when the concept note is final and agreed, we will transfer the information to a standard Agreement for review and signature by relevant stakeholders.\nLooking forward to working with you on this in support of MOH / PR.\nThanks and best wishes Louise \nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
