                        Name = "Email: Re: [EXT] Meeting ED UNOPS / DG WHO",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-07-03").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: [EXT] Meeting ED UNOPS / DG WHO",
                        Description = "To: elhalabis@who.int\nCC: DGOffice@who.int; lewisci@who.int\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] Meeting ED UNOPS / DG WHO\nBody:\nDear ShenaazThanks for your message and will stand by for your response!Much appreciatedBest wishes Louise\n\nOn Wed, 3 Jul 2024 at 11:58, EL-HALABI, Shenaaz <elhalabis@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise \nUnfortunately I am not able to give you timelines on when I will be able to five you feedback on the meeting.\n\nWill do our best to come back soon.\nRegards\nShenaaz\n \nShenaaz El-Halabi\nDirector\nOffice of the Director General\nWorld Health Organisation\nEmail:elhalabis@who.int\nOffice number:+41227911951\nMobile number:+41 792393270\n \n\n \n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org> \n\nSent: Wednesday, July 3, 2024 11:15 AM\n\nTo: EL-HALABI, Shenaaz <elhalabis@who.int>\n\nCc: Office of the Director-General <DGOffice@who.int>; LEWIS, Cindi <lewisci@who.int>\n\nSubject: [EXT] Meeting ED UNOPS / DG WHO\n\n \n\n\n\nDear Shenaaz\n\n\nHope all is well with you. Would you kindly let me know when we might hear back regarding the time slot for the meeting with DG on 8 or 9 July. \n\n\nIt would be super helpful so our Executive Office can finalise flights etc..\n\n\nMany thanks and speak soon!\n\nlouise\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Mon, 1 Jul 2024 at 16:47, Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Shenaaz\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you for your message - primarily, a courtesy visit and also to highlight ongoing UNOPS/WHO collaboration, and our commitment to scale up support to WHO and member states\n to  implement GPW14 / accelerate progress in SDG3, particularly in conflict and climate-fragile settings. \n\n\n \n\n\nUNOPS works directly with WHO in over 20 countries providing support for HR, procurement and health infrastructure. \n\n\nWe also work with other health funding partners in 127 countries, delivering around USD 1bn annually to strengthen health systems (health procurement, programme management, and\n health infrastructures. We also host roll back malaria, scaling up nutrition, stop TB, AT scale, and a number of other health related partnerships.\n\n\n \n\n\nPlease let me know if you need any more background. \n\n\nThanks and best wishes\n\n\nLouise\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Mon, 1 Jul 2024 at 15:54, EL-HALABI, Shenaaz <elhalabis@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise\nWhat is the purpose of this meeting?\nRegards\nShenaaz\n \nShenaaz El-Halabi\nDirector\nOffice of the Director General\nWorld Health Organisation\nEmail:elhalabis@who.int\nOffice number:+41227911951\nMobile number:+41 792393270\n \n\n \n\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Monday, July 1, 2024 11:03 AM\n\nTo: EL-HALABI, Shenaaz <elhalabis@who.int>; LEWIS, Cindi <lewisci@who.int>\n\nCc: Office of the Director-General <DGOffice@who.int>\n\nSubject: [EXT] Meeting ED UNOPS / DG WHO\n\n \n\n\n\nDear Shenaaz and Cindi\n\n\nHope this finds you well!  We are aiming to finalise planning for Jorge's mission to Geneva shortly - might I kindly\n follow up to see if DG is available 8/9 July for a short in person meeting?  \n\n\nMany thanks for letting me know. \n\n\nWith best wishes\n\n\nLouise \n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Thu, 20 Jun 2024 at 16:01, Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Cindi\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nIt was great to see you again yesterday at the H20 with Ivana, I hope we can do it again soon (properly)!\n\n\n \n\n\nDG and I had a short conversation and he confirmed he would be happy to meet with\n\nMr Jorge Moreira da Silva, our USG and Executive Director in the coming weeks - copying Shehnaz to close the loop as she and I had also discussed this during WHA.\n\n\n \n\n\nOn our side, Jorge could be available the first 2 weeks of July and then again after 28 August.\n\n\n \n\n\nThanks for letting us know what could work for DG.\n\n\n \n\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you\n\n\n \n\n\nThanks and best wishes\n\n\nLouise\n\n\n\nPS please thank your photographer for the nice photo!!!\n\n \n\n\n Louise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group\n | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \n\n\n\n\n\n\nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
