                ),
                new (
                    "00TQx00000ClFOJMA3",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: [EXT] Requesting Architectural drawing for Bill of Quantities (BoQ)preparation",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-07-04").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: [EXT] Requesting Architectural drawing for Bill of Quantities (BoQ)preparation",
                        Description = "To: silenzia@who.int\nCC: alexander.mihonye@undp.org; kadaz@who.int; dim@who.int; fontanal@who.int\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] Requesting Architectural drawing for Bill of Quantities (BoQ)preparation\nBody:\nDear AnnaMany thanks for your message, and nice to \"meet\" you  Alexander.I have shared your emails with my colleagues covering Tanzania, and will have a quick call with them tomorrow. We will be back in touch with you asapAll best wishesLouise \n\nOn Thu, 4 Jul 2024 at 13:16, SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Alexander,\n\n\n\n\n\nI have the pleasure to introduce Louise Leech, head of Geneva Liaison Office (UNOPS), reading in cc.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise,\n\nI am kindly requesting your advice to support our UNDP colleagues with the executive design of a four-room isolation center for infectious diseases. Last year, we developed the concept design for this structure based on the needs highlighted by Dr. Alexander.\n I am attaching the report that includes the design proposal.\n\nAs per the email below, they need to move forward with the implementation of the project. Unfortunately, we cannot provide support for the executive and implementation phases.\n\nI remain available to share any information regarding the project.\n\n\n\n\n\nKind Regards\n\nAnna\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAnna Silenzi\n\n\n\n\n\nArchitect\n\n\n\nWorld Health Organization | Emergency Program\n\n\n\nHealth & Technical Logistics Team | WHO/WHE/OSL\n\nsilenzia@who.int |  +39 345 4552938\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>\n\nSent: 04 July 2024 11:35\n\nTo: SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>\n\nCc: KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>; DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>; Louise Jocelyn LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\nSubject: RE: [EXT] Requesting Architectural drawing for Bill of Quantities (BoQ)preparation\n \n\n\n\n\nDear Anna,\n \nThank you very much for your efforts. In deed country team would like to proceed with establishment efforts. I would really appreciate if you can connect me with UNOPS colleagues\n to complete drawings and BOQ so that country team understands how much it will cost.\n \nThank you\nAlex\n \n\n                                                            \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDr Alexander Mihonye\nUN Clinic Physician\nUNHCR FO\nKasulu, Kigoma Tanzania.\nTel. +255784442299/+255754305454\n \n\"our addiction to fossil fuels is pushing humanity to the brink\"-UNSG.\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nFrom: SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>\n\n\nSent: Thursday, July 4, 2024 10:28 AM\n\nTo: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>\n\nCc: KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>; DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>; Louise Jocelyn LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] Requesting Architectural drawing for Bill of Quantities (BoQ)preparation\n\n\n \n\nDear Alexander,\n\n\n \n\n\nI'm glad to hear that the Country Office has decided to proceed.\n\n\nHowever, due to liability concerns, WHO cannot provide detailed or executive drawings for construction. If you need support in this regard, I'm happy to put you in contact with\n our colleagues at UNOPS, as their mandate covers these phases of the design. We will remain available for any clarification regarding the facility functioning, the flows, the areas of risk, etc.\n\n\n \n\n\nKindly\n\n\nAnna\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>\n\nSent: 20 June 2024 14:12\n\nTo: SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>; KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>; DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>\n\nSubject: [EXT] Requesting Architectural drawing for Bill of Quantities (BoQ)preparation\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \nGood Afternoon Anna, Hope this email finds you well,\n \nCountry Office would like to proceed with next stage of establishment of Isolation facility in the vicinity of UN Clinic Kasulu. May I please request if you can please share\n complete architectural drawings for sketch drawings in the attachment so that BOQ can be prepared by local team of expert.\n \nThank you for your support\nAlex\n\n                                                            \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDr Alexander Mihonye\nUN Clinic Physician\nUNHCR FO\nKasulu, Kigoma Tanzania.\nTel. +255784442299/+255754305454\n \n\"our addiction to fossil fuels is pushing humanity to the brink\"-UNSG.\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nFrom: Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, May 31, 2024 12:24 PM\n\nTo: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>\n\nCc: ngomoni@unhcr.org\n\nSubject: RE: [EXT] FW: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK\n\n\n \nDear Alex,\n \nThis is well noted, please allow me to come to your office on Monday Morning for discussion and clarity before embarking on BOQ preparations.\n \nThanks and best regards,\nLawrence.\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, 31 May 2024 12:07\n\nTo: Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\nCc: Jean Bosco Ngomoni <ngomoni@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: FW: [EXT] FW: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nAttention: This email is from an external sender. Please be careful with any links or attachments.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGood Morning Lawrence,\n \nASMT would like to have cost estimate on proposed isolation structure in the attachment, preferably if prefab material is used. Can you please assist to draw BoQ?\n \nThank you\nAlex\n \n\n\nFrom: SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>\n\n\nSent: Tuesday, October 17, 2023 3:49 PM\n\nTo: KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>; Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>; DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>;\n ZONGO, Mamadou <zongom@who.int>; AIT-IKHLEF, Kamal <aitikhlefk@who.int>; SOKEMAWU FREEMAN, Alex Yao <sokemawufreemana@who.int>; MENDIZABAL\n JOFFRE, Carla <mendizabalc@who.int>; Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] FW: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK\n\n\n \n\nDear Alexander,\n\n\n \n\n\nwe have updated the layout of the center according to the elements discussed during our last call.\n\n\nPlease find in attachment the report that includes the layout proposal, the main flows and the area of risks diagrams.\n\n\n\n \n\n\nBest Regards\n\n\nAnna\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>\n\nSent: 06 October 2023 09:33\n\nTo: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>;\n SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>; DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>;\n FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>; ZONGO, Mamadou <zongom@who.int>;\n AIT-IKHLEF, Kamal <aitikhlefk@who.int>; SOKEMAWU FREEMAN, Alex\n Yao <sokemawufreemana@who.int>; MENDIZABAL JOFFRE, Carla\n <mendizabalc@who.int>\n\nCc: Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: RE: [EXT] FW: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK \n\n \n\n\n\n\nDear all,\nLooping in Carla, OSL ops, and Alex, OSL health log, both for/from OSL ESA hub.\n\nBest regards. Z\n \n\nZinedine Kada\nOperations Support and Logistic Officer\nWHO/EPR/OSL\nWest and Central Africa Hub - Senegal\nPhone: +221 77 102 45 92\nWhatsapp: +33 762 87 99 34\nGPN: 39575\n \nCurrently deployed in Chad.\nTel: +235 61 54 49 86\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>\n\n\nSent: vendredi, 6 octobre 2023 08:10\n\nTo: SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>; DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>; ZONGO, Mamadou <zongom@who.int>;\n AIT-IKHLEF, Kamal <aitikhlefk@who.int>; KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>\n\nCc: Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: RE: [EXT] FW: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK\n\n\n \nSurely I will be available Anna, Let’s make it Tuesday 3pm. Thank you\n \n\n                                                           \n\n\n\nFrom: SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>\n\n\nSent: Friday, October 6, 2023 10:02 AM\n\nTo: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>; DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>; ZONGO, Mamadou\n <zongom@who.int>; AIT-IKHLEF, Kamal <aitikhlefk@who.int>; KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>\n\nCc: Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] FW: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK\n\n\n \n\nDear Alexander,\n\n\n \n\n\nI'm glad to hear you have recovered.\n\n\nWould you be available Tuesday 3PM or Thursday 10AM CEST next week?\n\n\n \n\n\nBest Regards\n\n\nAnna\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>\n\nSent: 06 October 2023 08:21\n\nTo: SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>; DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>;\n ZONGO, Mamadou <zongom@who.int>; AIT-IKHLEF, Kamal <aitikhlefk@who.int>; KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>\n\nCc: Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: RE: [EXT] FW: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK \n\n \n\n\n\n\n \nDear Anna,\n \nMy apologies for delayed reply. I was out of office for medical reasons. Can you please fix a date and time for us to continue where we ended and discuss your proposal in below email.\n \nThank you\nAlex \n\n\n                                                            \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDr Alexander Mihonye\nUN Clinic Physician\nUNHCR FO\nKasulu, Kigoma Tanzania.\nTel. +255784442299/+255754305454\n \n\"our addiction to fossil fuels is pushing humanity to the brink\"-UNSG.\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nFrom: SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>\n\n\nSent: Wednesday, September 6, 2023 4:43 PM\n\nTo: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>; DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>; ZONGO, Mamadou\n <zongom@who.int>; AIT-IKHLEF, Kamal <aitikhlefk@who.int>; KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>\n\nCc: diallobe@unhcr.org; Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: Re: [EXT] FW: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK\n\n\n \n\nDear Alexander,\n\n\n \n\n\nwe have worked on a layout that fits in the plot available ( 35 x 15 m) with basic services. Considering the constraints of the site, we would like to check together\n the proposal, before moving forward with the development of a technical report, which will include more information and will describe the facility functioning.\n\n\n \n\n\nWould you be available Monday or Tuesday next week for a quick chat?\n\n\n \n\n\nKind Regards\n\n\nAnna\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>\n\nSent: 28 August 2023 18:11\n\nTo: DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>; SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>;\n ZONGO, Mamadou <zongom@who.int>; AIT-IKHLEF, Kamal <aitikhlefk@who.int>; KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>\n\nCc: diallobe@unhcr.org <diallobe@unhcr.org>; Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: RE: [EXT] FW: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK \n\n \n\n\n\n\nYes it is. Will share Teams link shortly. Thank you\n \n\n\nFrom: DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>\n\n\nSent: Monday, August 28, 2023 7:09 PM\n\nTo: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>; SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>; ZONGO,\n Mamadou <zongom@who.int>; AIT-IKHLEF, Kamal <aitikhlefk@who.int>; KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>\n\nCc: diallobe@unhcr.org; Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: RE: [EXT] FW: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK\n\n\n \nDear Alex, \n \nis 10 am (CEST) on Wednesday 30th working for you?\n \nBest,\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nMichele Di Marco\n\n\nWHO Téchne coordinator\n\n\nArchitect & Disaster Risk Reduction specialist\n\n\n \nEmergency Program\nDivision of Emergency Response (WRE)\nStrategic Health Operations (SHO) - Operations Support and Logistic (OSL)\nHealth & Technical Logistic Team - WHO/WHE/WRE/SHO/OSL\nHQ - Geneva, Switzerland\n \nphone: +41 77 903 58 60\nwhatsApp: +45 22 71 95 45\nmail: dim@who.int\n \nWHO webpage: www.who.int \nTéchne webpage: https://www.who.int/groups/techne\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nFollow WHO on Facebook| Twitter| YouTube| Instagram \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>\n\n\nSent: Monday, August 28, 2023 4:28 PM\n\nTo: DI MARCO, Michele <dim@who.int>; SILENZI, Anna <silenzia@who.int>; FONTANA, Luca <fontanal@who.int>; ZONGO, Mamadou <zongom@who.int>;\n AIT-IKHLEF, Kamal <aitikhlefk@who.int>; KADA, Zinedine <kadaz@who.int>\n\nCc: diallobe@unhcr.org; Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: [EXT] FW: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK\n\n\n \nDear Michele,\n \nHighlighted in red cycle is an area identified to establish isolation facility;\n \n\n \n \n\n                                                            \n \n\n \n\n\nFrom: Lawrence Francis Fugara <fugara@unhcr.org>\n\n\nSent: Monday, August 28, 2023 5:13 PM\n\nTo: Alexander Mihonye <alexander.mihonye@undp.org>\n\nCc: diallobe@unhcr.org\n\nSubject: COORDINATES JUST BEHIND THE CLINIC CAR PARK\n\n\n \nDear Alex,\n \nKindly find the attached GPS coordinates for your reference and google earth image for more information.\n \nThanks and best regards,\nLawrence.",
