                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-07-10").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Côte d’Ivoire  Solar / ops & maintenance @ Wed 10 Jul 2024 11:00 - 12:00 (CEST) (vincis@who.int)",
                        Description = "To: vincis@who.int\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Côte d’Ivoire  Solar / ops & maintenance @ Wed 10 Jul 2024 11:00 - 12:00 (CEST) (vincis@who.int)\nBody:\nCiao SalvatoreThanks so much for joining the call this morning and confirming your support in Côte d'Ivoire. I will keep you posted on developments and hopefully you can join the facility assessment mission (likely to be September).Great to see our collaboration / coordination evolving :)Speak soonBest wishes Louise \nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
