                        Subject = "Email: Re: Fact sheet peace process Mozambique - may need updating",
                        Description = "To: emmaak@unops.org\nCC: rainerf@unops.org; elenage@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Fact sheet peace process Mozambique - may need updating\nBody:\nThanks Emma, this is great!This will work fine -  I will send it along with a little \"update\" on this & other issues, for my Swiss focal point in Berne :)Have a great day and please feel free to keep me posted on this as discussions evolve.\nDear all,I will share by separate email the PRA that we completed for the Swiss contribution to the Santiago Network (I workied with UNOPS HQ due diligence team to ensure harmonisation of our responses to the different requests from SDC country focal points) so you can be \"forearmed\" in case it comes up.Best wishes Louise \n\nOn Wed, 10 Jul 2024 at 10:55, Emma AKINYI <emmaak@unops.org> wrote:\nPlease find attached,\nEmma \nEmma Akinyi | Partnership Development Specialist | Partnership Development Office | Kenya Multi Country Office (KEMC) | Nairobi, Kenya | Tel: +254 (0)20 762 1613 | Mob: +254 715 914362 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
