                        Subject = "Email: Fwd:",
                        Description = "To: oscarm@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd:\nBody:\nFOR INFO\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: BELIN, Matts-Ake <belinm@who.int>\nDate: Fri, 12 Jul 2024 at 08:37\nSubject: \nTo: Louise Jocelyn LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHi Louise,\n \nThank you for catching up yesterday and for the coffee. \n\n \nHere is the first UN road safety resolution \nhttps://documents.un.org/doc/undoc/gen/n03/511/86/pdf/n0351186.pdf?token=Qj2OROr5DoeuUxSlEV&fe=true\n\n \nHer is the first Health Assembly resolution  https://iris.who.int/bitstream/handle/10665/20135/A57_R10-en.pdf?sequence=1&isAllowed=y\n\n \nThe first world report on road traffic injuries  https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/world-report-on-road-traffic-injury-prevention\n\n \nHere is the UNRSC  \nhttps://www.who.int/groups/united-nations-road-safety-collaboration \n \nThe new Global Plan for the decade of action  https://www.who.int/publications/m/item/global-plan-for-the-decade-of-action-for-road-safety-2021-2030\n\n \nLatest Global Status report on road safety 2023 \nhttps://www.who.int/publications/i/item/9789240086517 \n \nFirst High-Level Meeting on Improving Global Road Safety  “The 2030 horizon for road safety: securing a decade of action and delivery\n\nhttps://www.un.org/pga/76/wp-content/uploads/sites/101/2022/06/23-June-Political-Declaration-on-Road-Safety.pdf\n\n \nBased on this meeting WHO has launched a Global Network of   Heads of Road Safety Lead Agencies  https://www.who.int/groups/global-network-of-national-road-safety-leaders\n\n \n \nhttps://www.globalroadsafetyfacility.org/ .This is the group at World Bank that we are working closely with. \nhttps://www.globalroadsafetyfacility.org/our-team  .\n\n \nVision Zero, I still working with them, but I used to be the director for the Vision Zero Academy.\n\nhttps://bransch.trafikverket.se/en/startpage/operations/Operations-road/vision-zero-academy/\n\n \nHave a nice weekend! \n \nMatts\n \n \nBelin Matts-Åke, PhD\nGlobal Lead, Decade of Action for Road Safety\nSafety and Mobility\nDepartment of the Social Determinants of Health\nWorld Health Organization\n20 Avenue Appia\n1211 Geneva 27, Switzerland\n \n  +41 79 526 5396\n \nTwitter : @MattsBelin\nLinkedin: www.linkedin.com/in/matts-åke-belin-85170162",
                        Location = null,
