                new (
                    "00TQx00000DfPntMAF",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Fwd: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-07-25").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Fwd: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program",
                        Description = "To: HannaP@unops.org\nCC: iraklij@unops.org; svene@unops.org; fadumay@unops.org; josephiner@unops.org; liliann@unops.org; naimoh@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program\nBody:\nDear Hanna and Irakli\nPlease find below the confirmation from the Finnish MFA that the remaining balance of the S3i project should be transferred to the bank account detailed below. \nCould you kindly let me know once the transfer has been completed? Then I will inform the Finnish MFA. \nThank you very much in advance. \nBest,Asbjørn\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Tanzi-Albi Andrea (UM) <Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi>\nDate: Thu, 25 Jul 2024 at 10:23\nSubject: RE: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program\nTo: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>, Enkenberg Aki (UM) <aki.enkenberg@gov.fi>\nCc: Lassila Satu (UM) <Satu.Lassila@gov.fi>, Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjorn,\n\n\n\n\nYes, I can confirm that the bank details that were shared previously are indeed correct. As Aki explained, when the return exceeds a certain threshold, the guideline is to ask the refund to the state treasury’s account. In the case of the S3i’s remaining balance,\n the given threshold is exceeded. Since we have requested the refund in USD, we have communicated the State Treasury’s USD-account, specifically.\n\n\n\n\nAt your disposal for any further inquiries, \n\n\n\nAndrea\n \nFrom: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: keskiviikko 26. kesäkuuta 2024 10.36\n\nTo: Enkenberg Aki (UM) <aki.enkenberg@gov.fi>\n\nCc: Tanzi-Albi Andrea (UM) <Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi>; Lassila Satu (UM) <Satu.Lassila@gov.fi>; Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program\n \n\nDear Aki\n\n \n\n\nThank you for your rapid response. I will wait for your confirmation on the correct banking details before proceeding with the transfer. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, 25 Jun 2024 at 15:13, Enkenberg Aki (UM) <aki.enkenberg@gov.fi> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjorn, Andrea is on leave and I’m travelling, but we’ll get back to you as soon as we can and\n confirm this. When returns exceed a certain threshold they are paid directly to the State Treasury, hence the different account.\n\n \nBest,\n\nAki\n \nFrom: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: tiistai 25. kesäkuuta 2024 11.42\n\nTo: Tanzi-Albi Andrea (UM) <Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi>\n\nCc: Lassila Satu (UM) <Satu.Lassila@gov.fi>; Enkenberg Aki (UM) <aki.enkenberg@gov.fi>; Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program\n \n\nDear Andrea\n\n \n\n\nDuring the transfer process, it has come to our attention that the bank account below does not match with the bank account from where the grant was transferred to UNOPS. The grant\n originated from a bank account in OP Corporate Bank, while the below details are for the State Treasury's account with Danske Bank.\n\n\n\nCould I kindly ask for your preference would be to change the bank account to the one from where the grant originated (we need the full details provided for verification) or if the preference is to register the below vendor in our ERP?\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you in advance for the clarification. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Fri, 7 Jun 2024 at 18:32, Tanzi-Albi Andrea (UM) <Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjorn,\n\n\n\n\nAs we had the occasion to discuss at the margins of the UNDP/UNFPA/UNOPS annual session, Finland is not in a position, at present, to accept the final financial statement provided by UNOPS some time ago. Regardless, we would kindly ask UNOPS to return the remaining\n balance of Finland’s funding to the operations of the S3i program in Helsinki. \n\n \nUNOPS may transfer the balance of 7,212,684.18 USD, as itemized in the attached financial statement provided by UNOPS, to the following bank account (in USD):\n \nBanking details:\n \nBank: Danske Bank\n\nAccount owner: VALTIOKONTTORI\n\nIBAN: FI97 8129 9710 0098 87\nBIC: DABAFIHH\n\n\n\nReference: MFA/KEO-40\n\n\n\nBank Address:\n\n\n\nDanske Bank A/S Finland Branch\n\nTelevisiokatu 1\n\n00075 Danske Bank\n\nFINLAND\n \nAccount owner’s address:\n\n\n\nValtiokonttori\n\nSörnäisten rantatie 13\n\nHelsinki PL 14\n00054 Valtiokonttori\n\nFINLAND\n \nCould I ask you to acknowledge the receipt of this request, and that our information on the sum to be transferred is up to date before I notify our financial management about the\n incoming transfer?\n \nDo let me know if you need anything else.\n\n\n\n\nWith best regards,\n \nAndrea Tanzi-Albi\n\nDesk Officer\n\nUnit for UN Development and Innovation Issues\n \n+358 50\n 4038861\nandrea.tanzi-albi@gov.fi\n\n \n\n\nMinistry for Foreign Affairs of Finland\nMerikasarmi, PO Box 176\n\nFI-00023 Government\n\nFinland",
