                new (
                    "00TQx00000DgPloMAF",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: LICA management for UNFPA",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2023-09-19").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: LICA management for UNFPA",
                        Description = "To: weidmann@unfpa.org\nCC: alejoe@unops.org; ArnaudS@unops.org; LaurentiuM@unops.org; delagarza@unfpa.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: LICA management for UNFPA\nBody:\nDear Jan,Thank you for reaching out. As discussed previously, we would like to express our continued interest in the possibility of UNOPS administering non-staff contracts on behalf of UNFPA.To move forward and gain a better understanding of UNFPA's current needs and establish possible timelines, we could have a catchup call to explore this further. Please let me know if Thursday 13hrs CPH works for you. Otherwise please feel free to suggest an alternative time.Best,\nLorraine\nOn Mon, Sep 18, 2023 at 11:09 PM Jan Weidmann <weidmann@unfpa.org> wrote:\nDear Alejo,\nThank you for the quick response! I already had the pleasure of speaking with Lorraine  and Laurentiu and am looking forward to picking up where we left off. I am not sure I know Arnaud yet, but looking forward to speaking. \nAnd yes, it would be great to meet. Let me know when you have dates!\nBest,Jan\nOn Mon, Sep 18, 2023 at 4:04 PM Alejo EIRIZ <alejoe@unops.org> wrote:\nHi Jan, \nThis is great news!! I am sure my colleagues copied here will be able to reach out to you. By the way, I will be in New York the first week of November, hopefully, we can meet then.\nThanks,Best,\nAlejo\nOn Mon, Sep 18, 2023 at 9:48 PM Jan Weidmann <weidmann@unfpa.org> wrote:\nDear Alejo,\nA while ago, we initiated conversations between UNFPA and UNOPS on the possibility of UNOPS administering certain non-staff types on behalf of UNFPA. We would like to restart this process to get a sense of UNOPS' ability to administer and possible timelines. \nCould you please advise on who we should reach out to, to rekindle the process?\nBest,Jan\n-- \nMr. Jan WeidmannHR Policy SpecialistDivision for Human ResourcesUnited Nations Population FundPhone: +1 212 297 5310\n\n\n\n\n\n      \n-- \nAlejo Eiriz | Senior HR Manager - Policy & Compliance | People & Change Group | UNOPSTel: +45 45 33 75 81  Mob: +45 30 17 75 81 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.\n\n\n\n-- \nMr. Jan WeidmannHR Policy SpecialistDivision for Human ResourcesUnited Nations Population FundPhone: +1 212 297 5310\n\n\n\n\n\n      \n-- \nLorraine Anabtawi | HR Partnerships Specialist | Partnerships and Liaison Group |\nUNOPS | Tel: 972548174189 | Skype:\nlorraine.anabtawi | www.unops.org | Supplying value, delivering results,\nchanging lives\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date\nwith UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to\nour external newsletter in English, French or Spanish",
