                        Subject = "Email: Re: UNAIDS' possible interest on partner personnel services",
                        Description = "To: GriebS@unaids.org\nCC: lorrainea@unops.org; LaurentiuM@unops.org; martineaut@unaids.org; valeriek@unops.org; victoriac@unops.org; alejoe@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: UNAIDS' possible interest on partner personnel services\nBody:\nDear Stephan,\n\nThanks for your email and interest in discussing a potential collaboration. Friday, July 26th, at 9.30 works for us as well.\n\nIn addition to myself, please share the MS Teams invite with the following UNOPS colleagues:\n- Lorraine ANABTAWI, HR Partnerships Specialist\n- Victoria CAMPBELL, Deputy Director, People and Performance Group\n- Alejo EIRIZ, Senior HR Manager - Policy & Compliance | People & Change Group\n\nWe look forward to our meeting and discussion.\nKind regards,\n\nArnaudArnaud Sgambato | Head of unit - Partnerships Development | Partnerships and Liaison Group (PLG) | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7717 | www.unops.orgKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\nOn Wed, 24 Jul 2024 at 09:45, GRIEB, Stephan Ulrich <GriebS@unaids.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Arnaud,\n \nMany thanks for the overview. Tim Martineau (our Director of Management) and I would be very interested in learning more and discussing a possible collaboration. Could we set up a Teams\n call, if possible this or early next week? Would Friday 26 July at 9:30 be an option for you and /or your colleagues? Best!\n \nStephan U. Grieb | Director | People Management | UNAIDS | 20 Avenue Appia | CH-1211 Geneva 27 | Switzerland \n \n\n \n \n \n\n\nFrom: Arnaud SGAMBATO <arnauds@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Thursday, 18 July 2024 4:37 pm\n\nTo: GRIEB, Stephan Ulrich <GriebS@unaids.org>\n\nCc: Laurentiu MASTACAN <LaurentiuM@unops.org>; Lorraine ANABTAWI <LorraineA@unops.org>; Alejo EIRIZ <alejoe@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: UNAIDS' possible interest on partner personnel services\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou don't often get email from\narnauds@unops.org. \nLearn why this is important\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Alejo,\n\n\nThanks a lot for making the connection.\n\n\n\nDear Stephan,\n\nThank you for your interest in UNOPS HR services. I hope this email finds you well.  Further to your\n request, please find attached an overview of our HR services.\n\nPlease let us know if you have any questions and whether you would be interested in setting up a short meeting so we can better understand your needs, present our detailed service offering, costing and pricing, contract issuance average\n time, and answer any questions you might have. \n\nWe look forward to hearing from you and are eager to discuss our services further.\nBest regards, \n\n\n\nArnaudrmal\">On Mon, 15 Jul 2024 at 16:34, Alejo EIRIZ <alejoe@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\nDear colleagues,  \n\n \n\n\nI hope this email finds you well.\n\n\n \n\n\nAlthough you may already know him from his previous roles in UNICEF and UNHCR, please let me introduce you to Mr. Stephan Grief, Director, People Management at UNAIDS. For ease of reference, his contact details are as follows:\ngriebs@unaids.org\n\n\n \n\n\nStephan is quite familiar with the partner personnel services we provide but he would need the full description of our services and pricing (both direct costs, i.e., proforma costs and management fee, etc.) so he can discuss those details\n internally in UNAIDS. \n\n\n \n\n\nThanks,\n\nBest,\n\nAlejo\n\n-- \n\n\n\n\nAlejo Eiriz | Senior\n HR Manager - Policy & Compliance | People & Change Group | UNOPS\n\nTel: +45 45 33 75 81  Mob: +45 30 17 75 81 | www.unops.org\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. Subscribe\n to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench\n or Spanish.",
