                new (
                    "00TQx00000DiJZ9MAN",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: UNICEF - UNOPS: Strengthening our HR services",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2023-08-03").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: UNICEF - UNOPS: Strengthening our HR services",
                        Description = "To: bmagassa@unicef.org\nCC: lorrainea@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: UNICEF - UNOPS: Strengthening our HR services\nBody:\nDear Mr. Magassa,\nI hope this email finds you well. I am contacting you to introduce myself and discuss the potential of enhancing our current partnership with UNICEF, in particular, the collaboration between our two organizations on the provision of HR services.\nAs you might be aware, currently, UNOPS provides HR services to UNICEF under multiple country agreements. In total, we are administrating the ICA contracts of 170 UNICEF personnel. To further strengthen our collaboration, I would like to discuss the benefits of going into a global partnership on HR services. Such a global agreement would, for instance: \nSimplify and help expedite the country-level administrative process of signing the agreements instead of embarking on new negotiations every time; Allow UNICEF to benefit from the lower fee rate UNOPS can offer for HR services provided under a global agreement (i.e. 3% compared to 4% for country-level agreements);Ensure standardization of procedures across offices, and streamline operations;Enhance efficiency, allowing faster response times, improved service quality, and reduced lead times.\nShould you be interested in discussing this further, we would be delighted to present our HR services in more detail to you or a member of your team. My colleague Lorraine in CC, our Partner HR services team lead,  would be happy to arrange such a meeting.\nThank you for considering this request, and I look forward to hearing from you.\n\nArnaud Sgambato | Head of unit - Partnerships Development | Partnerships and Liaison Group (PLG) | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7717 | www.unops.orgKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
