                ),
                new (
                    "00TQx00000DiJnXMAV",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: RE: Potential meeting and overview of UNOPS HR services",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2022-11-17").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: RE: Potential meeting and overview of UNOPS HR services",
                        Description = "To: arnauds@unops.org\nCC: lorrainea@unops.org; laurentium@unops.org; jakobt@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: Potential meeting and overview of UNOPS HR services\nBody:\nDear Arnaud,\n \nThank you for this information. I’ll review and let you know if I have any additional questions. In terms of timing for a follow up meeting, I’ve been pulled into a number of\n urgent recruitment panels and am booked solid for the next 2 weeks, and am then on mission/leave in December. I’ll see if I can carve out time sooner rather than later, but it may be January before I have time to discuss.\n\n \nBest,\n \nJohn\n \nFrom: Arnaud SGAMBATO <arnauds@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, November 11, 2022 5:27 PM\n\nTo: Lackey, John (CSHD) <John.Lackey@fao.org>\n\nCc: Lorraine ANABTAWI <lorrainea@unops.org>; Laurentiu MASTACAN <laurentium@unops.org>; Jakob TUBORGH <jakobt@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Potential meeting and overview of UNOPS HR services\n \n\n\n\nDear John,\n\n\n\nI trust the end of the week finds you well. \n\nIt was a pleasure meeting you again on the HR services UNOPS offers. In line with our discussions, I am pleased to share a breakdown of\n\nbudget estimates for the three duty stations you were interested in (i.e. Afghanistan, Indonesia and Ethiopia) with a simulation for 150 LICAs each.\n\n\n\nI have also added the presentation on HR Services and an excel document so you can run cost comparisons with different salaries and durations.\n\n\n\nPlease let me know if you would like us to run you through the calculations; we could set up a meeting at your earliest convenience to answer any questions you may have.\n\n\n\nBest,\n\n\n\nArnaud\n\n\n \n\n\nArnaud Sgambato\n| Head of Partnerships Development, a.i. | Partnerships and Liaison Group (PLG) | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7717 |\nwww.unops.org\n\n\n\n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Thu, 20 Oct 2022 at 16:05, Lackey, John (CSHD) <John.Lackey@fao.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nEarly afternoon should be fine, I can ask my front office to help schedule and provide the link for the meeting.\n \nThanks,\n \nJohn\n \nFrom: Arnaud SGAMBATO <arnauds@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Wednesday, October 19, 2022 6:30 PM\n\nTo: Lackey, John (CSHD) <John.Lackey@fao.org>\n\nCc: Lorraine ANABTAWI <lorrainea@unops.org>; Laurentiu MASTACAN <laurentium@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Potential meeting and overview of UNOPS HR services\n \n\n\n\nDear John,\n\n\n\nThanks, and no problem moving the meeting; we are all available on Friday, November 4th.\n\nWould early afternoon (13.00 or 14.00) work for you?\n\n\n\nBest, \n\nArnaud\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, 18 Oct 2022 at 08:40, Lackey, John (CSHD) <John.Lackey@fao.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Arnaud,\n \nThanks for the additional information and for getting this to me so quickly. I’ll need to push this meeting to the week\n of 31 October if possible, as I’m on mission next week and have a full calendar the balance of this week. Friday, November 4th is looking like the best option at the moment (excluding 9am – 11am), please let me know if this date would work. In the\n interim I’ll figure out who else from my team will need to attend as well.\n \nBest,\n\n\nJohn\n \nFrom: Arnaud SGAMBATO <arnauds@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Monday, October 17, 2022 5:30 PM\n\nTo: Lackey, John (CSHD) <John.Lackey@fao.org>\n\nCc: Lorraine ANABTAWI <lorrainea@unops.org>; Laurentiu MASTACAN <laurentium@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Potential meeting and overview of UNOPS HR services\n \n\n\nDear John,\n\n\n\nTo follow up on our conversation in Rome last Friday, I wanted to confirm our availability for a quick meeting to give you an overview of the different HR services that UNOPS can provide, discuss your potential needs and how UNOPS could support your organization.\n\n\n\nPlease let us know if this suggested approach could work from your end and whether the end of this week (Thursday or Friday, for instance) could work for this initial discussion.\n\nI also attach a short presentation of UNOPS HR services, including an overview of our main UN partners and a few stats regarding the location of the contracts we manage, etc.\n\n\n\nThanks again, and kind regards,\n\n\n\nArnaud\n\n\n\n\nArnaud Sgambato\n| Head of Partnerships Development, a.i. | Partnerships and Liaison Group (PLG) | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7717 |\nwww.unops.org\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish.",
