                        Description = "To: John.Lackey@fao.org\nCC: lorrainea@unops.org; laurentium@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Potential meeting and overview of UNOPS HR services\nBody:\nDear John,\n\nTo follow up on our conversation in Rome last Friday, I wanted to confirm our availability for a quick meeting to give you an overview of the different HR services that UNOPS can provide, discuss your potential needs and how UNOPS could support your organization.\n\nPlease let us know if this suggested approach could work from your end and whether the end of this week (Thursday or Friday, for instance) could work for this initial discussion.\nI also attach a short presentation of UNOPS HR services, including an overview of our main UN partners and a few stats regarding the location of the contracts we manage, etc.\n\nThanks again, and kind regards,\n\nArnaud\n\nArnaud Sgambato | Head of Partnerships Development, a.i. | Partnerships and Liaison Group (PLG) | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7717 | www.unops.orgKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
