                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-07-29").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Meeting between UK and UNOPS Executive Director during UNGA?",
                        Description = "To: Sally.Clifford@fcdo.gov.uk\nCC: Agnes.Annells@fcdo.gov.uk; naimoh@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Meeting between UK and UNOPS Executive Director during UNGA?\nBody:\nDear Sally,\nThank you for your response. I look forward to hearing from you. \nKind regards,Asbjørn\nOn Fri, 26 Jul 2024 at 10:36, Sally Clifford <Sally.Clifford@fcdo.gov.uk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOFFICIAL\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjørn,\n \nMany thanks for your email, we have noted the request for a meeting with the Executive Director during UNGA.\n\n \nAs far as I know, the UK delegation is in the process of being determined, so we will come back to you once confirmed.\n \nBest wishes,\n\n\nSally\n \n\n\n\n\n\nOFFICIAL\n\n\nFrom: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Monday, July 22, 2024 10:54 AM\n\nTo: Agnes Annells <Agnes.Annells@fcdo.gov.uk>; Sally Clifford <Sally.Clifford@fcdo.gov.uk>\n\nCc: Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Meeting between UK and UNOPS Executive Director during UNGA?\n\n\n \n\nDear colleagues at FCDO, \n\n \n\n\nOur Executive Director has asked for a bilateral meeting with a relevant UK representative during the UNGA. Jorge would greatly appreciate the opportunity to discuss the situation in especially Gaza and Ukraine.  \n\n\n \n\n\nMight you be able to help us advise on who from the UK side that might be suitable? Then we will send a more formal request for a bilateral meeting. \n\n\n \n\n\nThanks a lot in advance!\n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAsbjørn Brink | Head\n of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFollow us online: www.gov.uk/fcdo\n\n\nThis email is intended for the addressee(s) only: All messages sent and received by the Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office may be monitored in line with relevant\n\nUK legislation",
