                        Subject = "Email: Action needed: Comprehensive response plan update to EB",
                        Description = "To: thomasl@unops.org; ingaro@unops.org; valeriek@unops.org; insurs@unops.org; victoriac@unops.org; stevenc@unops.org; liliann@unops.org; vilhelmk@unops.org; svene@unops.org; camilafl@unops.org; nicolej@unops.org; kongleongt@unops.org; orenng@unops.org; olgad@unops.org\nCC: hilaryb@unops.org; annag@unops.org; rahulm@unops.org; emiliep@unops.org; asbjornb@unops.org; sonjalk@unops.org; kirstined@unops.org; alexandram@unops.org; felixfr@unops.org; thorstenh@unops.org; AbdoulD@unops.org; julial@unops.org; tushard@unops.org; charlottet@unops.org; johnap@unops.org; carolinapo@unops.org; taranehd@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Action needed: Comprehensive response plan update to EB\nBody:\nDear Colleagues,\nKindly note that the submission of the next Monthly Update Briefing to the Executive Board on the Comprehensive Response Plan is due on the 1st of August.\nWe kindly ask you to update the internal comprehensive response plan (columns J, K and L) as well as summarize the key progress and challenges in the update report by COB Monday, July 29. \nI am also sharing for your reference the latest monthly report submitted to the EB on 3 July.\nMany thanks in advance for your support.\nKind regards,Oona",
