                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2023-11-10").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: RE: Follow-up on third-party reviews conducted in 2022",
                        Description = "To: mariacarmenco@unops.org; Amaya.OLIVARES-ZAPIAIN@ec.europa.eu\nCC: abdould@unops.org; LaetitiaK@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: Follow-up on third-party reviews conducted in 2022\nBody:\nClean\nDocumentEmail\nfalse\n\n21\n\n\nfalse\nfalse\nfalse\n\nEN-US\nX-NONE\nX-NONE\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMicrosoftInternetExplorer4\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Carmen,\n \nLikewise, pleasure talking to you today.\nThank you and\nAbdoul for this confirmation.\n \nI whish you a nice weekend.\nAfschin\n \n\nFrom: Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, November 10, 2023 5:49 PM\n\nTo: LAGIES Afschin (INTPA) <Afschin.LAGIES@ec.europa.eu>; OLIVARES ZAPIAIN Amaya (INTPA) <Amaya.OLIVARES-ZAPIAIN@ec.europa.eu>\n\nCc: Abdoul DIENG <abdould@unops.org>; Laetitia KRAUS <LaetitiaK@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Follow-up on third-party reviews conducted in 2022\n\n \n\nDear Afschin and Amaya,\n\n \n\n\nIt was a pleasure talking to you today.\n\n\n \n\n\nAs discussed, I consulted Abdoul Dieng, UNOPS Director of Internal Audit and Investigations Group (IAIG) and he confirmed that IAIG has commissioned KPMG Finland to conduct a review of the status implementation of the recommendations they\n issued  in 2022.\n\n\n\nThe objective of the Assignment is to assess the implementation of the recommendations given in the forward-looking report. The Assignment will review the current status in the areas that KPMG recommended improvements on.  \n\n\n\nThe final report is expected to be issued towards the end of this year.\n\n\n\nHope this helps.\n\n\n \n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\nCarmen\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMariacarmen Colitti\n| Head of Office and Representative | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office\n| Brussels, Belgium | Tel: + 32 2 7881840|\nwww.unops.org \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\n\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or \nSpanish.",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000DozLxMAJ",
                        EmailAddresses = new List<string> { "laetitiak@unops.org", "abdould@unops.org", "mariacarmenco@unops.org", "amaya.olivares-zapiain@ec.europa.eu", "afschin.lagies@ec.europa.eu" },
