                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-07-29").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Fw: UN-Habitat and UNOPS Workshop (mid-Sep) and Action Plan (WUF12)",
                        Description = "To: elenage@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fw: UN-Habitat and UNOPS Workshop (mid-Sep) and Action Plan (WUF12)\nBody:\nFYI\n\n\nFrom: Oumar Sylla <oumar.sylla@un.org>\n\nSent: Monday, July 29, 2024 4:56 PM\n\nTo: Erfan Ali <erfan.ali@un.org>; Ran Wang <ran.wang@un.org>; Cherrilyn Wanyangu Auma(Intern) <cherrilyn.auma@un.org>; Rafael Tuts <raf.tuts@un.org>; Edlam Abera Yemeru <yemeru@un.org>; Dyfed Aubrey <dyfed.aubrey@un.org>; Kazumi Ogawa <kazumi.ogawa@un.org>;\n Elkin Velasquez Monsalve <elkin.velasquez@un.org>; Rania Hedeya <rania.hedeya@un.org>; Kazuko Ishigaki <kazuko.ishigaki@un.org>\n\nCc: Luis Antonio Ramirez Garcia (Affiliate) <antonio.ramirez@un.org>; Njoki Ngethe <njoki.ngethe@un.org>; Mohamed Tarek Aref <mohamed.aref@un.org>; Yumi Kumagai <yumi.kumagai@un.org>; Rong Yang <rong.yang@un.org>; Alain Kanyinda <alain.kanyinda@un.org>;\n Runze Wang <runze.wang@un.org>; Petra Polaskova <petra.polaskova@un.org>; Emmanuel Osama Makaka <emmanuel.makaka@un.org>; Ishaku Maitumbi <ishaku.maitumbi@un.org>\n\nSubject: RE: UN-Habitat and UNOPS Workshop (mid-Sep) and Action Plan (WUF12)\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nDear Erfan,\nHere to share the outcomes of the consultation UNOPS/UNH (Regional offices for Africa). It could be a basis for the regional level.\nRegards \n \n\nOumar Sylla\nDirector \n\nRegional Office for  Africa\nUnited Nations Human Settlements Programme\nUN-Habitat\n\nPO Box 30030, Nairobi, Kenya\n\nEmail: \noumar.sylla@un.org\nTel: (M) +254732777455\n       (W)+254207623574\nWebsite: \nwww.unhabitat.org \n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Erfan Ali <erfan.ali@un.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, July 26, 2024 12:37 PM\n\nTo: Ran Wang <ran.wang@un.org>; Cherrilyn Wanyangu Auma(Intern) <cherrilyn.auma@un.org>; Rafael Tuts <raf.tuts@un.org>; Edlam Abera Yemeru <yemeru@un.org>; Dyfed Aubrey <dyfed.aubrey@un.org>; Kazumi Ogawa <kazumi.ogawa@un.org>; Elkin Velasquez Monsalve\n <elkin.velasquez@un.org>; Rania Hedeya <rania.hedeya@un.org>; Oumar Sylla <oumar.sylla@un.org>; Kazuko Ishigaki <kazuko.ishigaki@un.org>\n\nCc: Luis Antonio Ramirez Garcia (Affiliate) <antonio.ramirez@un.org>; Njoki Ngethe <njoki.ngethe@un.org>; Mohamed Tarek Aref <mohamed.aref@un.org>; Yumi Kumagai <yumi.kumagai@un.org>; Rong Yang <rong.yang@un.org>; Alain Kanyinda <alain.kanyinda@un.org>;\n Runze Wang <runze.wang@un.org>; Petra Polaskova <petra.polaskova@un.org>\n\nSubject: UN-Habitat and UNOPS Workshop (mid-Sep) and Action Plan (WUF12) \n\n\n\n \n\nDear\nDirectors, RRs and colleagues,\n\n\n\nWe are currently engaging closely with UNOPS to enhance our collaboration\nmainly on programmatic matters. One key expected outcome is a UN-Habitat and UNOPS Action Plan, which we aim to finalize and sign during WUF12.\n\n\nTo facilitate this process, I would appreciate your kind support to\nassign a focal point from your respective division and regional office to coordinate\non this. Given the time constraints, kindly assign your focal points by COB\nTuesday, 30th July.\n\n\nWorkplan:\n\n\n\nStocktake (1st week of August):\n We plan to conduct a stocktake on the current engagement of your divisions and regional offices with UNOPS, focusing on normative and operational work. This will involve a systematic approach to mapping ongoing and planned activities to identify potential\n thematic areas and synergies.\n\n\n\nConsultations (second half\n of August): To gain a clearer understanding of the inputs,\nwe will conduct consultations to discuss the scope and gather ideas, thoughts, comments, and suggestions.\n\n\n\nWorkshop (Mid-September): During the second week of September, we will organize a hybrid workshop to\n discuss findings, prioritize collaboration areas, and draft an action plan, which will be signed during WUF12.\n\n\n\nAction Plan (End of October): We aim to have a zero draft by the end of September and finalize it before\n WUF12.\n\n\nTo ensure the success of this partnership, we invite your division and all regional offices to actively participate in the stocktaking, consultation activities, and the subsequent\n hybrid workshop. Your expertise and insights are invaluable in identifying synergies and developing an action plan that supports our shared goals.\n \n@Ran Wang and\n\n@Cherrilyn Wanyangu Auma(Intern) will coordinate this from RPD.\n\n\n\nWe look forward to receiving your nominations for focal points and commencing these activities.\n\n\nBest regards,\nErfan",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000DtaZmMAJ",
                        EmailAddresses = new List<string> { "dyfed.aubrey@un.org", "njoki.ngethe@un.org", "mohamed.aref@un.org", "petra.polaskova@un.org", "kazumi.ogawa@un.org", "ran.wang@un.org", "alain.kanyinda@un.org", "antonio.ramirez@un.org", "kazuko.ishigaki@un.org", "oumar.sylla@un.org", "elenage@unops.org", "yumi.kumagai@un.org", "cherrilyn.auma@un.org", "elkin.velasquez@un.org", "rania.hedeya@un.org", "raf.tuts@un.org", "runze.wang@un.org", "yemeru@un.org", "rong.yang@un.org", "emmanuel.makaka@un.org", "erfan.ali@un.org", "ishaku.maitumbi@un.org" },
