                new (
                    "00TQx00000DuA3fMAF",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: RE: FYI: pls advise: UN-Habitat HR services report March 2024",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-05-16").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: RE: FYI: pls advise: UN-Habitat HR services report March 2024",
                        Description = "To: laurentium@unops.org\nCC: lucym@unops.org; haris.pajtic@un.org; terryg@unops.org; beatrice.ngine@un.org; lorrainea@unops.org; kajsah@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: FYI: pls advise: UN-Habitat HR services report March 2024\nBody:\nDear Laurentiu,\n \nThank you so much for your feedback and clarification, and I will feedback our requester.\n \nBest Regards,\n \nLiu Lu\nHuman Resources and Training Unit,\nManagement Advisory and Compliance Service (MACS),\nUN-HABITAT, UN Avenue, Gigiri, Nairobi, KENYA\nEmail: lu.liu@un.org\nWebsite: http://www.unhabitat.org\n \n \n\nFrom: Laurentiu MASTACAN <laurentium@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Thursday, May 16, 2024 2:09 PM\n\nTo: Lu Liu <lu.liu@un.org>\n\nCc: Lucy Mukina MAINGI <lucym@unops.org>; Haris Pajtic <haris.pajtic@un.org>; Terry Githua [UNOPS] <terryg@unops.org>; Beatrice Ngine <beatrice.ngine@un.org>; Lorraine ANABTAWI <lorrainea@unops.org>; Kajsa Johanna HARTMAN [UNOPS] <kajsah@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: FYI: pls advise: UN-Habitat HR services report March 2024\n\n \n\n\n\nDear Lu, \n\n\n \n\n\nI hope this message finds you well.  \n\n\nThis is a kind reminder in connection with your request to include the funding source as a new field in the current HR payroll monthly report. Please note that until the information is shared from your end  we\n will not be able to accommodate this, therefore, the upcoming report covering the month of April will still lack the funding source-related data.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\nBest regards, \n\n\nLaurentiu Mastacan\n| HR Partnerships Analyst | PLG, Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7816 |\nwww.unops.org \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench\n or Spanish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Mon, May 13, 2024 at 9:48 AM Laurentiu MASTACAN <laurentium@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Lu,\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you for your email. In connection with your request, as mentioned before, I am available to support in amending the HR report in question, however I can only add the information if this is currently provided\n to us via the Annexes that circulate between our local offices. \n\n\n \n\n\nAs per my knowledge this information (funding source (eg. 62HPS, 40HFU and etc. or funding source type)) is not\n currently being shared by your offices, and as such there is no way for me to source it and have it linked to the report \n\n\n \n\n\nWe are however available to support this exercise, and I would appreciate it if we could have a call to discuss the best way forward. \n\n\n \n\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\nBest regards, \n\n\nLaurentiu Mastacan\n| HR Partnerships Analyst | PLG, Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7816 |\nwww.unops.org \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench\n or Spanish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Fri, May 10, 2024 at 11:16 AM Lu Liu <lu.liu@un.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Laurentiu,\n \nThank you for your e-mail,\n \nAs discussed last time, we would like to get the data about\nfunding source (eg. 62HPS, 40HFU and etc. or funding source type) based on the previous list you usually provide to us. So I have added the column based on the previous list already (pls find attached for your filling).\n \nAlso, I am afraid those column of payment amount is not our request priority. Sorry my previous e-mail makes you confused.\n \nYour support is much appreciated  as always&#128522;\n \nBest Regards,\n \nLiu Lu\nHuman Resources and Training Unit,\nManagement Advisory and Compliance Service (MACS),\nUN-HABITAT, UN Avenue, Gigiri, Nairobi, KENYA\nEmail: lu.liu@un.org\nWebsite: http://www.unhabitat.org\n \n \n\nFrom: Laurentiu\n MASTACAN <laurentium@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, May 3, 2024 1:19 PM\n\nTo: Lu Liu <lu.liu@un.org>\n\nCc: Lucy Mukina MAINGI <lucym@unops.org>;\n Haris Pajtic <haris.pajtic@un.org>;\n Terry Githua [UNOPS] <terryg@unops.org>;\n Beatrice Ngine <beatrice.ngine@un.org>\n\nSubject: Re: FYI: pls advise: UN-Habitat HR services report March 2024\n\n \n\n\n\nDear Lu Liu, \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you for your email. In connection to that can you confirm if the respective indicators are specified in any of the documents/memos which circulate\n between offices?\n\n\n \n\n\nThe documents I am referring to are the request for service, financial budget template, and preselection memos.\n\n\n \n\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you, \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\nBest regards, \n\nLaurentiu Mastacan\n| HR Partnerships Analyst | PLG, Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7816 |\nwww.unops.org \nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench\n or Spanish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Fri, May 3, 2024 at 11:21 AM Lu Liu <lu.liu@un.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Laurentiu,\n \nThank you for your e-mail\n \nPlease note that the funding source refers to the type of the funding, which is usually presented via series Number or Characteristic or mix both,\n like 40HFU, 10 UNA and etc.\n \nHope it is useful .\n \nYour prompt response will be highly appreciated,\n \nBest Regards,\n \nLiu Lu\nHuman Resources and Training Unit,\nManagement Advisory and Compliance Service (MACS), \nUN-HABITAT, UN Avenue, Gigiri, Nairobi, KENYA\nEmail: lu.liu@un.org\nWebsite: http://www.unhabitat.org\n \n \n\nFrom: Laurentiu\n MASTACAN <laurentium@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, April 26, 2024 2:50 PM\n\nTo: Lu Liu <lu.liu@un.org>\n\nCc: Lucy Mukina MAINGI <lucym@unops.org>;\n Haris Pajtic <haris.pajtic@un.org>;\n Terry Githua [UNOPS] <terryg@unops.org>;\n Beatrice Ngine <beatrice.ngine@un.org>\n\nSubject: Re: pls advise: UN-Habitat HR services report March 2024\n\n \n\n\n\nDear Lu, \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you for your message. Can you please be more specific into what the source\n of the funding for each staffs means from your end, and at the same time provide any details from your end if this information is provided in any way to UNOPS via the documents that circulate between parties (e.g. which\n Annex)?\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nIf you can clarify the above point I am happy to support you in the matter and explore what options are available.\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you,  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\nBest regards, \n\nLaurentiu Mastacan\n| HR Partnerships Analyst | PLG, Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7816 |\nwww.unops.org \nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench\n or Spanish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Fri, Apr 26, 2024 at 1:26 PM Lu Liu <lu.liu@un.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Laurentiu,\n \nThe documents have been received well, however, currently we want the source of the funding for each staffs in this list as requested, and also we do not find the source of the funding through this list.\n \nThus, could you please add one more column about the source of the funding into this list and revert to us.\n \nYour prompt response will be highly appreciated,\n \nBest Regards,\n \nLiu Lu\nHuman Resources and Training Unit,\nManagement Advisory and Compliance Service (MACS), \nUN-HABITAT, UN Avenue, Gigiri, Nairobi, KENYA\nEmail: lu.liu@un.org\nWebsite: http://www.unhabitat.org\n \n \n \n\n\nFrom: Laurentiu\n MASTACAN <laurentium@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Wednesday, April 17, 2024 11:17 AM\n\nTo: Joy Munene <joy.munene@un.org>;\n Lu Liu <lu.liu@un.org>\n\nCc: Lucy Mukina MAINGI <lucym@unops.org>;\n Haris Pajtic <haris.pajtic@un.org>;\n Terry Githua [UNOPS] <terryg@unops.org>\n\nSubject: UN-Habitat HR services report March 2024\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou don't often get email from\nlaurentium@unops.org.\nLearn why this is important\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Joy and Lu, \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nI hope my message finds you well.\nPlease find attached the UN-Habitat  HR services report for March 2024\n (retrieved on 17/04/2024).\n\n\n\nPlease note that this HR report should be regarded as a preliminary report – final and accurate data is reflected in our certified financial reports. \n\n\n \n\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBest regards,\n\nLaurentiu Mastacan\n| HR Partnerships Analyst\n| PLG, Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7816 |\nwww.unops.org \nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow\nus on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n \nSubscribe to our external\nnewsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\nor\nSpanish.",
