                        Subject = "Email: Follow Up and Thanks",
                        Description = "To: jporcaro@worldbank.org\nCC: christinebo@unops.org; elenage@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Follow Up and Thanks\nBody:\nHi Jem,Hope all is well! A quick note to of course say thank you for your time the other day and also thank you in advance for assistance connecting us with the field-based teams in Zambia, Ethiopia, and Mozambique. Also, regarding the GEAPP funding, do of course let us know if there is assistance needed for the 'Just in Time' work. \nAll the best,Erin\n-- \nErin S. Ansell, P.E. | Africa Regional Renewable Energy Advisor | AFR | Dakar, Senegal | Tel: +221 78 592 76 10 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
