                new (
                    "00TQx00000E6Q84MAF",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: UNHCR HR Services Report - June 2024",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-08-05").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: UNHCR HR Services Report - June 2024",
                        Description = "To: gelsei@unhcr.org\nCC: almazayd@unhcr.org; szekely@unhcr.org; namwanje@unhcr.org; laurentium@unops.org; CHAPURSK@unhcr.org; patelz@unhcr.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: UNHCR HR Services Report - June 2024\nBody:\nDear Gergo,\n\nPlease see link for IICA UNHCR population as agreed on a weekly basis while the IICA insurance campaign rolls out.\nLorraine\nOn Tue, Jul 30, 2024 at 1:09 PM Gergo Gelsei <gelsei@unhcr.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Lorraine, this is great news indeed. And as said, we do not need all those many technicalities, literally we would need only the list of IICAs, name, duty station, title, ICA level, contract start and end date.\n\nThank you again, \nGergo\n \n \n\nFrom: Lorraine ANABTAWI <lorrainea@unops.org> \n\nSent: Tuesday, July 30, 2024 1:01 PM\n\nTo: Gergo Gelsei <gelsei@unhcr.org>\n\nCc: Laurentiu MASTACAN <laurentium@unops.org>; Svetlana Chapurskaya <CHAPURSK@unhcr.org>; Akram Almazaydeh <almazayd@unhcr.org>; Zen Patel <patelz@unhcr.org>; Mihaela Szekely <szekely@unhcr.org>; Viola Mutesi <namwanje@unhcr.org>\n\nSubject: Re: UNHCR HR Services Report - June 2024\n\n \n\n\nDear Gergo,\n\n \n\n\nThank you for reaching out. In addition to the reports that Laurentiu will send, I will share the names of ICAs on contract. We can definitely do that for August to support the roll out of the insurance.\n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nLorraine\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Mon, Jul 29, 2024 at 12:18 PM Gergo Gelsei <gelsei@unhcr.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Laurentiu,\n \nAs discussed earlier, we are preparing for the communication on including the IICA holders in the Cigna insurance. As such communication should be precisely targeted i.e. to be\n sent only to the persons who will have a contract of more than one month after 1 September, I would like to know if in August we could increase the frequency of the below report from a monthly to a weekly, let’s say on every Monday. We do not necessarily need\n payroll info in there, only the list of those onboard, with contract dates.\n \nAs mentioned, only in August.\n \nThank you and best regards,\nGergo\n \n \n\n\nFrom: Laurentiu MASTACAN <laurentium@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Tuesday, July 16, 2024 12:26 PM\n\nTo: Svetlana Chapurskaya <CHAPURSK@unhcr.org>; Akram Almazaydeh <almazayd@unhcr.org>\n\nCc: Gergo Gelsei <gelsei@unhcr.org>; Lorraine ANABTAWI <LorraineA@unops.org>\n\nSubject: UNHCR HR Services Report - June 2024\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nAttention: This email is from an external sender. Please be careful with any links or attachments.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Svetlana, Akram, \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nI hope my message finds you well.\nPlease find attached the June UNHCR HR services report retrieved as of  16th July 2024. \n\n\n\nPlease note that this HR report should be regarded as a preliminary report – final and accurate data is reflected in our certified financial reports. \n\n\n\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\nBest regards, \n\nLaurentiu Mastacan\n| HR Partnerships Analyst\n| PLG, Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7816 |\nwww.unops.org \nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow\nus on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n \nSubscribe to our external\nnewsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\nor\nSpanish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n-- \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLorraine Anabtawi\n| HR Partnerships Specialist |\n Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS | Tel: 972548174189 | Skype: lorraine.anabtawi\n| www.unops.org\n| Supplying value, delivering results, changing lives\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\nor\nSpanish\n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-- \nLorraine Anabtawi | HR Partnerships Specialist | Partnerships and Liaison Group |\nUNOPS | Tel: 972548174189 | Skype:\nlorraine.anabtawi | www.unops.org | Supplying value, delivering results,\nchanging lives\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date\nwith UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to\nour external newsletter in English, French or Spanish",
