                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-08-06").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: RE: Request for meeting with new UNOPS Deputy Executive Director, ASG Kirstine Damkjær",
                        Description = "To: asbjornb@unops.org\nCC: naimoh@unops.org; karl.svensson@gov.se\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: Request for meeting with new UNOPS Deputy Executive Director, ASG Kirstine Damkjær\nBody:\nDear Asbjorn,\n \nI also hope you had a pleasant summer.\nThank you for your request for meetings with Sida.\n \nDuring this fall Sida is going through a reorganisation and many staff and heads of units/departments will be moving around in the organisation.\nThe new organisation will start first October 2024, and therefore it will be difficult to arrange meeting with relevant Sida colleagues before that date. For example, the department\n that Elisabet Brandberg is leading today will not be part of the new Sida organisation.\n\nTherefore, I hope we ca revisit the plans for visiting Sida after October first.\n \nBest regards,\nCristina\n \n\n\nFrom: Karl Svensson <karl.svensson@gov.se>\n\n\nSent: den 26 juli 2024 11:05\n\nTo: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>; Cristina de Carvalho <cristina.de-carvalho@sida.se>\n\nCc: Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Sv: Request for meeting with new UNOPS Deputy Executive Director, ASG Kirstine Damkjær\n\n\n \nDear\nAsbjørn, \n\n \nThank you for taking the time for our meeting yesterday.\n\n \nRegarding the request of a potential meeting in Stockholm during the fall, I will investigate the possibilities with Carl Hartzell and Michael Hjelmåker when they\n are back in office in two weeks. Let me get back to you then with our thoughts and suggestions.\n\n \nI wish you a pleasant weekend!\n \nBest regards,\n\nKarl\n\n \n\nFrån: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSkickat: den 25 juli 2024 14:56\n\nTill: Karl Svensson <karl.svensson@gov.se>; Cristina de Carvalho <cristina.de-carvalho@sida.se>\n\nKopia: Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>\n\nÄmne: Request for meeting with new UNOPS Deputy Executive Director, ASG Kirstine Damkjær\n\n \n\nDear Karl and Cristina, \n\n \n\n\nI hope this email finds you well with at least some sunny days in Stockholm (unlike Copenhagen...). \n\n\n \n\n\nAs I briefly mentioned to Karl earlier today, our new Executive Director, ASG Kirstine Damkjær would very much like to go to Stockholm during the fall to pay a visit to her Swedish peers, considering the importance of our partnership with\n Sweden. \n\n\n \n\n\nWith regards to bilateral meetings at the MFA I was thinking that it might be useful for her to meet Carl Hartzell and Michael Hjelmåker. Anyone else that might be relevant to meet?\n\n\n \n\n\nWith regards to SIDA perhaps it would be relevant for Kirstine to meet Elisabet Brandberg. Anyone else at SIDA that might be relevant? \n\n\n \n\n\nWith regards to meeting topics I was thinking that it might be useful to discuss the status of UNOPS' reform process, the situation in Ukraine and Gaza, status of ongoing Swedish funded UNOPS projects and then perhaps see where there might\n be possibilities for expanded collaboration - especially in fragile and conflict affected areas. \n\n\n \n\n\nAs always I would be very happy to hear your thoughts and suggestions - and then I look very much forward to seeing you in Stockholm! \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you very much for your kind help! \n\n\n \n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAsbjørn Brink | Head\n of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS\n HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish.",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000ECoibMAD",
