                new (
                    "00TQx00000ECuclMAD",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re-organisation of SIDA",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-08-07").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re-organisation of SIDA",
                        Description = "To: kirstined@unops.org\nCC: emiliep@unops.org; naimoh@unops.org; prapapanb@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re-organisation of SIDA\nBody:\nDear Kirstine,\nFollowing up on our conversation regarding missions to the Nordics, I wanted to briefly inform you that the Swedish Development Agency (SIDA) will be undergoing a major re-organisation in the coming months. This means that our current counterparts will most likely change - as well as the various unit structures. The new organisational structure is expected to be in place during October. \nWith your permission I would therefore suggest that we revert to the issue of a mission to Stockholm once the new organisational structure at SIDA is in place. In the meantime I will naturally continue to keep close contact with them at my level. \nBest,AsbjørnAsbjørn Brink | Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
