                new (
                    "00TQx00000EFV54MAH",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Hybridgenerators visit 19. June 2024 - Ukraine",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-08-08").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Hybridgenerators visit 19. June 2024 - Ukraine",
                        Description = "To: tj@hybridgenerator.dk\nCC: jrg@kirklarsen.dk; JOFI@di.dk; lt@hybridgenerator.dk; jean-vincentc@unops.org; marcusm@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Hybridgenerators visit 19. June 2024 - Ukraine\nBody:\nDear Troels, \nApologies for my late response to your email. It completely drowned in my inbox during the summer holiday. \nTo be considered as a supplier to UNOPS I would suggest that you start out by familiarizing yourself with the process at our Supplier Resource Centre. This is a one-stop shop with information for all suppliers who would like to do business with UNOPS. \nI have also cc'ed colleagues from our procurement group (Marcus) and Jean-Vincent, who is leading our UN WebBuy+ portal. Please do feel free to reach out to them for any further inquiries about how to be considered as a supplier. \nI hope this helps you get started on the process. \nBest regards,Asbjørn\n\nOn Fri, 21 Jun 2024 at 13:36, Troels Jessen <tj@hybridgenerator.dk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjørn,\n \nThank you very much for a pleasant meeting the other day.\n \nAttached please find the presentation from the meeting and product specification.\n \nThe Hybridgenerator will be able to service between 60 and 80 households based on 0,6KWH consumption.\n \nBoth service and production will be a possibility to do local depending on the volume.\n\n \nAs shortly mentioned, we do have units in our rental business that can be supplied fast. This is mainly for the Compact version. These are naturally slightly used units.\n \nHope that our presentation can make the foundation for further talk and if you please can set us up to start the validation process this would be much appreciated.\n \nWish you a good weekend.\n \n \n\nMed Venlig Hilsen / Sincerely\n \nTroels Jessen\nChief Executive Officer\nHybridgenerator ApS\nVAT reg. No. / CVR: 38 49 67 94 \nPhone: +45 51 61 90 87\nwww.hybridgenerator.eu  \n\n \n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n\nAsbjørn Brink | Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
