                    {
                        Name = "Email: Ethiopia",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-08-12").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Ethiopia",
                        Description = "To: pmusanhu@gavi.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Ethiopia\nBody:\nHi Patience!\nHope all is well with you - we have been a bit rubbish at reconnecting recently LOL !!!Let's catch up soon and in the mean time I will e-connect you to my Ethiopia office colleagues as I recall you said you might need some support there.In other news, we have finalised our Gavi UNOPS framework agreement which is exciting, attached here.  Irina Petkova is great to work with !\nLooking forward to hearing from you soon - I am at GHC Thursday this week if you are around ?\nAll best wishes Louise \nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
