                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-08-12").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: UNAIDS' possible interest on partner personnel services",
                        Description = "To: martineaut@unaids.org\nCC: GriebS@unaids.org; arnauds@unops.org; LaurentiuM@unops.org; alejoe@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: UNAIDS' possible interest on partner personnel services\nBody:\nDear Tim,\nThank you for reaching out.\nPlease find attached in xls. Let me know if you face any problem in accessing.\nBest,Lorraine\n\nOn Mon, Aug 12, 2024 at 2:35 PM MARTINEAU, Timothy <martineaut@unaids.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Lorraine\n\n\n\n\n\nthanks for sending this and apologies for the delay from both Stephan and I due to leave.\n\n\n\n\n\nis there a way you could provide this in an excel format so we can access it outside of a google account please?\n\n\n\n\n\nmany thanks again and best wishes\n\n \nTim\n \nTim Martineau\n+ 41 79 516 6225\n \n\n\n\nFrom: Lorraine ANABTAWI <lorrainea@unops.org>\n\nSent: Monday, August 5, 2024 18:46\n\nTo: GRIEB, Stephan Ulrich <GriebS@unaids.org>\n\nCc: MARTINEAU, Timothy <martineaut@unaids.org>; Arnaud SGAMBATO <arnauds@unops.org>; Laurentiu MASTACAN <LaurentiuM@unops.org>; Alejo EIRIZ <alejoe@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: UNAIDS' possible interest on partner personnel services\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou don't often get email from lorrainea@unops.org. \nLearn why this is important\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Stephan,\n\nThank you for providing a rough simulation of the\n workforce. I am happy to provide both a qualitative and quantitative analysis of the proposed numbers you shared:\n\n\n\nDetailed Cost Breakdown:\n\n\n\nThe following\ndraft\n budget has been prepared based on a rough simulation of UNOPS’ “Module 1: Contract administration\n & payroll”, using different assumptions of years of experience and corresponding sublevels where the partner agency has\n already identified the candidates and is requesting UNOPS to issue the contracts and run the payroll. \n\n\nPlease note that should UNAIDS request UNOPS to run the recruitment processes,\n this would entail an additional cost per recruitment process.\n\n\n\nEfficiency Metrics:\n\n\n\nUNOPS offers streamlined administrative processes,\n offering organizations the ability to quickly modify their workforce according to immediate needs. \n\n\nICAs can be assigned to various roles and locations\n promptly, allowing the organization to respond to global changes and emergencies effectively.\n\n\nWhere UNOPS is to administer ICA contracts on behalf\n of UNAIDS, the contract issue timeframe is within 5 working days subject to the required documents being complete and the relevant budget/funding available.\n\n\nWhere UNOPS is involved in the recruitment process,\n the estimated recruitment turnaround time is 2 to 3 months depending on UNAIDS availability and other operational parameters in relation to key stages. The recruitment process for ICA positions is typically faster and involves less bureaucracy than for staff. \n\n\n\nScalability and Flexibility:\n\n\n\nUNOPS HR services are already mature and ready to\n be offered immediately. \n\n\nThe ICA contract modality, specifically designed\n to offer a competitive contracting option for project/programme-based roles, supports positions requiring variable contract durations, providing flexibility that aligns with project/programme timelines and workforce demands. \n\n\nI\n am happy to set up a call to discuss the document and respond to any questions you may have.\n\n\n\nLooking\n forward to hearing from you soon. \n\n\n\nBest,\nLorraine\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOn Fri, Jul 26, 2024 at 3:58 PM GRIEB, Stephan Ulrich <GriebS@unaids.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Lorraine, Arnaud and Alejo,\n \nMany thanks for meeting us this morning and many thanks for the presentation.\n \nAs a simulation we would be grateful if you could provide us with the following calculation:\n \nA simulation for 100 positions at the P4-ICSC 11 level equivalent and 50 positions at the ICSC 5 equivalent (those are both mid scale hence a good approximation) and including your standard social security and other costs, located as follows:\n \n-10 positions in Bonn, Germany(5 P4, 5 Gs 5)\n-10 positions in Johannesburg, Sout Africa (5 P4, 5 Gs 5)\n-10 positions in Nairobi, Kenya (5 P4, 5 Gs 5)\n-10 positions in Bangkok, Thailand (5 P4, 5 Gs 5)\n \n-10 positions in Bangui, Centrafrique, (5 P4, 5 Gs 5)\n \n-10 positions in Kiev, Ukraine(5 P4, 5 Gs 5)\n-2 positions in Mbabane, Eswatini (1 P4, 1 Gs 5)\n-2 positions in Ndjamena, Chad(1 P4, 1 Gs 5)\n-2 positions in Gaborone, Botswana(1 P4, 1 Gs 5)\n-2 positions in Lome, Togo(1 P4, 1 Gs 5)\n-2 positions in Ouagadougou, Burkina Faso(1 P4, 1 Gs 5)\n \n-2 positions in Kigali, Rwanda (1 P4, 1 Gs 5)\n-2 positions in Freetown, Sierra Leone (1 P4, 1 Gs 5)\n-2 positions in Maseru, Lesotho (1 P4, 1 Gs 5)\n-2 positions in Almaty,  Kazakhstan (1 P4, 1 Gs 5)\n-2 in Washington, USA (1 P4, 1 Gs 5)\n \n-20 in Geneva, Switzerland (10 P4, 10 Gs 5)\n \nMany thanks!\n \nStephan\n \nStephan U. Grieb | Director | People Management | UNAIDS | 20 Avenue Appia | CH-1211 Geneva 27 | Switzerland \n \n\n \n \n \n\nFrom: Lorraine ANABTAWI <lorrainea@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Friday, 26 July 2024 2:34 pm\n\nTo: GRIEB, Stephan Ulrich <GriebS@unaids.org>; MARTINEAU, Timothy <martineaut@unaids.org>\n\nCc: Arnaud SGAMBATO <arnauds@unops.org>; Laurentiu MASTACAN <LaurentiuM@unops.org>; Victoria CAMPBELL <victoriac@unops.org>;\n Alejo EIRIZ <alejoe@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: UNAIDS' possible interest on partner personnel services\n\n \n\n\nDear Stephan and Tim,\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you for taking the time to meet with us. We appreciate the insightful discussion and are pleased to share the full presentation (attached) from our meeting. \n\n\nAs discussed, we look forward to receiving information on the foreseen workforce to support in providing a closer estimation of the cost. \nThank you again for your time and we look forward to further discussions,\nBest,\nLorraine\n\n \n\n\nOn Wed, Jul 24, 2024 at 2:49 PM GRIEB, Stephan Ulrich <GriebS@unaids.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks Arnaud, Looking forward and confirming that from our side it will be Tim and I. Will you send us the Team invite? Best!\n \n\n\nFrom: Arnaud SGAMBATO <arnauds@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Wednesday, 24 July 2024 1:38 pm\n\nTo: GRIEB, Stephan Ulrich <GriebS@unaids.org>\n\nCc: MARTINEAU, Timothy <martineaut@unaids.org>; Lorraine ANABTAWI <lorrainea@unops.org>; Laurentiu MASTACAN <LaurentiuM@unops.org>;\n Valerie KUSHATA <valeriek@unops.org>; Victoria CAMPBELL <victoriac@unops.org>; Alejo EIRIZ <alejoe@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: UNAIDS' possible interest on partner personnel services\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou don't often get email from\narnauds@unops.org. \nLearn why this is important\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Stephan,\n\n\n\nThanks for your email and interest in discussing a potential collaboration. Friday, July 26th, at 9.30 works for us as well.\n\n\nIn addition to myself, please share the MS Teams invite with the following UNOPS colleagues:\n\n- Lorraine ANABTAWI, HR Partnerships Specialist\n\n- Victoria CAMPBELL, Deputy Director, People and Performance Group\n\n- Alejo EIRIZ, Senior HR Manager - Policy & Compliance | People & Change Group\n\n\n\nWe look forward to our meeting and discussion.\n\nKind regards,\n\n\n\nArnaud\n\n\n\n\nArnaud Sgambato\n| Head of unit - Partnerships Development | Partnerships and Liaison Group (PLG) | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7717 |\nwww.unops.org\n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nTwitter,\nLinkedIn,\nFacebook,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench\n or Spanish. \n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Wed, 24 Jul 2024 at 09:45, GRIEB, Stephan Ulrich <GriebS@unaids.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Arnaud,\n \nMany thanks for the overview. Tim Martineau (our Director of Management) and I would be very interested in learning more and discussing a possible collaboration. Could we set up a Teams call, if possible this or early\n next week? Would Friday 26 July at 9:30 be an option for you and /or your colleagues? Best!\n \nStephan U. Grieb | Director | People Management | UNAIDS | 20 Avenue Appia | CH-1211 Geneva 27 | Switzerland \n \n\n \n \n \n\n\nFrom: Arnaud SGAMBATO <arnauds@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Thursday, 18 July 2024 4:37 pm\n\nTo: GRIEB, Stephan Ulrich <GriebS@unaids.org>\n\nCc: Laurentiu MASTACAN <LaurentiuM@unops.org>; Lorraine ANABTAWI <LorraineA@unops.org>; Alejo EIRIZ <alejoe@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: UNAIDS' possible interest on partner personnel services\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou don't often get email from\narnauds@unops.org. \nLearn why this is important\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Alejo,\n\n\nThanks a lot for making the connection.\n\n\n\nDear Stephan,\n\nThank you for your interest in UNOPS HR services. I hope this email finds you well.  Further to your request, please find attached an\noverview of our HR services.\n\nPlease let us know if you have any questions and whether you would be interested in setting up a short meeting so we can better understand your needs, present our detailed service offering, costing and pricing, contract\n issuance average time, and answer any questions you might have. \n\nWe look forward to hearing from you and are eager to discuss our services further.\nBest regards, \n\n\n\nArnaudrmal\">On Mon, 15 Jul 2024 at 16:34, Alejo EIRIZ <alejoe@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\nDear colleagues,  \n\n \n\n\nI hope this email finds you well.\n\n\n \n\n\nAlthough you may already know him from his previous roles in UNICEF and UNHCR, please let me introduce you to Mr. Stephan Grief, Director, People Management at UNAIDS. For ease of reference, his contact details are\n as follows: griebs@unaids.org\n\n\n \n\n\nStephan is quite familiar with the partner personnel services we provide but he would need the full description of our services and pricing (both direct costs, i.e., proforma costs and management fee, etc.) so he can\n discuss those details internally in UNAIDS. \n\n\n \n\n\nThanks,\n\nBest,\n\nAlejo\n\n-- \n\n\n\nAlejo Eiriz | Senior\n HR Manager - Policy & Compliance | People & Change Group | UNOPS\nTel: +45 45 33 75 81  Mob: +45 30 17 75 81 | www.unops.org\n \nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. Subscribe\n to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench\n or Spanish.\n\n \n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n-- \n\n\n\n\n\n\nLorraine Anabtawi\n| HR Partnerships Specialist |\n Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS | Tel: 972548174189 | Skype: lorraine.anabtawi\n| www.unops.org\n| Supplying value, delivering results, changing lives\n \nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\nor\nSpanish\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-- \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLorraine Anabtawi\n| HR Partnerships Specialist |\n Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS | Tel: 972548174189 | Skype: lorraine.anabtawi\n| www.unops.org\n| Supplying value, delivering results, changing lives\n \nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\nor\nSpanish\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-- \nLorraine Anabtawi | HR Partnerships Specialist | Partnerships and Liaison Group |\nUNOPS | Tel: 972548174189 | Skype:\nlorraine.anabtawi | www.unops.org | Supplying value, delivering results,\nchanging lives\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date\nwith UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to\nour external newsletter in English, French or Spanish",
