at Kirstine and Tomas already\n are in advanced talks regarding a meeting in August. I believe they themselves intend to agree upon a specific date and time.\n\n \nBest,\nSimon\n \n\n_______________________________________________________\n\n \n\nSIMON HOLST MØLLER /\nSIMOLL@UM.DK\n\nHEAD OF SECTION / TEAM FN POLICY\n\nDEPARTMENT FOR MULTILATERAL COOPERATION (MULTI)\n\nDIRECT +45 2033 0690\n\n \n\nMINISTRY OF FOREIGN AFFARS OF DENMARK\n\nASIATISK PLADS 2  / DK-1448 COPENHAGEN K\n\n\n+45 3392 0000 /\nWWW.UM.DK\n\n \n\nHOW WE TREAT YOUR PERSONAL INFORMATION\n\n\n \n \n \n \n\n\nFra: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSendt: 24. juli 2024 10:23\n\nTil: Simon Holst Møller <simoll@um.dk>\n\nCc: Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>; Prapapan BUALEK <prapapanb@unops.org>; Waing Chit AUNG <waingchita@unops.org>;\n Rikke Enggaard Olsen <rikoln@um.dk>; Julia Winding <julwin@um.dk>\n\nEmne: Re: Request for bilateral meetings with ASG Kirstine Damkjær\n\n\n \n[CAUTION - EXTERNAL EMAIL] This email was sent from outside the MFA organisation. DO NOT reply, click on links, or open attachments unless you have verified\n the sender and know the content is safe.\n\n\nSuper! Thanks for your rapid response! \n\n\n \n\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you. \n\n\n \n\n\n/Asbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Wed, 24 Jul 2024 at 10:21, Simon Holst Møller <simoll@um.dk> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjørn,\n \nThank you for reaching out. I trust you are doing well?\n \nYour request has been well received. I am confident that all three would be delighted\n to meet Kirstine as soon as time allows it.\n \nWe will look into possible time slots promptly and revert to you once we have feasible\n suggestions to share. \n \nLet me know if any further questions arise in the meantime.\n\n \nBest,\nSimon\n \n\n_______________________________________________________\n\n \n\nSIMON HOLST MØLLER /\nSIMOLL@UM.DK\n\nHEAD OF SECTION / TEAM FN POLICY\n\nDEPARTMENT FOR MULTILATERAL COOPERATION (MULTI)\n\nDIRECT +45 2033 0690\n\n \n\nMINISTRY OF FOREIGN AFFARS OF DENMARK\n\nASIATISK PLADS 2  / DK-1448 COPENHAGEN K\n\n\n+45 3392 0000 /\nWWW.UM.DK\n\n \n\nHOW WE TREAT YOUR PERSONAL INFORMATION\n\n\n \n \n \n \n\n\nFra: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSendt: 24. juli 2024 09:44\n\nTil: MULTI, Team FN, Policy (INTERNAL) DL <multiteamfnpolintdl@um.dk>\n\nCc: Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>; Prapapan BUALEK <prapapanb@unops.org>; Waing Chit AUNG <waingchita@unops.org>;\n Rikke Enggaard Olsen <rikoln@um.dk>; Julia Winding <julwin@um.dk>\n\nEmne: Re: Request for bilateral meetings with ASG Kirstine Damkjær\n\n\n \n[CAUTION - EXTERNAL EMAIL] This email was sent from outside the MFA organisation. DO NOT reply, click on links, or open attachments unless you have verified\n the sender and know the content is safe.\n\n\nForwarding this to the broader team due to Rikke's absence. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Wed, 24 Jul 2024 at 09:41, Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\nDear Rikke\n\n\n \n\n\nFollowing up on our previous conversations, I hope that you could be helpful in identifying some workable time slots for bilateral intro meetings with UNOPS' relatively\n new Deputy Executive Director, ASG Kirstine Damkjær. \n\n\n \n\n\nKirstine has asked if it would be possible to meet at some point during september individually with: \n\n\n\n\nLotte Machon\nOle Thonke\nThomas Anker\n\nThank you very much in advance for your kind help. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAsbjørn Brink | Head\n of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS\n HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in\nEnglish,\nFrench\n or Spanish.",
