                        Subject = "Email: Fwd: Meeting with new UNOPS DED",
                        Description = "To: faresc@who.int\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: Meeting with new UNOPS DED\nBody:\nBonjour ma chère Christine!I saw you in the distance yesterday while I had a coffee with Monica - I hope we can speak again properly soon ;) !Meantime, can I pls follow up on this request for meeting with Mike on 3rd (any time) or 4th September (morning)Thank you so much and speak soon!Louise \n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\nDate: Mon, 5 Aug 2024 at 15:09\nSubject: Meeting with new UNOPS DED\nTo: RYAN, Michael J. <ryanm@who.int>\nCc: FARES, Christine Youssef <faresc@who.int>, KABIR, Sophia <kabirso@who.int>, FARZI, Michael <mfarzi@who.int>\n\nDear Mike,\nI hope this finds you (and the team in copy ;) well and you've managed to get some down time during the last few weeks ...\nMs Kirstine Damkjær, UNOPS new Deputy Executive Director for Delivery and Partnerships, is planning a short mission to Geneva to meet key health partners during the week of 2-5 September - can we identify a slot in your schedule for a courtesy visit during the early part of that week? (UN SG announcement here)\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\n\nThanks and best wisheslouise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
