                        Description = "To: vinod.varma@theglobalfund.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: UNOPS GF follow up\nBody:\nDear VinodIt was great to meet you this week and discuss areas of mutual interest, particularly collaboration with Banks on procurement related activities!As discussed, please find below a few capacity statements to provide examples of the services UNOPS provides to our partners. I can send you a short presentation on our cost recovery business model etc. if interested - pls let me know. We have the WAMBO team based here in Geneva and we also have our local offices in over 100 countries - we have delivered projects with GF support in over 60 countries already :) \nLooking forward to keeping in touch!\nBest wishes\nLouise \nUNOPS - PharmaMx MexicoUNOPS - Procurement - Medical DevicesUNOPS - Procurement - MedicinesUNOPS - Medical Waste Management\nUNOPS - Health programme capacity building \nUNOPS - Health Programme and Fund Management \nUNOPS - Health supply chain management and warehousing \n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
