                new (
                    "00TQx00000ErJCbMAN",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Crown Agents",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-08-23").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Crown Agents",
                        Description = "To: Agnes.Annells@fcdo.gov.uk; Sally.Clifford@fcdo.gov.uk\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Crown Agents\nBody:\nDear Agnes and Sally, \nWe noticed with great sadness the unfortunate demise of the esteemed Crown Agents. With 191 years of operations it was quite an institution that did some really good and important work. \nHaving been one of the FCDO's most important implementing contractors, I imagine that some of your local embassies are now looking for alternative implementing partners. Looking at Crown Agents' core capacities in delivering in some of the most fragile and conflict affected areas, complex and high impact projects, health systems, project managements, procurements, logistics, capacity building etc. - I am thinking that this aligns very well with the core capacities of UNOPS. \nI was therefore wondering if it might be useful for you to engage in a conversation on where the FCDO is looking for alternative implementing partners - to see if UNOPS could rapidly help carry forward the important work? If so, it might also be worthwhile to explore if we could develop some sort of MOU or similar at HQ level to make it easy for our colleagues in the field to carry forward the important projects smoothessly. \nI would be very keen on hearing your thoughts on how together we could best help our colleagues in the field - and avoid too much interruption in the important work for the benefit of vulnerable people. \nLooking forward to hearing your initial thoughts on this. \nBest regards,Asbjørn\n\nAsbjørn Brink | Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
