                        Description = "To: rineeta.naik@un.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: AP HRWG - Updates, new guidance and resources\nBody:\nDear AP HRWG members,\n\n\n\n\n\nAs promised, please find attached a compilation of the updates and resources presented during our meeting on 23 August. The presentation by UN Women on Beijing+30 is also attached.\n\n\n\n\n\nRegards,\n\n\n\n\n\nRineeta Naik and Aparna Basnyat\n\nCo-chairs\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRineeta Naik\n\nHuman Rights Officer\n\nUN Human Rights Office (OHCHR)\n\nBangkok, Thailand\n\nE-mail: rineeta.naik@un.org\n\nMobile: +91 98119 74290\n\n\nWeb: bangkok.ohchr.org\nTwitter:\nOHCHRasia\nFacebook:\nOHCHRasia\nInstagram:\nohchr_asia",
                        Location = null,
