                new (
                    "00TQx00000F84kIMAR",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: WCD campaign and event in Alexandria",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-08-30").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: WCD campaign and event in Alexandria",
                        Description = "To: ycastro@citiesalliance.org; kajsah@unops.org; ekaterina.bezgachina@un.org\nCC: elenage@unops.org; amyn@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: WCD campaign and event in Alexandria\nBody:\nDear all, \nIt was nice meeting you all yesterday and discussing our next steps. \nAs discussed, please find this shared drive where we can all share information re: WCD campaign. Hilaria had prepared this document before she left for details of this campaign, including activities, actions, deadlines, etc. I have modified it based on our discussion yesterday to reflect the current situation and actions to be taken in a couple of days. Please feel free to add any input from your end. \nLook forward to our next meeting! \nBest,Juyoung Juyoung LEE | Communications Specialist | Africa Regional Office | Nairobi, Kenya | Tel: +254 710 980 838 | www.unops.orgKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Twitter, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
