                new (
                    "00TQx00000FIJWiMAP",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Call with Danish UN representative Geneva on Gaza",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-09-04").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Call with Danish UN representative Geneva on Gaza",
                        Description = "To: kirstined@unops.org\nCC: jorge.moreiradasilva@unops.org; banak@unops.org; jakobt@unops.org; marijab@unops.org; emiliep@unops.org; naimoh@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Call with Danish UN representative Geneva on Gaza\nBody:\nDear Kirstine,\n\nThank you very much for raising the great work done in Gaza to our Danish partners! \nBack in April we actually already got 2.2M USD from Denmark to the Gaza Mechanism following dialogue with their humanitarian department at the MFA. \nI am however confident that we would be able to get more support from Denmark for some of the other work we do in Gaza, such as the ASU and procurement and delivery of humanitarian aid. \n@Bana KALOTI: If you can help with some dates that might work for you to brief Ib Petersen then @Marija BATEMAN and I could together work on a pitch to the Danes. \nOnce again - thanks for helping out on this!\nBest,Asbjørn\nOn Wed, 4 Sept 2024 at 09:00, Kirstine DAMKJAER <kirstined@unops.org> wrote:\nDear all \nI had a good meeting with Ib Petersen from the Danish MOFA yesterday in Geneva. He is a strong voice in MOFA and has behind the scenes been involved in Gaza discussions. It would be helpful if we could set up a call with him to give him a more detailed overview of what our mechanism is about. It could help push for support from Denmark on the mechanism. \nBana, could you give us a few dates when you might be available to do such as call. Asbjorn can help coordinate. \nBest, Kirstine",
