                new (
                    "00TQx00000FJK7MMAX",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: FW: COP27 UNOPS Youth Event",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2022-11-03").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: FW: COP27 UNOPS Youth Event",
                        Description = "To: celiaafricak@unops.org\nCC: jeromedt@unops.org; holy.ranaivozanany@africaeuropefoundation.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: FW: COP27 UNOPS Youth Event\nBody:\nDear Celia,\n\n \nI am just coming back to this as agendas are consolidating fast and wanted to check with you to explore the opportunity of scheduling a bilateral with UNOPS’ senior team onsite at COP\n during the first week. \n \nAs mentioned below both:\n\nPaul Walton, Executive Director of AEF\n\nKandeh Yumkella, former CEO of Sustainable Energy for All and Chair of UN Energy, Co-Chair of the AEF Strategy group\n \nI understand that there will also be a representative from Sierra Leone onsite who is working on clean cooking solutions who would be of interest to connect with Kandeh in particular, who has led our Clean Cooking Work\n at the AEF. \n \nThe 8th in the afternoon would be a good slot for us however I revert to your feedback on this.\n\n \nThanks in advance and I look forward to your response.\n\n \nKind regards, \nChahaiya  \n \n\nChahaiya Pilkington​(she/her)Outreach and Advocacy ManagerAfrica‑Europe Foundation – Transforming Dialogue into Actionchahaiya.pilkington@africaeuropefoundation.orgSquare de Meeûs 5‑6, B‑1000 Brussels\nFrom: Chahaiya Pilkington <chahaiya.pilkington@africaeuropefoundation.org>\n\n\nSent: Wednesday, 19 October 2022 17:53\n\nTo: Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <jeromedt@unops.org>\n\nCc: Celia KELLER MARTINEZ <celiaafricak@unops.org>; Manal Benani <manal.benani@africaeuropefoundation.org>; Holy Ranaivozanany <holy.ranaivozanany@africaeuropefoundation.org>\n\nSubject: RE: COP27 UNOPS Youth Event\n\n\n \nDear Jerome,\n\n \nTaking the liberty to come back to you on behalf of Holy as I am responsible for the coordination concerning our youth activities and engagement at COP27.\n\n \nMany thanks for providing us an overview of who will be onsite. We are currently finalising our participation and attendance alongside that of the youth delegation, and we’d be delighted\n to come back to you with suggestions for potential speakers for your activity on the 10th.\n\n \nAs it stands, onsite during the first week of activities, we will have onsite:\n\n\nPaul Walton, Executive Director of AEF\nKandeh Yumkella, former CEO of sustainable energy\nTbc\nVhalinavho Khavhagali, Senior Fellow for Adaptation at the Africa-Europe Foundation, and country representative for South Africa at the International Union for the Conservation of Nature (IUCN)\n \nWe look forward to sharing the info soon.\n\n \nKind regards,\n\nChahaiya\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nChahaiya Pilkington​\n\n\n(she/her)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOutreach and Advocacy Manager\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAfrica‑Europe Foundation – Transforming Dialogue into Action\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nchahaiya.pilkington@africaeuropefoundation.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSquare de Meeûs 5‑6\n\n\n, \n\n\nB‑1000 Brussels\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom: Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <jeromedt@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Wednesday, 19 October 2022 14:52\n\nTo: Holy Ranaivozanany <holy.ranaivozanany@africaeuropefoundation.org>\n\nCc: Celia KELLER MARTINEZ <celiaafricak@unops.org>; Chahaiya Pilkington <chahaiya.pilkington@africaeuropefoundation.org>\n\nSubject: Re: COP27 UNOPS Youth Event\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCAUTION: This email originated from outside the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the\n sender and know the content is safe. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHi Holy,\n\n\n \n\n\nFor your info, the following UNOPS representatives will attend COP27:\n\n\n\n\nJens Wandel, Executive Director\nEmilie Potvin, Director of Partnerships\nDalila Goncalves, Deputy Regional Director, Africa,\nIfeoma Charles-Monwuba, Director/Representative, Ghana multi-country Office (covering Ghana, The Gambia, Liberia, Nigeria and Sierra Leone)\nRainer Frauenfel, Director East and Southern Africa (incl. Kenya, Mozambique, Tanzania, Uganda, Zambia, Zimbabwe, etc.)\nTatiana Wah, Director/Representative DRC multi-country office (covering Angola, Burundi, Cameroon, Central African Republic, Comoros, Gabon, Equatorial Guinea, Democratic Republic of Congo, Republic of Congo, Madagascar, and Rwanda)\n\n\nDo you already have a list of your delegation that you may share with us?\n\n\n \n\n\nPls let us know if you have any speakers to suggest for our panel on Youth Day as mentioned in Celia's email below.\n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nJérôme\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nJérôme de Thysebaert\n| Senior Communications and Liaison Associate | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Tel: + 32 (0) 499 197 497 |\nwww.unops.org\n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube. Subscribe\n to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench or\nSpanish. \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Mon, Oct 17, 2022 at 9:40 AM Celia KELLER MARTINEZ <celiaafricak@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\nDear Holy, \n \nIt was a pleasure meeting you last week!\n\n\n \nFollowing our conversation on the Youth events at the Climate Mobility Pavilion on 10th November, please see attached the concept note of our session.\n\n \nWe would really appreciate any suggestions you might have on youth advocates or frontline community representatives present at COP27 that we could invite to speak to their\n experiences or work in adaptation or loss and damage. \n\n \nAs an update, the invitations to Jayathma Wickramanayake, Vanessa Nakate and Atle Solberg were sent out by our Executive Director on Friday. The moderator, Nadia Gullestrup,\n the EU’s Youth Delegate to the UN, is confirmed.  \n \nPlease let me know if you have any questions.\n\n \n\nMany thanks in advance,\n \nKind regards,\n \nCelia\n \n\n\n\n\nCelia Keller Martínez\n| Partnerships Analyst (Events Coordinator) | Partnerships & Liaison Group (PLG) | UNOPS | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +34 618 71 78 49 |\nwww.unops.org \n\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube.\n\n\nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench or\nSpanish.",
