                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: UNOPS contract types-WFP",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-09-06").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: UNOPS contract types-WFP",
                        Description = "To: camilla.dupont@wfp.org\nCC: laurentium@unops.org; arnauds@unops.org; alejoe@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS contract types-WFP\nBody:\nDear Camilla,\nIt was a pleasure meeting with you and discussing the ICA contract modality offered by UNOPS.I am attaching the complete presentation, which includes the simulations for both Dubai and Budapest, as requested. \nPlease feel free to review it and let us know if you require any additional information for your internal consultations.\nBest regards,Lorraine  \n\nOn Thu, Aug 29, 2024 at 1:46 PM Laurentiu MASTACAN <laurentium@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Camilla, \nThank you for your email. We will aim to reschedule the call and will get back to you with a proposed time. \nBest regards, Laurentiu Mastacan | HR Partnerships Analyst | PLG, Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS Headquarters | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 4533 7816 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.\n\nOn Thu, Aug 29, 2024 at 12:36 PM Camilla DUPONT <camilla.dupont@wfp.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Lorraine,\n \nUnfortunately, I’m not feeling well. Would it be possible to reschedule for tomorrow? I’m very sorry for the late notice.\n \nThanks in advance and best regards, Camilla\n \n\nCamilla Dupont\nChief, HR Policy & Compliance Branch (HRMOP)\n\nHuman Resources Division\nWorld Food Programme\nRome, Italy\n\n \n\n-----Original Appointment-----\n\nFrom: Lorraine ANABTAWI <lorrainea@unops.org> \n\nSent: Wednesday, August 28, 2024 6:47 AM\n\nTo: Lorraine ANABTAWI; Laurentiu MASTACAN; Arnaud SGAMBATO; Camilla DUPONT\n\nSubject: UNOPS contract types-WFP\n\nWhen: 29 August 2024 13:00-14:00 Africa/Ceuta.\n\nWhere: \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYou don't often get email from\nlorrainea@unops.org. \nLearn why this is important \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPlease be careful when opening emails that originate from outside WFP\n\n\nUNOPS contract types-WFP\n\n\nJoin with Google Meet – You have been invited by Lorraine ANABTAWI to attend an event named UNOPS contract types-WFP on Thursday Aug 29, 2024\n⋅ 13:00\n– 14:00 (Central European Time - Ceuta).\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJoin\n with Google Meet\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMeeting link\n\n\n\n\n\nmeet.google.com/foy-uvbi-gxr\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJoin by phone\n\n\n\n\n(DK)\n+45 70 71 46 61\n\n\nPIN: 733057644\n\n\n\nMore phone numbers\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWhen\n\n\n\n\nThursday Aug 29, 2024\n⋅ 13:00\n– 14:00 (Central European Time - Ceuta)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGuests\n\n\n\n\n\nLorraine ANABTAWI\n- organizer\n\n\nLaurentiu MASTACAN\n\n\n\nArnaud SGAMBATO\n\n\n\ncamilla.dupont@wfp.org\n\n\nView\n all guest info\n\n\n\n\n\nReply for\ncamilla.dupont@wfp.org\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nYes\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNo\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMaybe\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nMore\n options\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nInvitation from\nGoogle Calendar\nYou are receiving this email because you are an attendee on the event. To stop receiving future updates for this event, decline this event.\nForwarding this invitation could allow any recipient to send a response to the organizer, be added to the guest list, invite others regardless\n of their own invitation status, or modify your RSVP. \nLearn more\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe information contained in this electronic message and any attachments is intended for specific individuals or entities, and may be confidential, proprietary or privileged. If you are not the intended recipient, please notify the sender immediately, delete\n this message and do not disclose, distribute or copy it to any third party or otherwise use this message. The content of this message does not necessarily reflect the official position of the World Food Programme. Electronic messages are not secure or error\n free and may contain viruses or may be delayed, and the sender is not liable for any of these occurrences. The sender reserves the right to monitor, record and retain electronic messages.\n\n\n\n\n-- \nLorraine Anabtawi | HR Partnerships Specialist | Partnerships and Liaison Group |\nUNOPS | Tel: 972548174189 | Skype:\nlorraine.anabtawi | www.unops.org | Supplying value, delivering results,\nchanging lives\n\n \n\nKeep up-to-date\nwith UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to\nour external newsletter in English, French or Spanish",
