                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Various",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-09-09").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Various",
                        Description = "To: Agnes.Annells@fcdo.gov.uk; Sally.Clifford@fcdo.gov.uk\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Various\nBody:\nOne more ask added to the list... \n\nApologies. \nOn Mon, 9 Sept 2024 at 16:33, Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Agnes and Sally,\nI am reaching out to you to gather some of the many loose ends we have ongoing together. \n\nI was wondering if you may have had a change to identify possible dates for the Strategic Dialogue - perhaps before the end of the year? Did we manage to identify a time slot during UNGA for a conversation between Jorge and your new development minister? Alternatively a phone call in the coming weeks? Any news on where you would like for us to transfer the surplus funds from the Somalia projects?Would you be helpful with transmitting my inquiry regarding the work previously being done by Crown Agents to your commercial team? I noticed that the review of the UK development polocy has been initiated / made public. I was wondering what would be the process for UN entities to provide some input?   Sorry for the many asks! Feel free to kick some of them right back at me. \nThanks in advance for your always kind help! \nBest,Asbjørn\n\nAsbjørn Brink | Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | UNOPS HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Mob: +45 40 80 36 54 | www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube Subscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish.",
