                ),
                new (
                    "00TQx00000GlmEXMAZ",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-10-10").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program",
                        Description = "To: katariina.hautamaki-huuki@gov.fi\nCC: Mervi.Kultamaa@gov.fi; Sanna.Luomanpera@gov.fi; aki.enkenberg@gov.fi; KEO-40@gov.fi; Mari.Lankinen@gov.fi; Satu.Lassila@gov.fi; naimoh@unops.org; hannap@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program\nBody:\nDear Katarina\nPlease find attached the receipt confirming the transfer of USD 7.212.684,18 from UNOPS to the Finnish Treasury. \nBest regards,Asbjørn\nOn Thu, 26 Sept 2024 at 15:24, Hautamäki-Huuki Katariina (UM) <katariina.hautamaki-huuki@gov.fi> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjorn,\n \nThank you very much for your message and confirmation.\nHappy to hear that the verification call has also taken place and everything is set for the transfer.\n \nWith kind regards,\n \nKatariina\n \n \nFrom: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: torstai 26. syyskuuta 2024 16.18\n\nTo: Hautamäki-Huuki Katariina (UM) <katariina.hautamaki-huuki@gov.fi>\n\nCc: Lassila Satu (UM) <Satu.Lassila@gov.fi>; Kultamaa Mervi (UM) <Mervi.Kultamaa@gov.fi>; Luomanperä Sanna (UM) <Sanna.Luomanpera@gov.fi>; Enkenberg Aki (UM) <aki.enkenberg@gov.fi>; naimoh@unops.org; hannap@unops.org; KEO-40 UM <KEO-40@gov.fi>\n\nSubject: Re: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program\n \n\n\n\nDear Katariina, \n\n\n \n\n\nI can confirm that the forms you've sent meet all the requirements. \n\n\n \n\n\nOur Finance colleagues have already done the verification call with Sari Kantola (the official mentioned in the form) and all is good.\n\n\n \n\n\nWe will now move ahead with the actual transfer and I will send you the receipt of transfer once this is done. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Thu, 26 Sept 2024 at 11:59, Hautamäki-Huuki Katariina (UM) <katariina.hautamaki-huuki@gov.fi> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjorn,\n \nThank you for your quick reply.\n \nPlease, find attached the signed and stamped form with the account type information added.\nCould you kindly confirm that it now meets your requirements, please? Our financial unit has requested\n the confirmation as soon as possible.\n \nAs to the verification call, we suggest that you’d be in touch with:\n1.      \nMs. Sari Kantola (the first contact in the form) and secondarily with\n2.      \nState Treasury number in the form or with the additional contact person given, i.e. Ms. Taina Nissinen of the State Treasury.\nBoth instances have been informed of your upcoming verification call.\n \nCould you please inform us once the return of the funds has been processed at your end for our follow up.\n \nAnd kindly, let me know if you need any further information from our side.\n \nWith kind regards and wishing you a great day,\n \nKatariina\n \n \nFrom: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: keskiviikko 25. syyskuuta 2024 18.15\n\nTo: Hautamäki-Huuki Katariina (UM) <katariina.hautamaki-huuki@gov.fi>\n\nCc: Lassila Satu (UM) <Satu.Lassila@gov.fi>; Enkenberg Aki (UM) <aki.enkenberg@gov.fi>;\nnaimoh@unops.org; \nhannap@unops.org; KEO-40 UM <KEO-40@gov.fi>\n\nSubject: Re: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program\n \n\n\nDear Katariina\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you for checking this with me before sending the final versions. \n\n\n \n\n\nA few pointers: \n\n\n\n\nThe type of account is missing. Being a SEPA (Single Euro Payments Area) compliant account it doesn't really matter. So if you are unsure of the type, \"Checking account\" will work.\nCan you confirm if we can do the verification call in one of those phone numbers in the form? The next step is for us to fill the supplier verification form and for that we need to do a quick call to confirm the bank account number is correct. \n\n\nThank you in advance!\n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\n\nOn Wed, 25 Sept 2024 at 15:27, Hautamäki-Huuki Katariina (UM) <katariina.hautamaki-huuki@gov.fi> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjorn,\n \nThank you very much for your message and our apologies for the delay in responding to you.\nWe have requested our State Treasury to fill out the form you sent but it turned out to be a bit longer exercise\n than expected.\nWe fully understand the mandatory procedure for registering the new bank account as per your internal regulations.\n \nI have finally received the prefilled form today (attached). It is pending the signature and stamp of the Financial\n Services of our Ministry, but I wanted to clear with you/have your confirmation that it contains all the necessary information.\nThe partner (supplier) in the form continues to be the Ministry for Foreign Affairs of Finland but the funds will\n be returned as per our regulations nowadays to the State Treasury account.\n \nPlease, find:\n-         \nPrefilled registration form (pending signature from the Ministry’s side)\nfor your preview (attached)\n-         \nAn electronically signed letter of the State Treasury of the State Agencies’ (incl. the Foreign Ministry) right to use the State Treasury Account (attached)\n-         \nAn additional contact for verifying the bank account: Ms. Taina Nissinen, Senior Manager, State Treasury:\ntaina.nissinen@valtiokonttori.fi,\n tel. +358 295 502 580\n \nWith kind regards,\n \nKatariina\n \n \nFrom: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: keskiviikko 25. syyskuuta 2024 11.43\n\nTo: Hautamäki-Huuki Katariina (UM) <katariina.hautamaki-huuki@gov.fi>\n\nCc: Lassila Satu (UM) <Satu.Lassila@gov.fi>; Enkenberg Aki (UM) <aki.enkenberg@gov.fi>;\nnaimoh@unops.org; \nhannap@unops.org; KEO-40 UM <KEO-40@gov.fi>\n\nSubject: Re: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program\n \n\n\nDear Katariina\n\n\n \n\n\nI am writing to you to follow up on the message below. As you may be aware, the Finnish Minister for Foreign Trade and Development, Mr. Ville Tavio, will be meeting UNOPS' Executive\n Director, Mr. Jorge Moreira da Silva next week. \n\n\n \n\n\nI was therefore thinking that if possible, it would be really good to get this matter settled before the meeting of the two. Could I therefore kindly inquire about the status on\n your side? We are eagerly awaiting the confirmation of the banking information from your side in order for us to transfer the funds back to Finland. \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you very much in advance for your attendance to this matter. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\n\nOn Tue, 20 Aug 2024 at 14:02, Hautamäki-Huuki Katariina (UM) <katariina.hautamaki-huuki@gov.fi> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Mr. Asbjorn,\n \nReferring to the email correspondence below, I am writing to you about transfer of the unused balance\n of the S3i program. Let me e-introduce myself as Ms. Katariina Hautamäki-Huuki. In addition to my desk officer duties of JPO and UNV recruitments, I’m taking care of the general financial matters in our unit. Andrea briefed me about this transfer matter in\n late July.\n \nThank you very much also for your message of 31 July including the instructions and form needed for\n the transfer of these funds. I have forwarded them in early August to our Ministry’s Financial Unit who in turn liaises in this matter with the State Treasury on behalf of our MFA. I have been in touch with them recently and have been informed that the State\n Treasury should revert soon. I will let you know as soon as we have their reply and documentation needed as per your email of 31 July.\n \nWith best regards,\n \nKatariina Hautamäki-Huuki\n \n \n\n\n\n\nKatariina Hautamäki-Huuki\nDesk Officer, JPO and UNV recruitments\n\nUnit for UN Development Issues (KEO-40)\n\nDepartment for Development Policy\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTel.    +358 295 350 817\n\nMob. +358 50 349 7501\nkatariina.hautamaki-huuki@gov.fi\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMinistry for Foreign Affairs of Finland\n\nP. O. Box 176, FI-00023 Government\n\n\n(Laivastokatu 22 G) \n\n\n\num.fi\n\n\n\n\n \n \n\n\nLähettäjä: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\nPäiväys: 20. elokuuta 2024 klo 10.35.19 UTC+3\n\nVastaanottaja: \"Lassila Satu (UM)\" <Satu.Lassila@gov.fi>\n\nKopio: \"Enkenberg Aki (UM)\" <aki.enkenberg@gov.fi>, Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>, \"Tanzi-Albi Andrea (UE)\" <Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi>,\n Hanna PYOKARI <HannaP@unops.org>\n\nAihe: Re: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program\n\n\n\n\n﻿\n\n\nDear Satu and colleagues in Finland, \n\n\n \n\n\nI am sorry to bother you once again with this ask to ensure that we can soon transfer the funds back to you. \n\n\n \n\n\nDid you have an opportunity to take a look at the below? As always - please do not hesitate to let me know if you have any questions as we would be more than happy to help. \n\n\n \n\n\nFinally, could I ask who from your team would be covering the EB next week? I would be very happy to meet for a coffee or lunch to get introduced and ensure a continued constructive\n collaboration. \n\n\n \n\n\nThank you in advance. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n \n\n\nOn Wed, 31 Jul 2024 at 15:50, Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Satu, \n\n \n\n\nSince this is a new bank account - unfortunately we have to verify it to ensure that we send the funds to the right owner. I am terribly sorry about the inconvenience, but could\n I kindly ask for you (or some in your team) to:\n\n\n\n\nFill in the attached form\nSend us a bank confirmation\nProvide me with contact details of another person for verification\n\nI am very sorry for the lengthy process - which is unfortunately mandatory due to past misfortunes. \n\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you very much in advance for your help and understanding. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Thu, 25 Jul 2024 at 12:35, Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\nDear Andrea, \n\n \n\n\nThank you very much for the confirmation. \n\n\n \n\n\nWe will revert to you as soon as the transfer has been made. I might have to come back to you with some additional inquiries, as our finance team has to verify the new account. \n\n\n \n\n\nAs mentioned earlier today, I also wanted to use this opportunity to thank you very much for the collaboration in the past months. It has been an utmost pleasure working with you!\n The Finnish embassy in Algeria is very luck to get you there. \n\n\n \n\n\nI wish you all the best in your new endeavours and hope to bump into you again in the future. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Thu, 25 Jul 2024 at 10:23, Tanzi-Albi Andrea (UM) <Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjorn,\n\n\n\n\nYes, I can confirm that the bank details that were shared previously are indeed correct. As Aki explained, when the return exceeds a certain threshold, the guideline is to ask the refund to the state treasury’s account. In the case of the S3i’s remaining balance,\n the given threshold is exceeded. Since we have requested the refund in USD, we have communicated the State Treasury’s USD-account, specifically.\n\n\n\n\nAt your disposal for any further inquiries, \n\n\n\nAndrea\n \nFrom: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: keskiviikko 26. kesäkuuta 2024 10.36\n\nTo: Enkenberg Aki (UM) <aki.enkenberg@gov.fi>\n\nCc: Tanzi-Albi Andrea (UM) <Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi>; Lassila Satu (UM) <Satu.Lassila@gov.fi>; Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program\n \n\nDear Aki\n\n \n\n\nThank you for your rapid response. I will wait for your confirmation on the correct banking details before proceeding with the transfer. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, 25 Jun 2024 at 15:13, Enkenberg Aki (UM) <aki.enkenberg@gov.fi> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjorn, Andrea is on leave and I’m travelling, but we’ll get back to you as soon as we can and\n confirm this. When returns exceed a certain threshold they are paid directly to the State Treasury, hence the different account.\n\n \nBest,\n\nAki\n \nFrom: Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: tiistai 25. kesäkuuta 2024 11.42\n\nTo: Tanzi-Albi Andrea (UM) <Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi>\n\nCc: Lassila Satu (UM) <Satu.Lassila@gov.fi>; Enkenberg Aki (UM) <aki.enkenberg@gov.fi>; Naimo HASSAN HIRSI <naimoh@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Transfer of the unused balance of Finland's funding to the operations of the S3i program\n \n\nDear Andrea\n\n \n\n\nDuring the transfer process, it has come to our attention that the bank account below does not match with the bank account from where the grant was transferred to UNOPS. The grant\n originated from a bank account in OP Corporate Bank, while the below details are for the State Treasury's account with Danske Bank.\n\n\n\nCould I kindly ask for your preference would be to change the bank account to the one from where the grant originated (we need the full details provided for verification) or if the preference is to register the below vendor in our ERP?\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you in advance for the clarification. \n\n\n \n\n\nBest,\n\n\nAsbjørn\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Fri, 7 Jun 2024 at 18:32, Tanzi-Albi Andrea (UM) <Andrea.Tanzi-Albi@gov.fi> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Asbjorn,\n\n\n\n\nAs we had the occasion to discuss at the margins of the UNDP/UNFPA/UNOPS annual session, Finland is not in a position, at present, to accept the final financial statement provided by UNOPS some time ago. Regardless, we would kindly ask UNOPS to return the remaining\n balance of Finland’s funding to the operations of the S3i program in Helsinki. \n\n \nUNOPS may transfer the balance of 7,212,684.18 USD, as itemized in the attached financial statement provided by UNOPS, to the following bank account (in USD):\n \nBanking details:\n \nBank: Danske Bank\n\nAccount owner: VALTIOKONTTORI\n\nIBAN: FI97 8129 9710 0098 87\nBIC: DABAFIHH\n\n\n\nReference: MFA/KEO-40\n\n\n\nBank Address:\n\n\n\nDanske Bank A/S Finland Branch\n\nTelevisiokatu 1\n\n00075 Danske Bank\n\nFINLAND\n \nAccount owner’s address:\n\n\n\nValtiokonttori\n\nSörnäisten rantatie 13\n\nHelsinki PL 14\n00054 Valtiokonttori\n\nFINLAND\n \nCould I ask you to acknowledge the receipt of this request, and that our information on the sum to be transferred is up to date before I notify our financial management about the\n incoming transfer?\n \nDo let me know if you need anything else.\n\n\n\n\nWith best regards,\n \nAndrea Tanzi-Albi\n\nDesk Officer\n\nUnit for UN Development and Innovation Issues\n \n+358 50\n 4038861\nandrea.tanzi-albi@gov.fi\n\n \n\n\nMinistry for Foreign Affairs of Finland\nMerikasarmi, PO Box 176\n\nFI-00023 Government\n\nFinland",
