                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-10-14").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: FInland / UN City meeting - follow up",
                        Description = "To: philip.bank@businessfinland.fi\nCC: Marjukka.Holopainen-Rainio@businessfinland.fi; Harri.Kamarainen@gov.fi; naimoh@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: FInland / UN City meeting - follow up\nBody:\nDear Philip\nThank you for the constructive meetings and your follow up email. \nI am unsure which urgent needs you refer to - and how such could be coupled with Finnish companies? As mentioned during our conversation, we always have to open and competitive tender processes for our procurement on behalf of donors. \nWith regards to the visit of UNOPS procurement staff to Helsinki - we would be very happy to come. Could you perhaps suggest some dates in March that might work on your end?\nThanks, \nBest,Asbjørn\nOn Wed, 9 Oct 2024 at 11:12, Philip Bank <philip.bank@businessfinland.fi> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHi Asbjørn\n \nGreat to see you in UN City\n \nFollowing our discussion would it be possible for you to send the urgent needs of UNOPS for Finland to donate towards.\nIf ministry is interested we can then connect the companies and solutions accordingly\n\n \nWe would like to plan for UNOPS procurement staff to come to Finland in March 2025.\n\nThis will be a full two days event of procurement and pitching purposes (more details will follow)\n \nHaving the IPS in the end of 2025 would give greater impact for the companies.\n\nAt the same time UNOPS staff would have a better overview of the offerings  \n \nAnyway hope you are well and looking forward to your reply\n\n \nAll the best\n \nPhilip Bank\n\n\nSenior Advisor\n\nUnited Nations Procurement / Sustainability / Foods From Finland\n\n\n\nMobile:         +45 2054 9892\n\nphilip.bank@businessfinland.fi \n\n\n\nTrade Center Copenhagen, Toldbodgade 18, 2.\n\nwww.businessfinland.fi \n\n\n\n\nNewsletter | \n\nTwitter   |  \nLinkedIn  | Instagram |\nYoutube\n|\n\nFacebook",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000GvOUOMA3",
                        EmailAddresses = new List<string> { "marjukka.holopainen-rainio@businessfinland.fi", "harri.kamarainen@gov.fi", "philip.bank@businessfinland.fi", "naimoh@unops.org" },
