                        Subject = "Email: ATACH and WASH",
                        Description = "To: montgomerym@who.int\nCC: umbertov@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: ATACH and WASH\nBody:\nDear Maggie\nGreat to see you on the ATACH call this morning.\nI would love to catch up with you soon on the work UNOPS is doing in the WASH space in so many countries.We already have an MOU with WHO and are collaborating across a number of initiatives.  \nWith the implementation role of UNOPS within the UN mandated in infrastructure, procurement and project management, I would love to hear how we can support WHO more systematically in the WASH area too :) Here is our latest guideline on developing inclusive WASH. \nPlease suggest a time we could meet next week if you have time. I am often at WHO so I can drop by any time!Looking forward to hearing from you\nBest wishesLouise\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
