                        Subject = "Email: Letter to MOH bcc",
                        Description = "To: Noah.Zahrobsky@theglobalfund.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Letter to MOH bcc\nBody:\nDear NoahAs promised, please find attached letter sent to MOH today for your confidential informationPlease let me know if you have any questions in this regardLet's keep in touch best wishes Louise \nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube",
