                        Subject = "Email: Reminder on your inputs and next taskforce meeting",
                        Description = "To: altangerel.choijoo@un.org; ariunaa.chadraabal@un.org; amgalan.ariunbold@fao.org; barkhas.losolsuren@undp.org; benedikt.hofmann@un.org; bpurevsuren@ilo.org; bulgan.luuzandamba@undp.org; kdashdorj@unicef.org; adorjsambuu@unicef.org; long.nguyen@un.org; lkhagvas@unhcr.org; enkhtsetseg.shagdarsuren@un.org; anudari.enkhtur@fao.org; aerdenebaata@iom.int; mohammad.farkhani@itu.int; ganbatb@who.int; M.GUNGAA@unido.org; hyun.jee@unv.org; margaretha.vanderwoude@un.org; jean-philippe.rodde@unctad.org; khishigjargal.kharkhuu@undp.org; battuya@unfpa.org; bilguun@unfpa.org; ma.fideles.sadicon@un.org; toscano-rivalta@un.org; m.sakphouseth@ifad.org; mohammedameers@unops.org; BMUNKHJARGAL@iom.int; tumur-ochir@unfpa.org; nyamjargal.gombo@fao.org; marty@intracen.org; olkhagvasuren@unfpa.org; r.parua@unesco.org; liqingyi@ilo.org; lim6@un.org; Sarah.Knibbs@unwomen.org; bayanbileg@unfpa.org; demberelsurens@who.int; soyolmaa.dolgor@un.org; jigjidpurev.sukhbaatar@fao.org; EnkhAmgalan.Tseelei@fao.org; tsend.ganbaatar@un.org; ji.wang@unesco.org; yasin.janjua@undp.org; ShweY@unaids.org; yujeong.kim@un.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Reminder on your inputs and next taskforce meeting\nBody:\nDear members of the CCA taskforce,\n\n\n\n\n\nThis is a kind reminder on your input for preparing a first draft of the 2024 CCA update.\n\n1) Please share relevant references, if you have, at \nReferences\n\n2) Please share your responsible input draft with me by 30 October.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAs we agreed in the last meeting, we will have the 5th meeting this Thursday (31 October) at 4pm UB time. I will issue an MS Teams meeting invite shortly. \n\nBest regards,\n\n\n\n\n\nSangwon \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSangwon Lim (Mr.) \n\nDevelopment Coordination Officer/Economist  \n\nOffice of the Resident Coordinator\n\n…………………………………………….. \n\nUN House United Nations Street 14 Sukhbaatar District\n\nUlaanbaatar 14201 Mongolia T +976 11 327585  M +976 94114077\nlim6@un