                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: COP29",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-11-11").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: COP29",
                        Description = "To: harmancih@who.int\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: COP29\nBody:\nDear Hande Great to hear from you and thanks for your email.I am free at 5pm your time today - would that work for you?if not perhaps between 12 - 3pm tomorrow your time?Look forward to hearing from youThanks and best wishes Louise\n\n Louise Leech, MPH | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  UNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\nOn Thu, 7 Nov 2024 at 20:10, HARMANCI, Fatos Hande <harmancih@who.int> wrote:\nHi Louise, thank you for reaching out. I am off tomorrow, after 3 consecutive meetings in the past two weeks on duty travel.  Would you be OK to talk in my evening tomorrow? I am in Abu Dhabi now which must be your time +3. \n\nPlease let me know. Otherwise just suggest a date and time please. \n\nBest,\n\nHande",
