                        Subject = "Email: RE: Project 24129.",
                        Description = "To: teresam@unops.org\nCC: torlar@um.dk; artvas@um.dk; vaszal@um.dk; svitlanaz@unops.org; asbjornb@unops.org; arunn@unops.org; simonp@unops.org; marysiaz@unops.org; sungud@um.dk; annkah@um.dk\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: Project 24129.\nBody:\nDear Teresa\n\n\n\nThank again for this comprehensive update. We have discussed this internally and have decided that before intervening as donor, we would like to first see from your side some suggestions on how this conflict could possibly be resolved – i. e. through a revised\n contract or other. An agreement between UNOPS, the CCD and UNOPS’ chosen contractor has to be reached in one way or another, and we find that UNOPS - with your available legal expertise as project manager - is in a better place to develop all options. We stand\n ready to review these as soon as you present them to us. \n \nBest regards,\nJakob\n \n\n\nFrom: Jakob Torrild Hansen\n\n\nSent: 11 November 2024 12:42\n\nTo: 'Teresa MOLERO RODRIGUEZ' <teresam@unops.org>\n\nCc: Svitlana ZAKRYNYTSKA <svitlanaz@unops.org>; Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>; Arun NARAYANAN <arunn@unops.org>; Simon PORTER <simonp@unops.org>; Marysia ZAPASNIK <marysiaz@unops.org>; Sune Hjelmervik Gudnitz <sungud@um.dk>; Anne Kahl <annkah@um.dk>;\n Torben Traustedt Larsen <torlar@um.dk>; Artem Vasalatii <artvas@um.dk>; Vasyl Zalishchuk <vaszal@um.dk>\n\nSubject: RE: Project 24129.\n\n\n \nDear Teresa\n\n\n\nThank you for this summary. I copy my colleagues, we will discuss internally and then revert to you.\n\n \nBest regards,\nJakob Torrild Hansen\n \nJAKOB TORRILD HANSEN /\nJAKHAS@UM.DK\nHEAD OF DANISH EMBASSY OFFICE IN MYKOLAIV\nTEL: +38 096 301 4072 (WHATSAPP, SIGNAL)\n \nROYAL DANISH EMBASSY – MYKOLAIV OFFICE\nLYAHINA 4/54001 MYKOLAIV, UKRAINE\n \n\n \n\n\nFrom: Teresa MOLERO RODRIGUEZ <teresam@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: 11 November 2024 12:25\n\nTo: Jakob Torrild Hansen <jakhas@um.dk>\n\nCc: Svitlana ZAKRYNYTSKA <svitlanaz@un