                new (
                    "00TQx00000I4ootMAB",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Fwd: DG NEAR - RER Study 2024, Project No 392-754, Ref. Ukraine 100 101",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-08-16").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Fwd: DG NEAR - RER Study 2024, Project No 392-754, Ref. Ukraine 100 101",
                        Description = "To: TimL@unops.org\nCC: celiaafricak@unops.org; LaetitiaK@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: DG NEAR - RER Study 2024, Project No 392-754, Ref. Ukraine 100 101\nBody:\nDear Tim,\nAs discussed briefly, I would be grateful if you could share the below message with concerned colleagues in Ukraine to give utmost priority to this request.\nI copy Celia who will be supporting us with FAA related matters (among other things).Pls tell colleagues to reach out to us\nhave a nice weekendCarmenMariacarmen Colitti | Head of Office and Representative | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Brussels, Belgium | Tel: + 32 2 7881840| www.unops.org Keep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube. \nSubscribe to our external newsletter in English, French or Spanish. \n\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Daria Moseeva <Daria.Moseeva@bdo.co.uk>\nDate: Wed, Aug 14, 2024 at 6:06 PM\nSubject: DG NEAR - RER Study 2024, Project No 392-754, Ref. Ukraine 100 101\nTo: Laetitia KRAUS <laetitiak@unops.org>\nCc: mariacarmenco@unops.org <mariacarmenco@unops.org>, RERstudy-DGNEAR <RERstudy-DGNEAR@bdo.co.uk>, Mila Nikolova <Mila.Nikolova@bdo.co.uk>, PETROU Petros (NEAR) <Petros.PETROU@ec.europa.eu>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Laetitia,\n \nI am pleased to be in touch again, this time in relation to 2024 RER Study. As part of the 2024 Residual Error Rate (RER) exercise, we are reviewing\n the contract 392-754 - “Support for Rate of Law Reforms in Ukraine - Police, Public Prosecution and Good Governance (PRAVO-PPG)”.\n \nThe RER exercise involves a review of contracts which have been recently closed in the EC information system. Contract 392-754 has been selected\n as part of this review.\n \nIn order to complete our review of this contract, we would be most grateful if you could send us:\n\nFinal Financial Report submitted to the EU;Corresponding transaction listing (in Excel format and showing a mapping by budget line);\nFinal Narrative Report submitted to the EU;Details/Calculations for the FX rates used (if applicable);Reports of any prior audit verifications which might have been undertaken with respect of this contract.\n \nFrom this transaction listing we shall select a sample of expenditure to test to supporting documentation.\n\n \nIf you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact me.\n \nBest regards,\nDaria\n\n \n \nDARIA MOSEEVA\nInternational Institutions & Donor Assurance\n+44 (0)743 640 6691 (Mobile)\ndaria.moseeva@bdo.co.uk\n(Working Mon-Fri 09.30-17.30)\nPreferred Pronouns: she, her\n \nFor and on behalf of BDO LLP\n55 Baker Street\nLondon W1U 7EU\nUNITED KINGDOM\n+44 (0)20 7486 5888\nwww.bdo.co.uk\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\tIDEAS |\n\t\n\tPEOPLE |\n\t\n\tTRUST.\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\tFollow us on X, LinkedIn and Instagram. Find out more about us. \n\n\t\n\t\n\tBDO LLP, a UK limited liability partnership registered in England and Wales under number OC305127, is a member of BDO International Limited, a UK company limited by guarantee, and forms part of the international BDO network of independent member firms. A list of members' names is open to inspection at our registered office, 55 Baker Street, London W1U 7EU. BDO LLP is authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority to conduct investment business. BDO is the brand name for the BDO network and for each of the BDO Member Firms. This email (including any attachments) is confidential, protected by copyright and may be privileged. It is for the exclusive use of the intended recipient(s). If you have received it in error, please notify the sender immediately by emailing a response before deleting the email completely from your computer, and note that any storage, copying or dissemination is prohibited. Where the content of this email is personal or otherwise unconnected with the firm or our clients' business, we accept no responsibility or liability for such content. We accept no responsibility for viruses that we may have unintentionally transmitted to you within this email and you should check for viruses before opening any attachment. Those communicating with us by email will be deemed to have consented to us intercepting and monitoring those communications. Read our privacy statement for more information.\n\nAccountants and Business Advisers © 2024 BDO LLP. All rights reserved.",
