                    {
                        Name = "Email: Event on procurement within the Codeway Fair",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-04-22").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Event on procurement within the Codeway Fair",
                        Description = "To: D.BATTAGGIA@unido.org\nCC: mariagabriella.riso@esteri.it; chiara.musella@esteri.it; A.CARAPELLESE@unido.org; V.MALTESE@unido.org; JeromeDT@unops.org; mariacarmenco@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Event on procurement within the Codeway Fair\nBody:\nDear Mrs Battaggia,\n \nthank you very much for your patience.\n\n \nAs previously discussed, in partnership with the United Nations Office for Project Services (UNOPS), I am pleased to confirm our interest for UNIDO’s\n participation in an event dedicated to the procurement of the United Nations and of Multilateral Development Banks (MDBs), to be held at the Rome Fair (Fiera di Roma) on the morning of May 15th (find attached the latest draft program – the final one is not\n expected to differ much). The event will take place in the context of the Codeway Expo Fair, dedicated to the promotion of Development Cooperation opportunities towards the private sector.\n \nThe event aims to give a space to UNIDO – together with other UN agencies and MDBs - to present its procurement opportunities to the audience of Italian\n companies attending the Fair, with the aim of increasing participation to their tender procedures, whether open or limited.\n \nOn the basis of the attached programme, we therefore hope for your kind intervention in a panel discussion with other UN agencies, where you could\n present your procurement needs and trends. This would be followed, in the early afternoon, by meetings with a selected audience of companies that could be directly interested in a dialogue with UNIDO.\n\n \nI thank you sincerely for a kind RSVP to the event (mariagabriella.riso@esteri.it), indicating the\n name of the main participant as well as - if possible and in order to better complement your attendance - the sectors in which UNIDO could potentially be interested in a stronger involvement of Italian companies.\n\n \nKind regards,\n \nFilippo\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \nFilippo Lonardo\nCounsellor\nDeputy Head - Unit for finance for development, environment, digital\nDirection general for development cooperation\n\nMinistry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000J1lgLMAR",
                        EmailAddresses = new List<string> { "d.battaggia@unido.org", "mariacarmenco@unops.org", "chiara.musella@esteri.it", "jeromedt@unops.org", "a.carapellese@unido.org", "mariagabriella.riso@esteri.it", "v.maltese@unido.org" },
                        Status = (EntityStatus)1,
                        CreatedBy = paoUserEmailMapping.ContainsKey("jeromedt@unops.org".ToLower()) ? paoUserEmailMapping["jeromedt@unops.org".ToLower()] : 0,
                        CreatedDate = new DateTime(2024, 12, 9, 11, 3, 49, DateTimeKind.Utc),
                        LastModifiedBy = 0,
                        LastModifiedDate = DateTime.UtcNow,
                        IsDeleted = false,
                        DeletedBy = 0
                    },
                    new List<string> { "003Qx00000KFPdvIAH" },
                    new List<int> { 1266 },
                    new List<string> { "jeromedt@unops.org" },
                    new List<string> { "B0047" }
                ),
                new (
                    "00TQx00000J1mZBMAZ",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: R: programma 15 maggio",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2024-05-14").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: R: programma 15 maggio",
                        Description = "To: m.zaurrini@internationalia.org\nCC: b.prevete@ice.it; isabella.ambroglini@gmail.com; l.ridori@fieraroma.it; ceciliamoretti@gmail.com; w.boccali@gmail.com; p.nuosci@fieraroma.it; condesign.ludovicaconte@gmail.com; a.scarpa@ice.it; g.nicchia@ice.it; e.dartibale.int@ice.it; carlo.batori@esteri.it; jeromedt@unops.org; mariacarmenco@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: R: programma 15 maggio\nBody:\nHello Massimo and everyone,\n \nthe UN procurement has cross-cutting themes and similar tricks of the trade among its agencies. Anne-Claire’s specific intervention\n is therefore extremely useful for Italian enterprises to acquire knowledge of the UN system; this was clear from the beginning. Unfortunately Marcus cannot come, but that also allows us to have a more gendered balance event even, which is not bad. Of course,\n I strongly encourage all to work together to find suitable solutions to make everyone reasonably satisfied. I am (as I have always been) just a phone call away (+39 353 429 4959).\n \nKind regards,\n \nFilippo\n \n \n \nDa: Massimo Zaurrini <m.zaurrini@internationalia.org>\n\n\nInviato: martedì 14 maggio 2024 10:22\n\nA: Lonardo Filippo <filippo.lonardo@esteri.it>\n\nCc: Prevete Bernard <b.prevete@ice.it>; Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <jeromedt@unops.org>; Isabella Ambroglini <isabella.ambroglini@gmail.com>; Luisa Ridori <l.ridori@fieraroma.it>; Cecilia Moretti <ceciliamoretti@gmail.com>; wladimiro boccali <w.boccali@gmail.com>;\n Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org>; Paola Nuosci <p.nuosci@fieraroma.it>; Ludovica Conte CONDESIGN <condesign.ludovicaconte@gmail.com>; Amedeo Scarpa <a.scarpa@ice.it>; Giulia Nicchia <g.nicchia@ice.it>; Elisa D'Artibale <e.dartibale.int@ice.it>\n\nOggetto: Re: programma 15 maggio\n \n \n\n\n\n\nMITTENTE ESTERNO. Prestare attenzione nell'apertura di eventuali link e/o allegati.\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nDear all,\n\nThank you for the draft agenda and the sequence outlined. However, I believe we need a more balanced distribution of speaking times. Assuming the introductory remarks conclude by 10:30 AM, I suggest\n dividing the remaining time as follows:\n\nFrom 10:30 AM to 11:45 AM or 12:00 PM at the latest - UNOPS and UN segment From 11:45 AM/12:00 PM to 1:30 PM at the latest - ICE and MDBs segment\n\nThis arrangement allocates 90 minutes for each segment, with 8 speakers per segment. Given that both UNOPS and ICE have made significant efforts to bring a distinguished panel of speakers to Codeway,\n which holds substantial interest for the companies involved, it seems only fair to provide equal time to both groups. What do you think?\n\nThanks Massimo Zaurrini\n\n\n\n\n \n\n-- \n\n\n\n\n\nInternationalia S.r.l.\n\n\n\nVia Conca d'Oro 206\n\n\n00141 Roma\n\n\n\nwww.internationalia.org\n\n\nwww.africaeaffari.it\n\n\nwww.infoafrica.it\n\n\nTel. +39 068860492; +39 0692956629\n\n\nMob.: +39 3939227770\n\n\nFax +39 0692933897\n\n\nEmail: info@infoafrica.it, m.zaurrini@internationalia.org \n\n\nskype:massimozaurrini\n\n\nFacebook, Linkedin: Massimo Zaurrini\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nIl giorno lun 13 mag 2024 alle ore 20:24 Lonardo Filippo <filippo.lonardo@esteri.it> ha scritto:\n\n\n\n\n\nHello again,\n \nkindly find a version of the program which includes a run of show, for internal purposes\n (please do notify if anything does not work for you).\n\n\nFilippo\n \n\n\nDa: Lonardo Filippo\n\n\nInviato: lunedì 13 maggio 2024 18:55\n\nA: 'Prevete Bernard' <b.prevete@ice.it>; 'Jerome DE THYSEBAERT' <jeromedt@unops.org>; 'Isabella Ambroglini' <isabella.ambroglini@gmail.com>;\n 'Luisa Ridori' <l.ridori@fieraroma.it>; 'Cecilia Moretti' <ceciliamoretti@gmail.com>; 'wladimiro boccali' <w.boccali@gmail.com>;\n 'm.zaurrini' <m.zaurrini@internationalia.org>; 'Mariacarmen COLITTI' <mariacarmenco@unops.org>; 'Paola Nuosci' <p.nuosci@fieraroma.it>;\n 'Ludovica Conte CONDESIGN' <condesign.ludovicaconte@gmail.com>\n\nCc: 'Amedeo Scarpa' <a.scarpa@ice.it>; 'Giulia Nicchia' <g.nicchia@ice.it>; 'Elisa D'Artibale' <e.dartibale.int@ice.it>\n\nOggetto: R: programma 15 maggio\n\n\n \n(of course you cut the three speakers UN panel by 10 minutes in order to increase to 70\n minutes the MDBs panel). \n \n\n\nDa: Lonardo Filippo\n\n\nInviato: lunedì 13 maggio 2024 18:53\n\nA: 'Prevete Bernard' <b.prevete@ice.it>; Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <jeromedt@unops.org>; Isabella Ambroglini <isabella.ambroglini@gmail.com>;\n Luisa Ridori <l.ridori@fieraroma.it>; Cecilia Moretti <ceciliamoretti@gmail.com>; wladimiro boccali <w.boccali@gmail.com>;\n m.zaurrini <m.zaurrini@internationalia.org>; Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org>; Paola Nuosci <p.nuosci@fieraroma.it>;\n Ludovica Conte CONDESIGN <condesign.ludovicaconte@gmail.com>\n\nCc: Amedeo Scarpa <a.scarpa@ice.it>; Giulia Nicchia <g.nicchia@ice.it>; Elisa D'Artibale <e.dartibale.int@ice.it>\n\nOggetto: R: programma 15 maggio\n\n\n \nHello everyone,\n\n \nand thank you again for the time dedicated for the organization of this important event.\n\n \nDino, look, for me the surprise is that the website is wrong. In the attached email, for\n instance, there was the version we had discussed in our general meeting, where we had a time-slot specifically dedicated to UNOPS presentation on UN procurement. The speaker was then Marcus McKay, but Marcus unfortunately can’t be there for personal reasons,\n so Anne-Claire will have to take his place. The Ministry never agreed on cutting out Marcus’ speech – which is the true surprise as far as I am concerned.\n\n \nHowever, all in all I absolutely agree with you; therefore, in order to have a conservative\n approach I propose to cut by 10 minutes the first UN Panel, as it has three speakers. This way we can guarantee that\neach speaker, regardless being UN or MDBs, has 10 minutes. \n\n\nI hope this sounds reasonable.\n \nThank you very much. Kind regards,\n \nFilippo\n \n \n \nDa: Prevete Bernard <b.prevete@ice.it>\n\n\nInviato: lunedì 13 maggio 2024 18:15\n\nA: Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <jeromedt@unops.org>; Isabella Ambroglini <isabella.ambroglini@gmail.com>; Luisa Ridori <l.ridori@fieraroma.it>;\n Lonardo Filippo <filippo.lonardo@esteri.it>; Cecilia Moretti <ceciliamoretti@gmail.com>; wladimiro boccali <w.boccali@gmail.com>;\n m.zaurrini <m.zaurrini@internationalia.org>; Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org>; Paola Nuosci <p.nuosci@fieraroma.it>;\n Ludovica Conte CONDESIGN <condesign.ludovicaconte@gmail.com>\n\nCc: Amedeo Scarpa <a.scarpa@ice.it>; Giulia Nicchia <g.nicchia@ice.it>; Elisa D'Artibale <e.dartibale.int@ice.it>\n\nOggetto: Re: programma 15 maggio\n \n \n\n\n\n\nMITTENTE ESTERNO. Prestare attenzione nell'apertura di eventuali link e/o allegati.\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nDear all,\n\n\n \n\n\nwe also noticed the same misalignment as Jerome. We're assuming the agenda on the website is the official Agenda and, as such, it has been confirmed and communicated to all the\n speakers and the registered guests. \n\n\n\nAs previously notified, the attached agenda in our view presents some serious timeslot misallocations.  For example, it's hard to understand why one panel that has a single speaker (Anne-Claire Howard, Director of Procurement Group, UNOPS) has been allocated\n a timeslot of almost an entire hour (10.30 - 11.20) while a panel with 8 speakers (the MDB's panel) has been squeezed at the end of the morning in 60 minutes where speakers will have roughly 7 minutes each. \n\n\n \n\n\nThese MDB speakers (like others) are flying in from the four corners of the world and it's sad to see their panel kicked down to the very end of the morning (when people are heading\n to lunch) squeezed in such a narrow timeslot. Even more so when you consider they were the first to confirm their participation over two months ago.\n\n\n\n\nTherefore we really hope there will be no last-minute surprises and that we're all sticking to the official agenda published on the website as of today.\n\n\n \n\n\nthank you\n\n\nBernard\n\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n\nBernard Prevete\n\nDirezione Centrale Rete Estera\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nT. \n+39 5992 6981\n\nT. +39 349 3142 252\n\n\nb.prevete@ice.it\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n\nIl giorno lun 13 mag 2024 alle ore 10:09 Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <jeromedt@unops.org> ha scritto:\n\n\n\nDear all,\n\n \n\n\nI noticed that the\nagenda on the website still isn't aligned with the latest version of the programme shared by Filippo. For example, the panel conversations with UN speakers are foreseen at 11.20-12.00\n and 12.00-12.40 (vs 11.00 and 11.40 on the website). \n\n\n \n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\nJérôme\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJérôme de Thysebaert\n| Senior Communications and Liaison Associate | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Tel: + 32 (0) 499 197 497 |\nwww.unops.org\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube. Subscribe\n to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench or\nSpanish. \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Wed, May 8, 2024 at 4:20 PM Lonardo Filippo <filippo.lonardo@esteri.it> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nHello everyone, please find attached the last version of the programme that I took track\n of.\n \nKind regards,\n \nFIlippo\n\n \nDa: Isabella Ambroglini <isabella.ambroglini@gmail.com>\n\n\nInviato: mercoledì 8 maggio 2024 16:12\n\nA: Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <jeromedt@unops.org>\n\nCc: Luisa Ridori <l.ridori@fieraroma.it>; Lonardo Filippo <filippo.lonardo@esteri.it>; m.zaurrini <m.zaurrini@internationalia.org>;\n wladimiro boccali <w.boccali@gmail.com>; Paola Nuosci <p.nuosci@fieraroma.it>; Mariacarmen COLITTI <mariacarmenco@unops.org>;\n Prevete Bernard <b.prevete@ice.it> (b.prevete@ice.it) <b.prevete@ice.it>; Cecilia Moretti <ceciliamoretti@gmail.com>;\n Ludovica Conte CONDESIGN <condesign.ludovicaconte@gmail.com>\n\nOggetto: Re: programma 15 maggio\n \n \n\n\n\n\nMITTENTE ESTERNO. Prestare attenzione nell'apertura di eventuali link e/o allegati.\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Jerome and all,\n\n\nmany thanks for your prompt reply and the update on the program with the modifications that we have immediately implemented.\n\n\n \n\n\nRegarding the B2B opportunities of the UN agencies, we have organized a special B2B and networking area, with a welcome\n lounge and coffee corner, with tables to host the separate one-to-one B2B meetings. The area is conveniently located close to the Plenary Hall.\n\n\n \n\n\nWe would be happy to count on the availability of the Representatives of the Agency, for a slot of let's say two hours\n each,  to host the meetings,  of 20 min each.\n\n\nWe can assign the UN Organization a dedicated table, the time frame could be the afternoon of 15 May, from 15.00 to 17.00\n Hrs.\n\n\n \n\n\nWe are holding the MDBs meetings in the same area, in the same place, according to similar timing.  The place also has\n a dedicated reception, assisting staff with languages available.\n\n\n \n\n\nI hope the above is satisfactory, please do not hesitate to contact me for any further information.\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nIsabella Ambroglini  - Sales & Networking \n\nFiera Roma Srl\n\n\nMob +39 333 8260306 \n\n\nisabella.ambroglini@gmail.com\n\n\ninfo@codewayexpo.com\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nIl giorno mer 8 mag 2024 alle ore 14:17 Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <jeromedt@unops.org> ha scritto:\n\n\n\n\nDear Isabella,\n\n\n \n\n\nCould you please send us a message with more details on what you propose in terms of logistics and I will be happy to share it with all the UN agencies for their consideration.\n\n\n \n\n\nKindly note the final composition of the panels moderated by Mariacarmen Colitti. We'd be grateful if you could update the website accordingly.\n\n\n \n\n\nPANEL CONVERSATION ON SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT\n\no\nAtsushi ISOYAMA,\nUNIDO, Chief, Procurement Services\n\no\nGulgun Sahin, UNDP Rome Centre, Head of operations and procurement\n\no\nSilvia Uneddu, UNICEF, Senior Contracts Manager\n \nPANEL CONVERSATION ON FOOD/HUMANITARIAN\n\no\nFabrizio Bertora, UNHCR, Head of Procurement\n\no\nIulon Tsilosani,\nWFP, Lead Supplier Relationship Management\n\no\nVladimir Maslarov, IOM, Senior Procurement Officer, Supply Chain Division\n\no\nFrancesco Perini,\nFAO,\nProcurement Officer,  Emergency Responses\n\n\n\n \n\n\nKind regards,\n\n\nJérôme\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJérôme de Thysebaert\n| Senior Communications and Liaison Associate | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Tel: + 32 (0) 499 197 497 |\nwww.unops.org\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube. Subscribe\n to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench or\nSpanish. \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Wed, May 8, 2024 at 8:32 AM Isabella Ambroglini <isabella.ambroglini@gmail.com> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Jerome,\n\n\nwe would like to request your help and advice to make the Procurement event more effective and engaging for our exhibitors.\n\n\nAs the MDBs have given availability to hold B2B one-to-one meetings after the pitch. Can we organize the same with other\n UN Agencies? \n\n\nWe are well organized to do so.\n\n\nPlease let us know. \n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nIsabella Ambroglini  - Sales & Networking \n\nFiera Roma Srl\n\n\nMob +39 333 8260306 \n\n\nisabella.ambroglini@gmail.com\n\n\ninfo@codewayexpo.com\n\n\ninfo@blueplaneteconomy.it\n\n\nisabella.ambroglini@nseexpoforum.com\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nIl giorno mar 7 mag 2024 alle ore 11:52 Isabella Ambroglini <isabella.ambroglini@gmail.com> ha scritto:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Jerome,\n\n\nthank you for your email.\n\n\n \n\n\nRegarding the question on the SOCIAL communication, I put you in contact with :\n\n\n \n\n\nCecilia Moretti - Our press officer\n\n\nLudovica Conte - Graphics and social media\n\n\n \n\n\nThey will send you all the available materials, cards etc. our promotion tools ready for use.\n\n\n \n\n\nRegarding the conference, yes we will have photo service for the panelists participating, streaming will not be available,\n the sessions will be recorded.\n\n\n \n\n\nPlease do not hesitate to contact me should you have any questions or need for assistance.\n\n\n \n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nIsabella Ambroglini  - Sales & Networking \n\nFiera Roma Srl\n\n\nMob +39 333 8260306 \n\n\nisabella.ambroglini@gmail.com\n\n\ninfo@codewayexpo.com\n\n\ninfo@blueplaneteconomy.it\n\n\nisabella.ambroglini@nseexpoforum.com\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nIl giorno mar 7 mag 2024 alle ore 09:07 Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <jeromedt@unops.org> ha scritto:\n\n\n\nDear Isabella,\n\n \n\n\nThank you for sharing the guidance.\n\n\n \n\n\nDo you have any social media packages or comms guidance for speakers (social media cards, tags, etc.)\n\n\n \n\n\nCan you please confirm if someone will take pictures of the panelists and if the session will be recorded or streamed live?\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you in advance.\n\n\n \n\n\nKind regards,\n\n\nJérôme\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nJérôme de Thysebaert\n| Senior Communications and Liaison Associate | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Tel: + 32 (0) 499 197 497 |\nwww.unops.org\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube. Subscribe\n to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench or\nSpanish. \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Fri, May 3, 2024 at 6:19 PM Isabella Ambroglini <isabella.ambroglini@gmail.com> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Jerome and all,\n\n\nPls find attached the program with your amendments for our website.\n\n\nI copy below the standard information we generally provide to our speakers.\n\n\nPlease consider this is our standard, should you need specific info and arrangements to coordinate your speakers, please\n let me know.\n\n\nBest regards, \n\n\nIsabella Ambroglini \n\n\n+39 333 8260306\n\n\ninfo@codewayexpo.com\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n===================\n\n\n \n\n\n\nCODEWAY EXPO 2024  \n\nUSEFUL INFORMATION FOR CONFERENCE SPEAKERS AND GUESTS\n\n \n\nDear Speaker, \n\nthank you for your confirmation to participate in the CODEWAY EXPO 2024 Conference Program.\n\n \n\nWe would like to confirm that the Updated Program of the Activities that will be carried out during our Exhibition is available online, in English and Italian, at the link below:\n\nhttps://www.codewayexpo.com/en/programma-maggio/\n\n \n\nThe conference rooms, the exhibition secretariat and registration area are located within Hall 8 – Padiglione 8\n\n \n\nACCESS TO THE VENUE:\n\nAs Speaker, you may access by car from EAST GATE – Cargo Est (Via Alexander Eiffel), your name will appear in the dedicated accreditation list.\n\nPedestrians may access with FREE shuttle bus service connecting FIERA ROMA train station, Fiera Roma North Parking, Hall 8 Entrance, and signage on site.\n\n \n\nPedestrian Access from North Gate – Cargo Nord, Via Portuense 1645, ROME is also permitted.\n\n \n\nSPEAKER BADGE COLLECTION:\n\nYou can collect your BADGE at REGISTRATION DESK on arrival at HALL 8.\n\n \n\nShould you be accompanied by other guests please make sure they register in advance to access. Registration in ENG is available at the following link, with registration they receive their own PDF badge,\n following the instructions given:\n\nhttps://survey.fieraroma.it/execute/survey?surveyID=codeway2024&action=start&lang=en\n\n \n\nAdditional Visitor Information is available at the following link:\n\nhttps://www.codewayexpo.com/en/v-edizione-visitatori/\n\n \n\nPlease do not hesitate to contact us should you require further assistance.\n\n \n\nThe Exhibition Secretariat \n\ninfo@codewayexpo.com\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nIsabella Ambroglini  - Sales & Networking \n\nFiera Roma Srl\n\n\nMob +39 333 8260306 \n\n\nisabella.ambroglini@gmail.com\n\n\ninfo@codewayexpo.com\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPrivo di virus.www.avast.com\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nIl giorno ven 3 mag 2024 alle ore 16:21 Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <jeromedt@unops.org> ha scritto:\n\n\n\n\nDear all,\n\n \n\n\nPlease find the updated concept note and agenda with additional panelists confirmed.\n\n\n \n\n\nCould you kindly update the programme on CODEWAY website accordingly?\n\n\n \n\n\nI will share early next week the pictures of the UN speakers.\n\n\n \n\n\nCould you kindly confirm if there is any logistic guidance we have to share with the speakers ?\n\n\n \n\n\nPlease let me know if you need anything else from my side.\n\n\n \n\n\nKind regards,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJérôme de Thysebaert\n| Senior Communications and Liaison Associate | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Tel: + 32 (0) 499 197 497 |\nwww.unops.org\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube. Subscribe\n to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench or\nSpanish. \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Thu, May 2, 2024 at 4:23 PM Isabella Ambroglini <isabella.ambroglini@gmail.com> wrote:\n\n\n\n\nDear Jerome and all,\n\n\nNoted your amendments, please find attached the word file.\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\n\n\nIsabella Ambroglini  - Sales & Networking \n\nFiera Roma Srl\n\n\nMob +39 333 8260306 \n\n\nisabella.ambroglini@gmail.com\n\n\ninfo@codewayexpo.com\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPrivo di virus.www.avast.com\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nIl giorno gio 2 mag 2024 alle ore 16:03 Jerome DE THYSEBAERT <jeromedt@unops.org> ha scritto:\n\n\n\nHello,\n\n \n\n\nKindly note that the keynote presentation at 10:45\n\"Unlocking the potential of the private sector in driving development: UN sustainable procurement\" will be made by Anne-Claire Howard, Director of Procurement Group, UNOPS\n\n\n \n\n\nUnfortunately Marcus Mc Kay won't be able to attend.\n\n\n \n\n\nPlease find attached as well the draft concept note of the UN segment.\n\n\n \n\n\nKind regards,\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJérôme de Thysebaert\n| Senior Communications and Liaison Associate | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Tel: + 32 (0) 499 197 497 |\nwww.unops.org\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube. Subscribe\n to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench or\nSpanish. \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Thu, May 2, 2024 at 3:59 PM Luisa Ridori <l.ridori@fieraroma.it> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear all,\nPlease find attached the program of the OPENING SESSION of MAY 15 revised according to your indications.\nWe will send you today our logistic information (Nota Logistica) for your reference.\nWe remain at your disposal for any clarification and/or modification.\nBest regards,\nL.\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLuisa Ridori\n\n\n\n\n\nExhibition Manager\n\n\nFiera Roma S.r.l. con Socio Unico\n\nVia Portuense 1645/1647, 00148 Roma (RM)\n\nTel: +39 06 65074 590 - Fax: +39 06 65074 461 \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\nLe informazioni contenute nella presente comunicazione e i relativi allegati possono essere riservate\n e sono, comunque, destinate esclusivamente alle persone o alla Società sopraindicati.La diffusione, distribuzione e/o copiatura del documento trasmesso da parte di qualsiasi soggetto diverso dal destinatario è proibita, sia ai sensi dell’art. 616 c.p., che\n ai sensi del D.Lgs. n. 196/2003. Se avete ricevuto questo messaggio per errore, vi preghiamo di distruggerlo e di informarci inviando immediatamente un messaggio al mittente.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe information contained in this e-mail and any files transmitted with it is confidential and intended\n for the addressee only. Its contents are private and confidential and should not be read, copied or disclosed by any other person, in according to of art. the 616 c.p., than according to of the D.Lgs n. 196/2003.If you have received this e-mail in error please\n notify the originator and destroy it\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDa: Jerome DE THYSEBAERT [mailto:jeromedt@unops.org]\n\n\nInviato: giovedì 2 maggio 2024 12:36\n\nA: Lonardo Filippo\n\nCc: Luisa Ridori; m.zaurrini; wladimiro boccali; Paola Nuosci; Mariacarmen COLITTI\n\nOggetto: Re: programma 15 maggio\n \n\n\n\nDear all,\n\n\n \n\n\nPlease find below an update on the UN speakers.\n\n\n \n\n\nAre there any practical guidelines for logistics that we may share with our speakers (eg: where to pick up their ticket, etc.) ?  We have coordination calls tomorrow for both panels\n and will be in touch ASAP when the last panelists are confirmed.\n\n\n \n\n\nCould you kindly also confirm if the panels will be broadcasted live or recorded?\n\n\n \n\n\nThank you in advance.\n\n\nBest regards,\n\n\nJérôme\n\n\n--\n\n\n \n\n11:20 – 12:00: Panel conversation on UN agencies needs and emerging procurement trends with a focus on sustainable development - Moderation by Mariacarmen Colitti, Representative\n to the European Union, UNOPS\n\n\nIOM: Vladimir Maslarov, Senior Procurement Officer, Supply Chain Division -\nvmaslarov@iom.int \nUNDP:  Agostino Inguscio, Coordinator of the UNDP Rome Centre - \nagostino.inguscio@undp.org \nUNICEF: tbc\nUNOPS: Anne-Claire Howard, Director Procurement Group, UNOPS - anneclaireh@unops.org\n\n\n\n12:00 – 12:40: Panel conversation on UN agencies needs and emerging procurement trends with a focus on  food/humanitarian  - Moderation by Mariacarmen Colitti, Representative to the European Union, UNOPS\n\n\nUNHCR: Fabrizio Bertora, Head of Procurement - \nBERTORA@unhcr.org\nWFP: Iulon Tsilosani - Lead, Supplier Relationship Management Unit -\niulon.tsilosani@wfp.org\nFAO: tbc (suggested an Officer who is expert in dealing with procurement in complex emergencies)\n\n \n\n\nFor IFAD, they have not confirmed any speaker as far as I'm aware, it would indeed be for the MDB session.\n\n\n \n\n\n--\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nJérôme de Thysebaert\n| Senior Communications and Liaison Associate | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Brussels Liaison Office | Tel: + 32 (0) 499 197 497 |\nwww.unops.org\nKeep up-to-date with UNOPS. Follow us on\nFacebook,\nLinkedIn,\nTwitter,\nInstagram,\nYouTube. Subscribe\n to our external newsletter in English,\nFrench or\nSpanish. \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Thu, May 2, 2024 at 11:10 AM Lonardo Filippo <filippo.lonardo@esteri.it> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nCara Luisa,\n \noggi faccio un passaggio per Carl Skau.\n \nWith regards to IFAD and all other speakers from UN Agencies (although IFAD will go to the\n MDBs section), maybe Jerome or Maria Carmen could sum that up the confirmed speakers?\n \nKind regards,\n \nFilippo\n \n \n \n\n\nDa: Luisa Ridori <l.ridori@fieraroma.it>\n\n\nInviato: giovedì 2 maggio 2024 09:20\n\nA: Lonardo Filippo <filippo.lonardo@esteri.it>\n\nCc: m.zaurrini <m.zaurrini@internationalia.org>; wladimiro boccali <w.boccali@gmail.com>; Paola Nuosci <p.nuosci@fieraroma.it>\n\nOggetto: R: programma 15 maggio\n\n\n \n \n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100.0%;background:#FFFF99;border:solid red",
