                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-01-14").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Fwd: Road Safety Retreat Outcome Document for Review by 15 January 2025",
                        Description = "To: oscarm@unops.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Fwd: Road Safety Retreat Outcome Document for Review by 15 January 2025\nBody:\nThis is the last thing I received L\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: ECE-Jean-Todt-Road-Safety-Envoy <jeantodt.roadsafetyenvoy@un.org>\nDate: Wed, 18 Dec 2024 at 15:21\nSubject: Road Safety Retreat Outcome Document for Review by 15 January 2025\nTo: ECE-Jean-Todt-Road-Safety-Envoy <jeantodt.roadsafetyenvoy@un.org>\nCc: ECE-Jean-Todt-Road-Safety-Envoy <jeantodt.roadsafetyenvoy@un.org>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Road Safety Retreat participants,\n \nWe express our sincere gratitude for contributing to the 2nd United Nations Road Safety Retreat, hosted by the Office of the United Nations Secretary-General’s Special Envoy for Road Safety, Mr. Jean Todt.\n \nPlease find attached a draft of the two-page Road Map 2025 as an outcome, incorporating top lines from discussions.\n\n \nWe would be grateful for your review - short (one sentence max) and serve for informal coordination. We would appreciate any input/edits\nin track changes directly in the document by Wed, 15 January 2025.\n \nOnce finalized, we will distribute the Road Map 2025 to all retreat participants, along with supporting materials and to those who were invited but could not attend.\nWarm regards,\n\n\n\nSecretariat of the Road Safety Special Envoy\n\njeantodt.roadsafetyenvoy@un.org",
