                        Subject = "Email: Overview of UNOPS reforms",
                        Description = "To: Agnes.Annells@fcdo.gov.uk; Sally.Clifford@fcdo.gov.uk\nCC: naimoh@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Overview of UNOPS reforms\nBody:\nDear Agnes and Sally,\nI hope this email finds you well after a long week in NYC with the Executive Board. \nIn case you did not already see it, I wanted to flag to you that we have recently published an easy to read overview of the comprehensive reforms that we have undergone at UNOPS for the past 3 years. The publication contains interviews with the two Executive Directors that have been steering the transformation process as well as overviews of the 100+ management reform actions that have been implemented. You can find the publication on UNOPS' website here. \nWishing you a great weekend ahead!\nAll the best,Asbjørn\n-- \n\nAsbjørn Brink| Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 40 80 36 54 | Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org",
