                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-02-04").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Potential projects in Gaza",
                        Description = "To: roger.m.karlsson@gov.se; Katarina.Zinn@sida.se\nCC: naimoh@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Potential projects in Gaza\nBody:\nDear Katarina and Roger,I hope that you had good and productive meetings in NYC last week and are now back without too much jetlag. I am writing to you to initiate a dialogue about potential projects in Gaza. I hope that you might be able to connect me with your colleagues dealing with Sweden's interventions in Gaza? As you know, the situation in Gaza remains dire, with ongoing humanitarian needs and a fragile security situation. There is a massive and urgent need for humanitarian aid. At UNOPS we are currently exploring several projects that directly address these needs and might be in the interest of Sweden, including:Strengthening the Electricity Supply System: This project aims to improve living conditions and address interrupted critical and essential services for the most affected Palestinians in Gaza by reconstructing and strengthening the electricity supply system with renewable energy. This aligns with Sweden's commitment to promoting sustainable development and improving living conditions in Gaza.Safe Rubble Removal and Recycling: This project focuses on clearing away war debris, a critical prerequisite for early recovery and reconstruction interventions, and the provision of essential services in Gaza. This project aligns with Sweden's commitment to supporting reconstruction and recovery efforts in Gaza and promoting a safe and secure environment.Humanitarian Fuel for Gaza Project: This project aims to procure and deliver fuel to Gaza in support of humanitarian operations and essential services. This aligns with Sweden's commitment to supporting humanitarian relief efforts in Gaza and ensuring access to essential services for the most vulnerable populations.I have attached a brief overview of these potential projects for your review. All of them are scalable. We believe these projects have the potential to make a significant impact on the lives of the Palestinian people in Gaza while aligning with Swedish objectives.We would be grateful for the opportunity to discuss these projects further and explore potential support. Please let me know if you or your relevant colleagues would be  available for a call in the coming weeks.Thank you for your time and consideration.All the best,\nAsbjørn\n-- \n\nAsbjørn Brink| Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 40 80 36 54 | Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000LAMXrMAP",
                        EmailAddresses = new List<string> { "roger.m.karlsson@gov.se", "naimoh@unops.org", "katarina.zinn@sida.se" },
                        Status = (EntityStatus)1,
