                new (
                    "00TQx00000MUv7eMAD",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Madagascar - Global Fund CCM and Gavi",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-03-11").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Madagascar - Global Fund CCM and Gavi",
                        Description = "To: djibrillama@unops.org; malalaf@unops.org\nCC: tatianaw@unops.org; fionam@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Madagascar - Global Fund CCM and Gavi\nBody:\nDear team!\nAgain, great to speak with you yesterday.  I just had a call with Miriam Faid, Gavi Senior Country Manager for Madagascar (and Comores).\nI updated her on some of the work you are doing and she confirmed she and her team will be carrying out a monitoring mission from 28 April to 6 May and she would very much like to meet you.She mentioned that UNICEF has been doing solarisation of health care facilities and was interested to learn more about the collaboration. She also mentioned challenges getting procured items out of the Port for onward transportation and delivery. \nI will set up a call so we can e-meet Miriam before the country mission. They are working on the programme now, so the timing is good :) There will also be a bigger mission in September / October, including implementing partners, to review successes and challenges to date - it would be great if you end up getting involved in that too.\nLet's keep in touch and I will revert with a couple of meeting times soon.\nThanks and best wishesLouise \n\nOn Mon, 10 Mar 2025 at 14:46, Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org> wrote:\nDear Djibrilla and Malala\nAs promised please find here the information on your local Global Fund Country Coordinating Mechanism (CCM) in case you wish to contact them directly, with a view to expanding your local network of health partners.  As mentioned the CCM is an important body for all decisions made about Global Fund grants in the country.  The CCM may also be in a position to inform you about the new Global Fund Climate fund, and see if they have applied for funding.\nAlso as promised, here is a useful overview of Gavi financing support in Madagascar. I note quite low implementation in the COVAX, Equity accelerator fund and \"Innovation top up\", not sure exactly what these are, but I will reach out to Gavi / Madagascar Senior Country Manager (one of my old colleagues ;) here in Geneva and find out a bit more, and let you know. \nHappy to discuss any of the above any time!\nWith thanks and best wishesLouiseLouise Leech, MPH | Head, Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Geneva, Switzerland | Tel: +41 79 343 1614| Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
