                        Name = "Email: Myanmar Earthquake",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-03-29").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Myanmar Earthquake",
                        Description = "To: Katarina.Zinn@sida.se; roger.m.karlsson@gov.se\nCC: naimoh@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Myanmar Earthquake\nBody:\nDear Katarina and Roger, \nFollowing the devastating 7.7-magnitude earthquake in Central Myanmar on 28 March, our team in Myanmar has activated our immediate response in coordination with the broader humanitarian community. The situation is critical, with widespread damage and urgent humanitarian needs.\n\nThanks to the generosity of our donors - including Sweden - we've released an initial US$10 million from the existing pot of funds to address immediate needs, including shelter, food, and medical assistance, as detailed in the attached Initial Situation Report. Further funding is crucial as needs are assessed.\n\nYour continued support is vital to our efforts. We are committed to transparency and will provide regular updates.\nI would be grateful for your help in transmitting my email to your relevant colleagues. \nI remain at your entire disposal for queries. \nBest regards,Asbjørn\n-- \n\nAsbjørn Brink| Head of Northern Europe Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | HQ | Copenhagen, Denmark | Tel: +45 40 80 36 54 | Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org",
