                new (
                    "00TQx00000Nj6dgMAB",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: RE: Connecting NNHF with UNOPS",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-04-06").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: RE: Connecting NNHF with UNOPS",
                        Description = "To: elenage@unops.org\nCC: annemariebenin@gmail.com; elenali@unops.org; smqy@novonordisk.com; louisel@unops.org; lymw@novonordisk.com; asbjornb@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: RE: Connecting NNHF with UNOPS\nBody:\nDear Elena,\n \nI am terribly sorry for my late reply. Let’s set up a meeting around mid-April, would 17th April or 22nd April anytime between 9am and 4pm CET suit you?\n \nKind regards,\nDenise\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDenise Brændgård\n\n\n\n\n\nGeneral Manager\n\n\n\n\n\nNovo Nordisk Haemophilia Foundation\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNovo Nordisk Haemophilia Foundation ǀ \n+41-797774384 (mobile) ǀ \ndeni@novonordisk.com \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Elena GEORGALLA <elenage@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Donnerstag, 27. Februar 2025 15:56\n\nTo: DENI (Denise Brændgård) <deni@novonordisk.com>\n\nCc: Louise LEECH <louisel@unops.org>; anne-marie schönemann <annemariebenin@gmail.com>; LYMW (Llyord Mwaniki) <lymw@novonordisk.com>; Elena LIBRINO <elenali@unops.org>; Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Connecting NNHF with UNOPS\n\n\n \n\nCaution: This email is from outside Novo Nordisk's system. Think before clicking links or opening attachments. Use\n PhishAlarm to report suspicious emails. \n\n \n\n\nDear Deni,  \n\n \n\n\nGreetings once more from UNOPS. We would love to pick up again the discussion we started late last year about possible collaboration with the Novo Nordisk Haemophilia Foundation drawing on the work UNOPS has done, particularly in Africa,\n on the construction and equipment of blood banks. \n\n\n \n\n\nWould there be a good time in the next few weeks to set up a brief call? \n\n\n \n\n\nBest wishes, \n\n\nElena \n\n\n \n\n\nOn Thu, Nov 14, 2024 at 4:51 PM DENI (Denise Brændgård) <deni@novonordisk.com> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Louise and Elena,\n \nThank you for your e-mails and sorry for the late response. I am based in Zurich and have travels coming up here in the next couple of\n weeks. I am happy to connect with you on a virtual call in the first week of December in the morning hours.\n \nBest wishes,\nDenise\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDenise Brændgård\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGeneral Manager\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNovo Nordisk Haemophilia Foundation\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNovo Nordisk Haemophilia Foundation ǀ  +41-797774384 (mobile) ǀ \nDENI@novonordisk.com \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: Louise\n LEECH <louisel@unops.org>\n\n\nSent: Dienstag, 12. November 2024 11:58\n\nTo: Elena GEORGALLA <elenage@unops.org>\n\nCc: DENI (Denise Brændgård) <deni@novonordisk.com>; anne-marie schönemann <annemariebenin@gmail.com>; LYMW (Llyord Mwaniki) <lymw@novonordisk.com>;\n Elena LIBRINO <elenali@unops.org>; Asbjorn BRINK <asbjornb@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Re: Connecting NNHF with UNOPS\n\n\n \n\n\nCaution: This email is from outside Novo Nordisk's system. Think before clicking links or opening attachments. Use PhishAlarm to report suspicious emails.\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nDear Elena\n\n\nThanks for the connection, I am actually not at COP29, but organising a panel remotely (whatever possessed me?!!)\n\n\n \n\n\nDear Denise, happy to meet any time next week, or this week except friday\n\n\nlooking forward to it!\n\n\nbest wishes\n\n\nlouise\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\nLouise Leech, MPH  | Head of Geneva Liaison Office | Partnerships and Liaison Group | Mobile: +41 79 343 1614  \n\n\nUNOPS / Office des Nations Unies pour les Services Unité de Gestion du Projet\n\n\nGlobal project overview here  |  Follow\n us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Instagram, YouTube \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n\nOn Tue, 12 Nov 2024 at 08:50, Elena GEORGALLA <elenage@unops.org> wrote:\n\n\n\nDear Denise, \n\n\n \n\n\nIt's a great pleasure to be connected. \n\n\n \n\n\nWe would be interested in a broader conversation with NNHF beyond Somalia. UNOPS is already collaborating with Novo Nordisk AS in Ukraine, providing medical assistance to the Mykolaiv\n region predominantly through the set up of blood stations.\n\n\n \n\n\nI understand from Anne-Marie that you are based in Geneva. Our global health liaison officer, Louise Leech, is based there and I know she would very much welcome the opportunity\n to meet. She's at COP29 this week but I wonder if you might be available for a meeting with her the following week or later this month? \n\n\n \n\n\nBest regards, \n\n\nElena \n\n \n\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n\nOn Mon, Nov 11, 2024 at 3:07 PM DENI (Denise Brændgård) <deni@novonordisk.com>\n wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\nDear Anne-Marie,\n \nThank you very much for thinking of us and connecting us with Elena from UNOPS. We have so far not supported projects in Somalia and\n would be happy to be in contact with Elena when we receive a request for a project from an organization in Somalia.\n \nWishing you a very nice day ahead.\n \nKind regards,\nDenise\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDenise Brændgård\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGeneral Manager\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNovo Nordisk Haemophilia Foundation\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNovo Nordisk Haemophilia Foundation ǀ  +41-797774384 (mobile) ǀ \nDENI@novonordisk.com \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nFrom: anne-marie\n schönemann <annemariebenin@gmail.com>\n\n\nSent: Montag, 11. November 2024 07:21\n\nTo: DENI (Denise Brændgård) <deni@novonordisk.com>; LYMW (Llyord Mwaniki) <lymw@novonordisk.com>\n\nCc: Elena GEORGALLA <elenage@unops.org>\n\nSubject: Connecting NNHF with UNOPS\n\n\n \n\n\n\nCaution: This email is from outside Novo Nordisk's system. Think before clicking links or opening attachments. Use PhishAlarm to report suspicious emails.\n\n\n \n\nDear Denise and Llyord, \n\n\nI hope this email find you both very well.\n\n\n \n\nLast Thursday, I attended an event at UNOPS, where I learned about the impressive blood bank they've established in Somalia. \nGiven the recent leadership forum, I thought it would be valuable for you to connect with Elena (copied here).\nI've attached two project fact sheets: one on the Blood Bank in Somalia and the other detailing UNOPS' work in health.\n\nIt seems to me that you may have some shared interests. \n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\nKind regards from Anne-Marie in Nairobi\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n--\n\n\n\n\nElena Georgalla\n| Partnerships Specialist | Africa Regional Office | Nairobi, Kenya | Tel: +254 700035033|\nwww.unops.org",
