                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-04-11").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: TA at the local level -anti-corruption and sanctions checks for EIB programmes",
                        Description = "To: k.dorfler@eib.org; g.gajda@eib.org; p.novak@eib.org; eleneag@unops.org; valentynp@unops.org; marysiaz@unops.org; arunn@unops.org; massimodi@unops.org; o.remiga@eib.org\nCC: \nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: TA at the local level -anti-corruption and sanctions checks for EIB programmes\nBody:\nCorporate Use\n\n\n\n\n\nDear all, \n\n\n\nApologies, but I am already on leave. I hope you have a fruitful discussion and hope to catch up after the festive season. \n\n\n\nWarm regards,\nKristina \n\n\n\nSent from Outlook for iOS\n\nFrom: REMIGA Oksana Victorovna\n\nSent: Friday, April 4, 2025 7:33:58 PM\n\nTo: REMIGA Oksana Victorovna <o.remiga@eib.org>; DÖRFLER Kamil <k.dorfler@eib.org>; GAJDA Grzegorz <g.gajda@eib.org>; NOVAK Pavel <p.novak@eib.org>; Elene AGLADZE <eleneag@unops.org>; Valentyn POVROZNYUK <valentynp@unops.org>; marysiaz@unops.org <marysiaz@unops.org>;\n arunn@unops.org <arunn@unops.org>; Massimo DIANA <massimodi@unops.org>; MIKULOVA Kristina <k.mikulova@eib.org>\n\nSubject: TA at the local level -anti-corruption and sanctions checks for EIB programmes\n\nWhen: Friday, 11 April 2025 12:00-13:00.\n\nWhere: Microsoft Teams Meeting\n \n\n\n\n\n\nDear All\n \nPlease, kindly confirm if the proposed time fits your agenda\n \nKind regards\n \nOksana\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\nMicrosoft Teams\n\nNeed help? \n\n\nJoin\n the meeting now \n\n\nMeeting ID:\n370 540 746 919\n\n\n\nPasscode:\nZz9zD9ur\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDial in by phone\n\n\n\n+352 27 87 12 26,,673879210#\nLuxembourg, All locations\n\n\n\nFind\n a local number \n\n\n\nPhone conference ID:\n673 879 210#\n\n\n\nJoin on a video conferencing device\n\n\n\nTenant key:\neibconference@m.webex.com\n\n\n\nVideo ID:\n123 780 185 1\n\n\n\nMore\n info \n\n\nFor organizers:\nMeeting\n options |\n\nReset dial-in PIN \n\n\n\n________________________________________________________________________________\n\n\n \n\nConsider treating this e-mail only during your business hours. The EIB Group supports your right\n to disconnect.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nLes informations contenues dans ce message et/ou ses annexes sont \n\nreservees a l'attention et a l'utilisation de leur destinataire et peuvent etre \n\nconfidentielles. Si vous n'etes pas destinataire de ce message, vous etes \n\ninformes que vous l'avez recu par erreur et que toute utilisation en est \n\ninterdite. Dans ce cas, vous etes pries de le detruire et d'en informer la \n\nBanque Europeenne d'Investissement.\n\nThe information in this message and/or attachments is intended solely for \n\nthe attention and use of the named addressee and may be confidential. If \n\nyou are not the intended recipient, you are hereby notified that you have \n\nreceived this transmittal in error and that any use of it is prohibited. In \n\nsuch a case please delete this message and kindly notify the European \n\nInvestment Bank accordingly.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------",
