                    "00TQx00000Pyt3FMAR",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: UNOPS | Procurement WASCO Dominica",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-06-03").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: UNOPS | Procurement WASCO Dominica",
                        Description = "To: n.lesprit@dowasco.dm\nCC: zayid.alleyne@caribank.org; naomi.akoy@caribank.org; o.mosos@dowasco.dm; jean-vincentc@unops.org; williamsg@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: UNOPS | Procurement WASCO Dominica\nBody:\nDear Neil, \nThank you for your fast response. \nPlease see attached a Due Diligence Questionnaire to be filled by the DOWASCO team. This is standard procedure as it will be the first time that our organizations will enter into an agreement. Once completed and signed, please send it back to me. \nDo not hesitate to contact me if you have any questions. I am also available on whatsapp on +506 7071 1351.\nBest, \nAntoine\nOn Tue, Jun 3, 2025 at 11:07 AM <n.lesprit@dowasco.dm> wrote:\nMr. Luste, Indeed, the meeting was fruitful. As discussed, please find attached specifications for 4X4 Pickup Trucks. Regards,Neil Neil Lenin Esprit B.Sc. Civ. Eng.Project Engineer PROJECT MANAGEMENT UNITRawles Lane,Goodwill,Roseau, Dominica E-mail: n.lesprit@dowasco.dm  Tel:  (767) 440-9346| Cell: (767) 275-1142   DOWASCO: Our Water, Our Treasure, Our Life!   From: Antoine LUST <antoinel@unops.org> \nSent: Tuesday, June 3, 2025 10:54 AM\nTo: naomi.akoy@caribank.org\nCc: n.lesprit@dowasco.dm; o.mosos@dowasco.dm; zayid.alleyne@caribank.org; Jean-Vincent COLIN COMBEPINE <jean-vincentc@unops.org>; William SQUIER GONZALEZ <williamsg@unops.org>\nSubject: UNOPS | Procurement WASCO Dominica Dear Naomi and colleagues,  It was a pleasure discussing with you today.  I am writing to consolidate the space for information exchange. Please share with us the list of goods to be produced.  In the meantime, we will start working on the documents for the legal agreements.  Kind regards, Antoine --Antoine Lust | Partnerships Specialist and Liaison | Multi-Country Office Caribbean, Costa Rica and Panama| San José, Costa Rica| Tel: +506 7075 1351 | Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org",
