                ),
                new (
                    "00TQx00000RjlT9MAJ",
                    new UNOPSInteraction
                    {
                        Name = "Email: Re: Link for videoconference - No goggle",
                        Type = InteractionType.Email,
                        Date = DateTime.Parse("2025-07-16").ToUniversalTime(),
                        Subject = "Email: Re: Link for videoconference - No goggle",
                        Description = "To: martina@unops.org\nCC: amandas@unops.org; isabelle.ziegler@dreamsantegidio.net; giovanni.guidotti@dreamsantegidio.net; cesare.cuttica@esteri.it; giulia.degennaro@esteri.it; Roberto.Mengoni@esteri.it; rainerf@unops.org; tegistm@unops.org\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Link for videoconference - No goggle\nBody:\nDear colleagues, \nThank you for the meeting earlier today\nPlease find the agreed action points :\n1. CSE to share with UNOPS the new procurement list for review2. UNOPS to organise a follow-up technical meeting with CSE; the objective is to understand the present procurement procedures per country, opportunities and bottlenecks; understand CSE's legal status per country and relationship with respective Ministries of Health. 3. UNOPS to research further on the regulatory procedures and standards for pharmaceutical procurement/tax/ customs obligations per country4. Martin to confirm meeting between UNOPS Legal Officer and Italian MOFA Legal Officer, tentatively set for 31st July 5. UNOPS to communicate the estimated cost for the project preparation technical advisory (no of days required for a technical expert and overall cost). These costs will be subsequently included in the project budget as part of direct costs. 6. UNOPS to prepare and submit a project concept note \nWe look forward to receiving the procurement list and the information on CSE legal status per country ( clinic locations would also be helpful) and the linkage with the MoH.\nWe can then plan the technical meeting after we receive these documents \nKind regards,Emma \n\nEmma Akinyi | Partnership Specialist  | Partnership Development Office | East and Southern Africa | Nairobi, Kenya | Tel: +254 (0)20 762 1613 | Mob: +254 715 914362 | Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\nOn Wed, Jul 16, 2025 at 1:21 PM Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org> wrote:\nA schematic draw of the process.\nMartín Arévalo de León | Representative and Head | Partnerships & Liaisons Group | Rome Liaison Office | Rome, Italy | Cel +39 344 778 3550 | www.unops.org Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\nOn Wed, Jul 16, 2025 at 12:19 PM Emma AKINYI <emmaak@unops.org> wrote:\nHello all, Please find draft RACI \nKind regards,Emma Emma Akinyi | Partnership Specialist  | Partnership Development Office | East and Southern Africa | Nairobi, Kenya | Tel: +254 (0)20 762 1613 | Mob: +254 715 914362 | Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\nOn Wed, Jul 16, 2025 at 1:06 PM Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org> wrote:\nHere is the link sent by Roberto et al.\nhttps://maeci.webex.com/wbxmjs/joinservice/sites/maeci/meeting/download/24f6202990c242ef94432a3037b984b5?siteurl=maeci&MTID=m873edbc7c22c5da789ce6650203c6445\n\n.Martín Arévalo de León | Representative and Head | Partnerships & Liaisons Group | Rome Liaison Office | Rome, Italy | Cel +39 344 778 3550 | www.unops.org Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\nOn Wed, Jul 16, 2025 at 12:04 PM Martin AREVALO <martina@unops.org> wrote:\nPlease send it responding this message as everyone else participating is copied here.\nMartín Arévalo de León | Representative and Head | Partnerships & Liaisons Group | Rome Liaison Office | Rome, Italy | Cel +39 344 778 3550 | www.unops.org Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\nOn Wed, Jul 16, 2025 at 12:02 PM Mengoni Roberto <Roberto.Mengoni@esteri.it> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear all, we will send you a link on Webex because we cannot use googlemeet in our PCs.\nSorry about that\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nRoberto Mengoni\nConsigliere d’Ambasciata\nCapo Ufficio IV (Africa)\n\nDirezione Generale per la Cooperazione allo Sviluppo\n\n \nMinistero degli Affari Esteri\ne della Cooperazione Internazionale\nPiazzale della Farnesina, 1 – 00135 Roma\nwww.esteri.it\n\n \nT +39 06 3691 5784\nC +39 392 6425258",
