                        Subject = "Email: Re: Barbados Contacts Handover of UNOPS ca FILE",
                        Description = "To: Rajesh.MAJEED@eeas.europa.eu\nCC: juanca@unops.org; Chiara.TARDIVO@ec.europa.eu; giuseppem@unops.org; antoinel@unops.org; Joan.NADAL-SASTRE@eeas.europa.eu; Deslin.CRONEY@eeas.europa.eu\nBCC: \nAttachment: --none--\n\nSubject: Re: Barbados Contacts Handover of UNOPS ca FILE\nBody:\nDear Rajesh,\nThank you for this email, the information is well received.\nOn behalf of the UNOPS team working in the Caribbean, I take this opportunity to thank you for your important contribution of the past months and wish you all the best in your future endeavors.\nKind regards\nWilliam SQUIER GONZALEZ\nHead of Programme | ICMCO | LCR\nSan Jose, Costa Rica | Tel: +506 8337 9154Follow us on social media and subscribe to our newsletter. | www.unops.org\n\nOn Tue, Jul 29, 2025 at 2:14 PM MAJEED Rajesh (EEAS-GEORGETOWN) <Rajesh.MAJEED@eeas.europa.eu> wrote:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDear William,\nAs discussed this morning ,please see below the main contact persons for Barbados Delegation with whom you will be in contact effective 1\n September 2025.\nUntil 1 September 2025 ,all contract matters should be addressed to Mr Joan Nadal Sastre.\n\n \n1.     \nDavid Mogollon , Head of Cooperation – email address:\nDavid.MOGOLLON@eeas.europa.eu\n2.     \nChiara Tardivo – Team leader  - email address:\nChiara.TARDIVO@ec.europa.eu\n3.     \nMariana Arias – Program Manager- email address:\nMariana.ARIAS@eeas.europa.eu\n4.     \nNuno Vieira Pinto E Silva  - Program Manager - email address:\nNuno.VIEIRA-PINTO-E-SILVA@eeas.europa.eu\n\n \nAll for your information and guidance.\n \n\nRajesh Majeed (Mr.)\nProgramme/Policy Manager\nCooperation Section\nDelegation\n of the European Union to Guyana, for Suriname and with responsibility for Aruba, Bonaire, Curaçao, Saba, St Barthelemy, St Eustatius and St Maarten\n\n11 Sendall Place, Georgetown, Guyana\nContacts: (+592) 226-4004 ext 2112 |\nrajesh.majeed@eeas.europa.eu\nhttp://www.eeas.europa.eu/delegations/guyana",
                        Location = null,
                        GmailThreadId = null,
                        GmailMessageId = "00TQx00000SCd2NMAT",
                        EmailAddresses = new List<string> { "chiara.tardivo@ec.europa.eu", "giuseppem@unops.org", "rajesh.majeed@eeas.europa.eu", "deslin.croney@eeas.europa.eu", "nuno.vieira-pinto-e-silva@eeas.europa.eu", "joan.nadal-sastre@eeas.europa.eu", "mariana.arias@eeas.europa.eu", "david.mogollon@eeas.europa.eu", "juanca@unops.org", "antoinel@unops.org" },
